<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Tonga Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Lukku</para>
  <para style="toc1">Makani Mabotu Mbuli Mbwakalembwa aLukku</para>
  <para style="toc2">Lukku</para>
  <para style="toc3">Luk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Makani Mabotu Akalembwa a</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUKKU</para>
  <para style="imt">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Makani Mabotu akalembwa aLukku </char> Ngamwi mumabbuku aane Muchizuminano Chipya apandulula buumi bwaJesu Kkirisitu. Limwi alimwi lyiitwa kuti, “Makani Mabotu.” Akalembwa Jesu kaali wafwa aMateyu, Makko, Lukku aJoni. <char style="bk">Lukku </char> takalemba atala abuumi bwaJesu abulikke, pesi wakalemba lubo atala azyoonse eezyo basikwiiya baJesu nzibakachita nakafwa alimwi nakabuka, eli bbuku litegwa Inchito zyabatumwa. Takukwe uzi kasimpe atala achiindi aayo Makani Mabotu akalembwa mukwiinda muli <char style="bk">Lukku </char> nikuba ooko nkwaka kwalembela, pesi basikufunkununa bakazuminana kuti akalembwa kumunyaka ilimakumi alimusanu amakumi aabili kuzwa nakafwa Jesu. Mulembi ngu <char style="bk">Lukku </char> ooyu wakali musilisyi. Inzila yakwe yakulemba alimwi amulaka ngwabelesya ututondezya kuti wakali mwaalumi uyide. <char style="bk">Lukku </char> wakalikuyanda kulemba kasimpe kini atala abuumi bwaJesu, kali kawaamba munzila mbuzyakachitika, kuchitila kuti bamwi bagwasyigwe mukwabala aaya mabbuku (Lukku 1:1-4). Takali muJuda pe (Ba Kkolose 4:10-14). Alimwi wakalemba munzila eeyo baJuda njibatakali kuno konzya pe kumvwisisisya. Ezi zilaliboniya antanganana munzila njapandulula aayo chiyanza chabaJuda (Lukku 1:8). Makani Mabotu mukwiinda muli <char style="bk">Lukku </char> akozyaniya abbuku lwaMateyu alwaMakko, nkaambo apandulula zintu zikozyeniye amunzila ikonzyeniye. Akati kamabbuku aatatu, <char style="bk">Lukku</char> upa zinikide atala akuzyalwa kwaJoni muBbapatizi. <char style="bk">Lukku</char> alubo ulasinizya atala akulekelelwa (chandano Lukku 3:3, 11:4, 17:3-4, 23:34, 24:47) alimwi akukomba (chaandano Lukku 3:21, 5:16, 6:12, 11:1-12, 22:32).</para>
  <para style="iot">Bwiime:</para>
  <para style="io1">Manjililo Muchandano (Lukku 1:1-4)</para>
  <para style="io1">Lukku utalika kunjizya Makani Mabotu alimwi ulabupanduluzi kuti nkaamboonzi nakaawalemba.</para>
  <para style="io1">Eelyo ulungununa atala akuzyalwa kwa Jesu anzila mbwaakabaambilwa kumulimu (Lukku 1:5—4:13)</para>
  <para style="io1">Nkaambo chipanzi chipati chaMakani Mabotu (Lukku 4:14—21:38), Lukku utwaambila atala amulimu eeyo Jesu njakachita, kapati zigambyo nzyakachita azintu nzyakayiisya.</para>
  <para style="io1">Chakumaninizya, muzyandano ziibili zyakumamanino (Lukku 22:1—24:53) ulungununa inzila Jesu njakafwa ayo, akuzikkwa kwakwe, akubuka kuzwa kubafu.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s">Manjililo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Nuulemekezegwa Tiyofelasi, mbuli bayingi mbubakalipeda ambubakalemba makani azintu munzila yeelede zyakachitika akati kesu, <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 1:1">1 Jn 1:1</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:21">Inch 1:21</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 2:3">Hebb 2:3</ref>.</char></note> bakalemba eezyo nzibakaambilwa abakamboni bamakani aaya kuzwa kumatalikilo alimwi abakambawusi bajwi eeli, <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:3. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 1:1">Inch 1:1</ref>.</char></note> ndazibona kazili zibotu lubo kulindime kuti ndikulembele aaya makani munzila yeelede, nkaambo kakutobelezya oobotu zyoonse zintu kuzwa kumatalikilo, nuyandwa Tiyofelasi <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:31">Jn 20:31</ref>.</char></note> kuchitila kuti uzibe kasimpe atala azintu eezi nzimwakayisigwa.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzyalwa KwaJoni MuBbapatizi Mbukupandululwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:5. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 2:1">Mat 2:1</ref>; <ref loc="1CH 24:10">1 Mak 24:10</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 31:2">2 Mak 31:2</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mumazuba Herodi naakali mwami waJudiya, kwaakali mupayizi izina lwakwe wakali Zakkariya, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:5. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Girikki </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Zakkariya</char></note> wakali wamukowa waAbbija; alimwi Zakkariya wakalijisi mukayintu izina lyakwe wakali Elizabbeti, wakali mwana waAroni. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />Aaba babili bakaliluleme kuli Leza, kabeenda kabatakwe kampenda amumalayilile woonse aMwami. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Pesi teebakalijisi mwana, nkaambo mukayintu wakwe Elizabbeti wakali ngomwa, aaba babili bakali bachembala.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Lino muchiindi Zakkariya naakali kubeleka mumulimu wabupayizi kunembo lyaLeza aawo inkamu yakwe niyakali amulimu, <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />mbuli muchiyanza chamulimu wabupayizi, wakali kunjila muŋanda yaMwami mulimu wakwe wakali wakuumpilizya tununkilizyo achipayililo. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Alimwi inkamu yabantu yakali kukomba aanze mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza muchiindi chakuumpa tununkilizyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 2:9">Luk 2:9</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 5:19">Inch 5:19</ref>.</char></note> Mpawawo kwakaliboniya mpaakalibede mungelo waMwami, kayimvwi kulubazu lwakululyo lwachipayililo chatununkilizyo. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Mpawo Zakkariya naakabona mungelo, zyakamukatazya alimwi wakazula kuyoowa. <verse eid="LUK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:13. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 1:30">Luk 1:30</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 1:60">60</ref>.</char></note>Pesi mungelo wakati, “Zakkariya, utayoowi! Nkaambo kukomba kwako Leza wakumvwa, alimwi mwanakazi wako Elizabbeti uyootumbuka mwana mulombe, uyoomulika<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:13. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kuuzika nikuba kuunika</char></note> zina lyaJoni. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Alimwi uyooba alukondo akubotelwa, mpawo bantu bayingi bayoobotelwa kukutumbukwa kwakwe; <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="NUM 6:3">My 6:3</ref>.</char></note> nkaambo uyooba mupati kunembo lyaMwami, alimwi takwe kuyoonywa nikuba chikola, mpawo inguzu zyaMuuya Usalala ziyooba alinguwe, nikuba kuzwa mwida lyabayina. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Alimwi uyoopilusya bantu bayingi babana baIzirayeli kuMwami Leza wabo, <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />alimwi uyoomuzulwida muMuuya amunguzu zyaElayija, kusandula myoyo yamawisi kubana, abataswiilili kubusongo bwabaluleme, kubambila bantu kuza kwaMwami.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:18. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 1:34">Luk 1:34</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi Zakkariya wakati kumungelo, “Ndilakuziziba biyeni eezi? Nkaambo ime ndachembala alimwi mwanakazi wangu wayindilila muminyaka.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:19. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DAN 8:16">Dan 8:16</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 9:21">9:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:10">Mat 18:10</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mpawo mungelo, wakamuvwiila wati, “Ndime Gabburiyeli, wiimikila kubusyu bwaLeza; alimwi ndakatumwa kuti ndizokwaambile, akukweetela makani mabotu aaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />Alimwi laanga, uyooba chimuumu takukwe nutakakonzye pe kwaambuula mane kubuzuba oobo zintu eezi mpuziyo zuzikizigwa, nkaambo teewakasyoma majwi angu, aayo ayoozuzikizigwa muchiindi chawo.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Alimwi bantu bakalindila Zakkariya, mpawo bakagamba kuti nkaamboonzi Zakkariya kunonoka muŋanda yaLeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />Mpawo naakazwa anze, takukwe naakakonzya kwaambuula aabo pe, alimwi bakabonaanga wabona chilengano muŋanda yaLeza; mpawo wakachita zitondezyo kulimbabo alimwi wakakkala kali chimuumu.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Alimwi chiindi chamulimu wakwe nichakazulila, wakabweeda kumunzi wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Naakayinda mazuba aayo Elizabbeti mukayintu wakwe wakamita, alimwi wakayuba kwamyeezi ilimusanu, <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />kaamba kuti, “Mwami nzyakandichitila mumazuba aayo naakandicheba, kuti agwisye masampu angu akati kabantu.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzyala Kwa Jesu Mbukupandululwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Mumweezi wamusanu awumwi wakumita kwaElizabati mungelo Gabburiyeli wakatumwa aLeza kuya chisi chaGalili chitegwa Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />Mungelo wakatumwa kuli nakalindu wakali watangilwa kumwaalumi utegwa Jozefu, waŋanda yaDevidi; izina lya nakalindu wakali kutegwa Meri. <verse eid="LUK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Mpawo wakaza kuli nguwe alimwi wati, “Luumuno lube anduwe, ulaachoolwe kapati, Mwami ulaanduwe!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />Pesi wakalikatazya kapati kumakani aakwe, mpawo wakalilya mumizeezo yakwe wati nkujuzya kuli biyeni ooku. <verse eid="LUK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />Alimwi mungelo wakati kulinguwe, “Utayoowi, Meri, nkaambo wajana choolwe kuli Leza. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Alimwi laanga, uyoomita mubula bwako alimwi uyootumbuka mwana mulombe, nguyoowulika zina lyaJesu. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Uyooba mupati, alimwi uyootegwa Mwana Mulombe waSijulu waMajulu, alimwi Mwami Leza uyoomupa chuuno chabwami bwawisi Devidi, <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />mpawo uyooyendelezya kuŋada yaJakkobbu kwalyoonse; abwami bwakwe butakwe kuyoomana.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Mpawo Meri wakati kuli mungelo, “Eechi ngachiyooba biyeni, mbukunga ndilinakalindu?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />Mpawo mungelo wakati kulinguwe, “Muuya Usalala uyooseluka alinduwe, anguzu zyaSijulu waMajulu ziyokuvumba; nkikaako mwana uyootumbukwa uyootegwa ulasalala, Mwana waLeza. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Alimwi laanga, munakwanu Elizabbeti mubuchembele bwakwe alakwe ulimitide mwana mulombe; alimwi ooyu mweezi wamusanu awumwi ooyo wakali kutegwa ningomwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Nkaambo aLeza takukwe nchaamba chikachila pe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Mpawo Meri wakati, “Laanga, ndilimulanda waMwami; ngakube kulindime mbuli kujwi lyako.” Mpawo mungelo wakeenda kuzwa kulinguwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Meri Mbwaakaswaya Elizabbeti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Mumazuba aayo Meri wakabuka chakufwambana waya kunyika ya muchilundu, kumuunzi waJuda, <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />alimwi wakanjila muŋada yaZakkariya, mpawo wajuzya Elizabbeti. <verse eid="LUK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Mpawo Elizabbeti naakajuzya Meri, wakamvwa mwana mwida wasobana; mpawo Elizabbeti wakazuzigwa aMuuya Usalala <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />alimwi wakoompolola ajwi pati, “Ulaachoolwe akati kabanakazi, amwana nguyoozyala! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Alimwi chambaanzi eechi kulindime kuti banyina aMwami wangu bandiswaye? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Nkikaako laanga, muchiindi nindamvwa kujuzigwa, mwana wangu wasobana mubula chakukondwa. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Alimwi ulaachoolwe mwanakazi ooyo usyoma kuti kuyooba kuzuzikizigwa kwazeezyo Mwami nzyakamwaambila.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lwiimbo LwaMeri Lwakutembawula</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Mpawo Meri wakamba wati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Muuya wangu awutembawule Mwami;<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />alimwi muuya wangu wakondwa muli Leza Mufutuli wangu,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />nkaambo wasumpula mulanda wakwe ulifwiinsya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:48">Nkaambo laanga kuzwa lino mazyalani woonse ayoondiita kuti ulaachoolwe;<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />nkaambo ooyo Singuzu wandichitila zintu zipati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:49">alimwi lila salala izina lyakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Alimwi luse lwakwe luli alibaabo bamuyoowa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">kuzwa kumazyalani amazyalani.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Wakatondezya nguzu muluboko lwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">wakasansaniya balisumpula mumiyeeyo yamyoyo yabo,<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />waselusya aansi chuuno chabwami chabeendelezi aabo bajisi nguzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">wasumpula balangilwa aansi;<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />ukkutya basinzala azintu zibotu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">abavubi wabatanda kabatakwe chintu pe.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Wagwasya mulanda wakwe Izirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">mukuyeeya luse lwakwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />mbuli mbwakaambula kumataata eesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:55">kuli Abburahamu akulunyungu lwakwe kwalyoonse.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />Alimwi Meri wakachaala wakkala aElizabbeti kwamyeezi itatu, mpawo wakabweeda kumuunzi wakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzyalwa KwaJoni muBbapatizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Lino chiindi cha Elizabbeti chakutumbuka nichakazulila, wakatumbuka mwana mulombe. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Alimwi mbakayakilene aabo abanakwabo bakamvwa luse lupati Mwami ndwakamuchitila, mpawo bakakondwa aamwi anguwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:59. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 12:3">Lev 12:3</ref>; <ref loc="GEN 17:12">Matl 17:12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mpawo mubuzuba bwa musanu aatatu nibwakasika bakaza kukupalula mwana, alimwi mwana bakali bayanda kumuuzika izina lyawisi bakamuti nguZakkariya, <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Banyina bakavwiila bati, “Tee mbukubede pe; pesi ulategwa Joni.”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />Bakamwaambila bati, “Pesi kumukowa wanu, takukwe ulaazina lyamusyobo ooyu.” <verse eid="LUK 1:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />Bakaambula awisi kababelesya kutondeka aminwe kuchitila kuti wisi abape zina ndyayanda kupa mwana wakwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Wakakumbila chakulembela, mpawo wakalemba waamba wati, “Izina lyakwe nguJoni.” Boonse bakagamba. <verse eid="LUK 1:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Kuzwa aawo Zakkariya wakaasama mulomo wakwe alimwi lulimi lwakwe lwakaangunuka waambuula, mpawo wapa choolwe Leza. <verse eid="LUK 1:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Bayakilani boonse bakazula kuyoowa kupati mubusena bwakalundu muJudiya, alimwi impuwo yakazulila atala amakani aaya. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Nkabela boonse bakamvwa aaya makani bakaabamba mumyoyo yabo, bakati, “Mpoo ooyu mulombe uyobaanzi?” Nkaambo luboko lwaMwami luli alinguwe.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s">Businsimi bwaZakkariya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />Mpawo wisi Zakkariya wakalizwide aMuuya Usalala mpawo wakaamba eezyo Leza nzyaakayubununa kulinguwe wati,<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Alumbwe Mwami Leza waIzirayeli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">nkaambo watuswaya tubantu bakwe alimwi watunununa,<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />alimwi wabusya kwija kwalufutuko,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">kuzwa kulunyungu lwamulanda wakwe Devidi,<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />mbuli mbwakaamba mukwiinda kubasinsimi bakwe basalala kuzwa kuchiindi chakale,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />kuti tufutulwe kuzwa kuli basinkondoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">alimwi akunguzu zyabaabo batusulide;<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />wakati uzotondezya luse kuli bamataata besu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">mpawo akuyeeye chizuminano chakwe chisalala,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />achikonke nchaakakonka kuli Abburahamu taata wesu,<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />wakatusyomezya kuti iswe uyootuvuna kuzwa kuluboko lwabasinkondoma,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">kuti tukonzye kubeleka akukomba Leza chakutayoowa pe,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />kuti tweende mubusalali katululeme kubusyu bwakwe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:75">mazuba woonse abuumi bwesu.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />Lino anduwe, mwanaangu uyooba musinsimi waSijulu lyaMajulu;</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:76">nkaambo uyooba simwiinda nembo waMwami</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">kuti ukakukule inzila yakwe,<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />mpawo akape luzibo lwalufutuko kubantu bakwe</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">mukwiinda mukulekelelwa kwazibi zyabo,<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />mukwiinda muluse ndwakatutentwida lwaLeza wesu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:78">uyoochita kuti mumuni wakujulu ukatupaswide,<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />uyoopa mumuni kuli boonse bakkede mumudima amumunzwiide walufu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">kuzulwida mawulu eesu munzila yaluumuno.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />Lino mwana wakakomena muchiwa alimwi wakaba mukozu muMuuya, wakali munkanda kusikila mane mumazuba naakaliboniya antangalala kubantu baIzirayeli.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuzyalwa KwaJesu Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:18-25">Mateyu 1:18-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Mumazuba aayo Silutwe mupati wanyika yabaRoma, utegwa Agasitasi Siza wakapa malayilile, kuti kube kulembwa kwabantu boonse, munyika yoonse yabaRoma. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Ooku kwakali kulembwa kutaanzi kwakachitika. Aawo Kwiniriyasi naakali mweendelezi waSiriya. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />Alimwi boonse bakayinka umwi awumwi kukulembwa, kugunzi lyakwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Lino Jozefu wakeenda alubo kuzwa muGalili, muchisi chaNazareti, wakaya kuJudiya, kuchisi chaDevidi, chitegwa Bbetelehemu, nkaambo wakali waŋanda yamukowa waDevidi, <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />kuchitila kuti bakaakulembwe amwanakazi wakwe Meri, ngwakali watangila, mpawo wakali waamba kutumbuka. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Mpawo nibakachili nkukooko, chiindi chakazulila chakuti mwana atumbukwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Wakatumbuka mwana mutaanzi mulombe, wamuputila amudabba, wamulazika muchilyido chaŋombe nkaambo tekwakali busena muŋanda yabanakweenda.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Beembeli Abaangelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Alimwi mugundu eelyo kwakali beembeli bakali mumyuunda, kabalokulanga butanga bwabo mansiku. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />Alimwi mungelo waMwami wakaliboniya kulimbabo abulemu kwaMwami bwakabamwinikila; eelyo bakazula kuyoowa. <verse eid="LUK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Alimwi mungelo wakati kulimbaabo, “Mutabi akuyoowa! Amulange, ndamweetela makani mabotu alukondo lupati, atakabe kubantu boonse; <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />nkaambo mubuzuba obuno mwazyalilwa muchisi chaDevidi Mufutuli, nguKkirisitu utegwa Mwami! <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Alimwi eechi chiyooba chitondezyo kulindinywe; muyojana mwana kaputidwe, amudabba, kalede muchilyido chaŋombe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Mpawawo kwakali inkamu yabaangelo bakujulu yakaliboniya kiili aamwi amungelo mutaanzi kabatembawula Leza, kabati,<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Ngapegwe bulemu Leza simajulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">alimwi luumuno lube akati kabantu munyika akuli baabo mbabotelwa!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Eelyo baangelo nibakabweeda kujulu, beembeli bakaambilana bati “Katuya kuBbetelehemu tukaakubone chintu eechi chachitika, azeezi Mwami nzyatuyubunwida.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />Mpawo bakeenda chakufwambaana, alimwi bakajana Meri aJozefu, amwana kalede muchilyido chaŋombe. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Alimwi beembeli nibakabona bakalungununa kapati eezyo zyakaambulwa atala ayooyu mwana; <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />alimwi boonse bakamvwa bakagamba kuli zyakaambwa abeembeli. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Pesi Meri wakabamba aaya majwi woonse, kalokuzilikila mumoyo wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />Mpawo beembeli bakabweeda, kabalokulumbayizya akutembawula Leza atala azyoonse zintu nzibakamvwa akubona, mbuli mbubakaambilwa.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ulawulikwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />Alimwi mubuzuba bwamusanu aatatu, muchiindi chakupalulwa nichakazulila, wakategwa nguJesu, izina ndyaakawunikwa amungelo katanamitwa pe mwida.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Upedekezegwa Muŋanda yaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Mpawo nikwakasika chiindi chakusalazigwa kwabo mbuli kumulawu waMozesi, bakamweeta kuJerusalemu kuzomupeda kuMwami <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Kul 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>.</char></note> (mbuli mbukulembedwe mumulawu waMwami, “Woonse mwana mulombe mutaanzi ujula izyalilo uyootegwa ulasalala kuMwami”) <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />akupa chipo chachipayizyo mbuli mbuwaamba mulawu waMozesi, “inziba zibili naakuti itwana twankwilimba tubili.”<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Businsimi bwaSimiyoni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />Lino kwakali mwaalumi muJerusalemu, zina lwakwe wakali kutegwa Simiyoni, alimwi mwaalumi ooyu wakali musalali mpawo wakali lipedelede, inguzu zyaMuuya Usalala zyakali alinguwe, akuumbulizigwa kwaIzirayeli. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Alimwi chakayubununwa kulinguwe aMuuya Usalala kuti takoyoofwa pe katana kubona Mwami Mesiya ooyo wakasyomezegwa. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />Alimwi Simiyoni kazwide aMuuya Usalala wakanjila mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza; alimwi aawo bazyaali nibakamweeta mwana Jesu, kuti bamuchite mbuli chiyanza chamulawu, <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />Mpawo Simiyoni wakatumbatila mwana mumaboko mpawo wakalongezya Leza mpawo wati,<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Mwami, lino leka mulanda wako kuti</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">ayinde muluumuno, mukwiinda mujwi lyako;<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />nkaambo meso angu abona lufutuko lwako<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />oolo ndwakabamba kunembo lyabantu boonse,<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />mumuni wachiyubunuzyo kuli bantu batali baJuda pe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">alimwi abulemu kubantu bako baIzirayeli.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />Mpawo wisi abanyina bakagamba azyakaambwa anguwe; amakani aSimiyoni ngakaamba atala amwana. <verse eid="LUK 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Mpawo Simiyoni wakabalongezya mpawo wati kuli Meri banyina amwana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:34">“Laanga, ooyu mwana ulachoolwe akubambililwa kuwa akubuka kwabayingi muIzirayeli.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:34">Alimwi uyooba chitondezyo chiliikwambuulwa atala anguwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />(Alimwi kuusa kupati kuyooyasa muuya wako),</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 2:35">kuti mizeezo yamyoyo myiingi ikayubununwe.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Businsimi bwaAna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Alimwi kwakali mwanakazi musinsimi, zina lyakwe wakali kutegwa Ana, mwana waFanuweli, wamukowa waAsa; wakali wachembala kapati, kaliwapona amulumi wakwe kwaminyaka ilimusanu ayibili kuzwa kubunakalindu bwakwe, <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />mpawo kali mukamufu kwaminyaka ilimakumi alimusanu aatatu alaminyaka iine. Taakwe naakazwa pe mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza, wakatembawula kalyiimya akukomba mansinku asikati. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Mpawo wakasika achiindi nchinchecho wapakulumba kuli Leza, mpawo waambuula atala anguwe kuli boonse bakalaabulangilizi bwakunununwa kwaJerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubweda kwaJesu KuNazareti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Alimwi Jozefu aMeri nibakamana kuchita zyoonse zyakaleelede mbuli mulawu waMwami, bakabweeda kuGalili kuchisi chabo chitegwa Nazareti. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />Lino mwana wakakomena alimwi wakaba mukozu, kazwide busongo; alimwi achoolwe chaLeza chakali alinguwe.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Mulombe Jesu Kalimulubuwa Lwaŋanda yaLeza</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Lino bazyali bakwe bakali kwiinka kuJerusalemu minyaka yoonse kupobwe lyakwiindilila lyabaJuda. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Mpawo naakasisya minyaka ilikkumi ayibili, bakayinka kupobwe mbuli muchiyanza chabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Alimwi nilyakamana pobwe, aawo bazyali bakwe nibakali kuyabubweeda, mwana mulombe Jesu wakachaala musule muJerusalemu. Bazyali bakwe tebakaziziba pe. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Pesi bakali kuyeeya kuti balaamwi, bakeenda lweendo lwabuzuba bumwi. Mpawo bakamuyanduula koonse akati kababunyina abeenzunyina. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Nibakamubula, bakabweeda kuJerusalemu, kabamuyanduula. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />Nikwakayinda mazuba aatatu bakamujana mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza, kakkede akati kabayiisi, kali kubaswiilizya akubabuzya mibuzyo. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Mpawo boonse bakamumvwa bakagamba kukumvwisisisya kwakwe ansandulo zyakwe. <verse eid="LUK 2:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Alimwi nibakabona, bakagamba; mpawo banyina bakati kulinguwe, “Mwanaangu, nkaamboonzi niwatupenzya oobu? Laanga, wuso andime twalikukuyanduula loko.”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />Mpawo Jesu wakabuzya wati, “Nkaamboonzi nimundiyanduula? Tamuzi na kuti ndeleede kuba muŋanda yaTaata?” <verse eid="LUK 2:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Alimwi bazyali bakwe tebakaamvwisisisya pe nzyakali kwaamba kulimbabo.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Alimwi wakeenda aabo mpawo baya kuNazareti, alimwi wakalibombya kulimbabo; mpawo banyina bakabamba majwi woonse mumoyo wabo. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />Alimwi Jesu wakakomena mubusongo amuchiimo amuchoolwe kuliLeza akubantu.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s">Kukambawuka KwaJoni MuBbapatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mateyu 3:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:1-8">Makko 1:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Joni 1:19-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Mumunyaka wakkumi amusanu wabweendelezi bwaTibberiyasi Siza, alimwi Pontiyasi Payileti kali mweendelezi waJudiya, mpawo Herodi kali mwami wagundu lyaGalili, amukulana wakwe Filipu kali mwami wagundu lyaIturaliya aTarakkonitisi, aLayisaniyasi kabali mwami waAbbilene, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />muchiindi Anasi aKkeyifasi kabali bapayizi bapati Leza wakaambuula kuli Joni mwana mulombe waZakkariya aawo Joni kali munkanda. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />Mpawo Joni wakeenda masena woonse ali Jorodani, kayabukambawuka kuti bantu basanduke mpawo babbapatizigwe kuchitila kuti Leza abalekelele zibi zyabo. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Mbuli mbukulembedwe mubbuku lyamusinsimi Ayizaya, kuti</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ijwi lyayooyo woompolola munkanda kati:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Amubambe inzila yaMwami;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">amululamike tuzila twakwe! <verse eid="LUK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Masena woonse ayooyelana,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">alimwi zilundu zyoonse atulundu ziyoofwiinsigwa,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">alimwi zipilingene ziyolulamikwa,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">anzila zilamakombakomba ziyootandabala;<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />alimwi bantu boonse bayoobona lufutuko lwaLeza.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />Nkikaako wakati kumakamu akaza kukubbapatizigwa anguwe, wakati, “Inywe nubana bachipile! Ngwani wamuchenjezya kuchija bukali bulokuza? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Amuzyale michelo itondeezya kusanduka, alimwi mutani kulyaamba kuti, ‘uli aAbburahamu mbuli taata wesu.’ Nkaambo ndamwaambila kuti, Leza ulakonzya kuli aaya mabwe kuti alenge bana kuli Abburahamu. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Nikuba lino kaleba kalibambidwe kale kumiyanda yamisamu; nkikaako kufumbwa musamu utazyali muchelo mubotu ulagonkelwa aansi mpawo akuwalilwa mumulilo.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />Lino nkamu yakabuzya kulinguwe yati, “Mpoo tuchiteenzi?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />Alimwi wakabavwiila wati, “Ooyu ujisi zisamo zibili, ngaabile ooyu utajisi pe; alimwi ooyu ujisi chakulya weelede kuchita oobo alakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Alabo basimutelo bakaza kukubbapatizigwa, mpawo bakati kulinguwe, “Muyiisi, tuchite nzi?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Alimwi wakati kulimbaabo, “Mutabwezi lubo mweelo windilide.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Basilumamba abalabo bakabuzya bati, “Ani iswe tuchite biyeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">Alimwi wakati kulimbabo, “Mutanyanzyi naba uumwi changuzu, nikuba akubapa mulandu, ngamukkutikane ampindu yanu njimujana.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />Mbuli kuti bantu bakali mubulangilizi, mpawo bantu boonse akulibuzya mumyoyo yabo atala aJoni, anteni ngunguwe Kkirisitu, <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Joni wakabavwiila boonse wati, “Ndimubbapatizya ameenda; pesi ooyo usalala kwiinda ndime ulaza, ooyo ngunditajisi cheelelo chakwangununa twaanzyo twansangu zyakwe; uyoomubbapatizya aMuuya Usalala amulilo. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Chisuwo chakwe chakupupuluzya chilimumaboko aakwe, kuti apupulule alubuwa mpawo abbeete, akubungika zilyo mubutala bwakwe, pesi buungu uyoobuumpa amulilo utamani.”<verse eid="LUK 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Aboobo, akusungwazya kumwi kwiingi, wakakambawuka makani mabotu kubantu. <verse eid="LUK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />Pesi Herodi mweendelezi, wakali wakabulwa anguwe ankaambo kaHerodiyasi, mwanakazi wamukulana wakwe, alimwi ankaambo kabubi boonse oobo bwakachitwa aHerodi, <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />naakaswanizya eechi kuli woonse, Herodi wakajalila Joni muntolongo.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">KuBbapatizigwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 3:13-17">Mateyu 3:13-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:9-11">Makko 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Lino bantu boonse nibakabbapatizigwa, mpawo Jesu alakwe kaali wabbapatizigwa. Alimwi wakali kukomba, ijulu lyakajulika, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />alimwi Muuya Usalala wakaselukila alinguwe mbuli inziba, mpawo ijwi lyakaza kuzwa kujulu, kaliti, “Iwe nduwe Mwana wangu ngundiyandisya; mulinguwe mundikondelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mazyalani aJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 1:1-17">Mateyu 1:1-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />Jesu, naakatalika mulimu wakwe, wakali aminyaka yakuzyalwa ilimakumi aatatu, kali mulombe (mbuli mbwakaliyelede kutegwa mwana) waJozefu mwana waHeli, <verse eid="LUK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />Heli mwana waMatati, Matati mwana waLevi, Levi mwana waMelikki, Melikki mwana waJanayi, Janayi mwana waJozefu, <verse eid="LUK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />Jozefu mwana waMatatiyasi, Matatiyasi mwana waAmosi, Amosi mwana waNahamu, Nahamu mwana waEsili, Esili mwana waNagayi, <verse eid="LUK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />Nagayi mwana waMaati, Maati mwana waMatatiyasi, Matatiyasi mwana waSemeyini, Semeyini mwana waJosekki, Josekki mwana waJoda, <verse eid="LUK 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />Joda mwana waJowanani, Jowanani mwana waResa, Resa mwana waZerubbabbeli, Zerubbabbeli mwana waSeyilitiyeli, Seyilitiyeli mwana waNeri, <verse eid="LUK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />Neri mwana waMelikki, Melikki mwana waAdi, Adi mwana waKkosamu, Kkosamu mwana waElimadamu, Elimadamu mwana waEri, <verse eid="LUK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />Eri mwana waJoshuwa, Joshuwa mwana waEliyaza, Eliyaza mwana waJorimu, Jorimu mwana waMatati, Matati mwana waLevi, <verse eid="LUK 3:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />Levi mwana waSimiyoni, Simiyoni mwana waJuda, Juda mwana waJozefu, Jozefu mwana waJonamu, Jonamu mwana waEliyakkimu, <verse eid="LUK 3:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />Eliyakkimu mwana waMeleya, Meleya mwana waMena, Mena mwana waMatata, Matata mwana waNatani, Natani mwana waDevidi, <verse eid="LUK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />Devidi mwana waJese, Jese mwana waObbedi, Obbedi mwana waBbowazi, Bbowazi mwana waSala, Sala mwana waNashoni, <verse eid="LUK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />Nashoni mwana waAminadabbi, Aminadabbi mwana waAdimini, Adimini mwana waAni, Ani mwana waHezironi, Hezironi mwana waPerezi, Perezi mwana waJuda, <verse eid="LUK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />Juda mwana waJakkobbu, Jakkobbu mwana waAyizekki, Ayizekki mwana waAbburahamu, Abburahamu mwana waTera, Tera mwana waNaho, <verse eid="LUK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />Naho mwana waSerugu, Serugu mwana waRewu, Rewu mwana waPelegi, Pelegi mwana waEbba, Ebba mwana waShela, <verse eid="LUK 3:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />Shela mwana waKkeyinani, Kkeyinani mwana waArifasadi, Arifasadi mwana waShemu, Shemu mwana waNowa, Nowa mwana waLamekki, <verse eid="LUK 3:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />Lamekki mwana waMetusela, Metusela mwana waInokki, Inokki mwana waJaredi, Jaredi mwana waMahalaleli, Mahalaleeli mwana waKkeyinani, <verse eid="LUK 3:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />Kkeyinani mwana waInosi, mwana waSeti, mwana waAdamu, mwana waLeza.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kusunkwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mateyu 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12">Makko 1:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mat 4:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:12-13">Mkk 1:12-13</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi Jesu, kazwide nguzu zyaMuuya Usalala, wakabweeda kazwa Jorodani mpawo kaloku kuzulwidwa aMuuya Usalala munkanda <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 9:9">Det 9:9</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 19:8">1 Bam 19:8</ref>.</char></note>ooko nkwakakusunkwa aSatani kwamazuba alimakumi ane. Alimwi takukwe nchakalya pe mumazuba aayo; alimwi naakamana wakaba anzala.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Satani wakati kulinguwe, “Kuti kuli Mwana waLeza, layilila ibbwe eli kuti libe chinkwa.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:4. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 8:3">Det 8:3</ref>.</char>
    </note>Alimwi Jesu wakamuvwiila wati, “Zililembedwe kuti, ‘Muntu takukwe nayoopona achinkwa luzutu pe.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Mpawo Satani wakamutola kubusena buli atala, mpawo wamutondezya maami anyika yoonse muchiindi chiniini, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:6. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1JN 5:19">1 Jn 5:19</ref>.</char></note> mpawo Satani wakati kuli Jesu, “Ndiyookupa nguzu zyoonse eezi abulemu bwazyo; nkaambo zipedwe ndime, alimwi ndipa ooyo ngundiyanda. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Naakuti iwe, eelyo, wandikomba, zilaba zyako zyoonse.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:8. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:13">Det 6:13</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpawo Jesu wakamuvwiila wati,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">“Kulilembedwe kuti, ‘Uyookomba Mwami Leza wako aliikke,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:8">alubo ngweelede kubelekela.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Alimwi wakamutola kuJerusalemu asonge yaŋanda yaLeza wamwaambila wati, “Kuti kuli Mwana aLeza liwaalile aansi kuzwa aawa; <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:10. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Int 91:11-12</ref>.</char></note>nkaambo kuli lembedwe kuti,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Leza uyoolayilila baangelo, kuti bakukwabilile,’<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />alimwi</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">‘Balakukaba amaboko aabo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:11">kuti utakawidi abbwe andyato zyako kuti ulichise.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="DEU 6:16">Det 6:16</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi Jesu wakamuvwiila wati, “Kwaakambwa kuti, ‘Utasunki Mwami Leza wako.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:13. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 22:28">Luk 22:28</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpawo Satani nakamana misunko yoonse, wakamusiya weenda mane kwachiindi cheelede.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Utalika Mulimu Wakwe muGalili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mateyu 4:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Makko 1:14</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 1:15">15</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">4:14. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:12">Mat 4:12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:14">Mkk 1:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:26">Mat 9:26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:37">Luk 4:37</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi Jesu wakabweeda kuGalili kazwide nguzu zyaMuuya, mpuwo yakwe yakazulila muchisi choonse chizyungulukide. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />Mpawo Jesu wakayiisya muchikombelo chabaJuda, kali kulumbayizya aboonse.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaakakwa kuNazareti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mateyu 13:53-58</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:1-6">Makko 6:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />Alimwi wakaza kuNazareti, oko nkwakakomenena; alimwi wakanjila muchikombelo chabaJuda, mbuli chiyanza chabo, mubuzuba bwa Sabata. Mpawo wakayimikila kuti abale; <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />alimwi wakatambikwa bbuku lyamusinsimi Ayizaya. Wakajula wakajana chibalo chilembedwe kuti,<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“Muuya waMwami uli alindime,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">nkaambo wakandinanika kuti ndikambawuke makani mabotu kubachete.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Wandituma kwangununa balimubwaange,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">akubonesya boofu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">kuti beende mulwangunuko aabo balimubuzike,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />kuti ndikambawuke munyaka waMwami utambulika.”<verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Mpawo wakajala bbuku eelyo, alimwi wakapa muzulwidi wachikombelo, mpawo wakkala ansi; pesi bantu boonse bakali mumbungano bakabwadula meso kulinguwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />Eelyo wakatalika kubaambila wati, “Malembe aaya azuzikizigwa sunu ngimwamvwa mumatwi aanu.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />Lino boonse bakapa bukamboni bubotu atala anguwe, alimwi bakagamba majwi achoolwe akazwa mumulomo wakwe; bakati “Ani tee mwana waJozefu na ooyu?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />Alimwi wakabaambila mukozyanisyo wati, “Ndamwaambila kuti muyowaamba kasimpi kati, ‘Iwe Musilisi, kulisilika; lino zyoonse nzitwakamvwa nzuwakachita kuKkapenawumi, zichite lubo mudolopo lyako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />Lino Jesu wakati, “Kasimpe, ndamwaambila kuti, takukwe musinsimi ulemekwa muchisi chakwe. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Pesi ndamwaambila kasimpe kuti, kwakali bamukabafu bayingi muchisi chaIzirayeli yoonse kumazuba aElayija, awo julu nilyakajalidwe mvula niyakatalikuwa minyaka itaatu amyeezi ilimusanu awumwi, nikwakaba bbalangwe pati munyika yoonse; <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />alimwi Elayija takukwe naakatumwa kulimbabo pe, pesi kumukamufu kuZarefati, uzwa kubusena bwaSidoni. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />Alimwi kwakali basichipele bayingi muIzirayeli kuchiindi chaElisha musinsimi, mpawo takukwe wakasalazigwa naba omwe akati kabo, pesi Naamani ngwakasalazya alikke muSiriya.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Bantu boonse bakali muchikombelo chabaJuda aabo bakamvwa eezi bakazula bukali. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />Alimwi bakabuka, bamutandila anze lyagunzi, bamutola ajenga, lyakalundu akaliyakilidilwe guunzi lyabo, kuti bamusukumine mujenga kuti atole mutwe aansi. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Pesi wakabapuzuka wayinda akati kabo mpawo weenda.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaalumi Ula Sikazwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:21-28">Makko 1:21-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Alimwi wakaselukila kuKkapenawumi, kuchisi chaGalili oko nkwakakuyisya mubuzuba bwasabata. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Lino bakaankamana kunjiisyo yakwe, nkaambo ijwi ndyakali kuyiisya lyakali zwide nguzu. <verse eid="LUK 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />Alimwi muchikombelo chaba Juda kwakali umwi mwaalumi wakali amuuya mubi usofwede, eelyo wakalila ajwi pati, <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />Wati, “Kutuleka swebo! Tujisi mulandu nzi anduwe, Jesu wakuNazareti? Sena waza kuzotunyonyona? Ndilikuzi we, kuti uli ooyo Usalala waLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Pesi Jesu wakulayilila muuya mubi wati, “Umuna, zwa mumwaalumi ooyu!” Mpawo muuya mubi wakamuwalila aansi kunembo lyabo, alimwi wakazwa, katamuchiside pe.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Mpawo boonse bakagamba kabaambula umwi awumwi kabati, “Ndijwi lyamusyobonzi eeli? Nkaambo lilaanguzu zyakukalalila muuya mubi, alimwi ulazwa.” <verse eid="LUK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Mpawo mpuwo yakwe yakasika kumasena alimumbali achilikiti eecho.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Bantu Bayiingi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mateyu 8:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:29-34">Makko 1:29-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />Eelyo Jesu wakabuka wazwa muchikombelo chabaJuda, mpawo wakaya kuŋanda yaSayimoni. Lino bajana bayinazyala baSayimoni baliikuchiswa loko, mpawo bakamukumbila kuti abakombele. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />Mpawo wakasweena afwiifwi ambabo wakatingama alimwi wakalayilila chilwazi kuti chizwe, mpawo bapona, batalika kubakutawukila.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Lino izuba nilyakabbila boonse bakali abantu bachiswa bakabeeta kuli Jesu kuti abakombele; akubasilika kumalwazi amisyobomisyobo yoonse mpoo wakababikka maanza boonse, wabakombela bapona. <verse eid="LUK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />Alimwi myuuya mibi yakazwa mubantu bayingi, kabalila kabati, “Tulizi kuti nduwe Kkirisitu Mwana aLeza!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">Pesi wakabalayilila, kuti bataambuuli; nkaambo bakalimwizi kuti nguKkirisitu.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaaka Kukambawuka Muchikombelo Chaba Juda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 1:35-39">Makko 1:35-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Mpawo nibwakacha wakazwa waya kubusena mbwaakakuba alikke. Mpawo bantu bakamuyanduula, alimwi bakeezya kumukombelezya kuti bakakukkale awe, kuti ateendi, <verse eid="LUK 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />pesi wakati, “Ndeleede ndikambawuke makani mabotu abwami bwaLeza kuli aamwi masena alawo, nkaambo nzinzizyo eezi nzindakatumwa kukuzochita aLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Mpawo wakali muzikombelo zyabaJudiya kuti akakukambawuke mumasena woonse.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwakasala Basikwiiya Bakwe Bataanzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mateyu 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Makko 1:16-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mat 4:18-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:16-20">Mkk 1:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:40-42">Jn 1:40-42</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 21:1-19">21:1-19</ref>.</char>
    </note> Lino muchiindi bantu nibakali kumusyanikizya kabali kuswiilizya ijwi lyaLeza, Jesu wakalimvwi kumbali alwizi lutegwa Genesareti. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Mpawo wakabona maato abili akali kunkomwe yalwizi; pesi bazubi babaswi bakali bazwa mulingawo, kabali kusanzya tuniyandi twabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />Mpawo wakanjila muli bumwi bwamaato, obo bwakali bwa Sayimoni, wakamukumbila kuti abutontele mumeenda buniini kuzwa kunkomwe. Mpawo wakakkala wayiisya bantu kali mubwaato.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Lino naakamana kwaambuula, wakaambila Sayimoni wakati, “Chunda bwaato bwako mumeenda abbila mpawo uwaale tuniyandi twako uuche.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />Alimwi Sayimoni wakavwiila wati, “Mwami, twabeleka busiku boonse mpawo takukwe nchitwacha pe! Pesi kujwi lyako, ndilawaala tuniyandi.” <verse eid="LUK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Alimwi nibakachita oobo mbaakamba, bakacha baswi bayingi loko, mane tuniyandi twakali kuzapuuka, <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />bakayiita basimulimunyina bakali muli bumbi bwaato, kuti baze bazobagwasye. Mpawo bakaza bakazuzya maato abili mane akali atalika kubbila. <verse eid="LUK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />Pesi Sayimoni Pita naakabona eezi, wakafugama munsi lyamawulu aJesu wati, “Mwami, zwa kulindime, nkaambo ime ndilisizibi.”<verse eid="LUK 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Nkaambo Sayimoni wakagamba, abaabo boonse mbaakali aabo, mukubona baswi aaba mbibakacha muchiindi eecho; <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />alimwi alakwe Jakkobbu aJoni bana baZebbedi, bakali basimulimunyina aSayimoni. Mpawo Jesu wakaambila Sayimoni wati, “Utayoowi, kuzwa sunu uyooba sikuzuba wabantu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />Mpawo nibakeeta maato aabo kunkomwe, bakasiya zyoonse mpawo bakamutobela.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mwaalumi Ulachipele</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mateyu 8:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:40-45">Makko 1:40-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Naakachili mulichimwi chazisi, kwakasika umwi mwaalumi wakalizwide achipele; naakabona Jesu, wakavundama, mpawo wakamukumbila wati, “Mwami, kuti kuyaanda, ulakonzya kundisalazya.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />Mpawo Jesu wakatandabika luboko lwakwe wamukombela, wati, “Ndakusalazya”, mpawo wakati, “Kusalala.” Mpawawo chipele chakamana. <verse eid="LUK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Mpawo wakamulayilila wati, “Utaambili muntu; pesi kuya ukalitondezye kumupayizi, alimwi ukape chipayizyo chakusalazigwa kwako, mbuli Mozesi mbwaakalayilila, kuti bube bukamboni kubantu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />Pesi nikuba oobo impuwo nyingi atala aJesu yakendelela; makamumakamu abantu akaza kulinguwe kuti bamvwe, akuti bazosilikwe kumalwazi aabo. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:16. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12">6:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18">9:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:1">11:1</ref>.</char></note> Pesi wakazwa waya nkwakakuba alikke waakukomba.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mwaalumi Ulebukide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mateyu 9:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:1-12">Makko 2:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Muli bumwi bwamabuzuba aayo, naakalikuyiisya, kwakali baFarisi abayiisi bamulawu kabakkede mpawo, bakazwa mumyuunzi yoonse yamuchisi chaGalili akuJudiya abazwa kuJerusalemu. Alimwi inguzu zyaMwami zyakaliwo kuti abaponisye. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />Alimwi laanga, bantu bakeeta mwaalumi ulebukide kalede abuyalangwe, alimwi bakayanduula mbubanga balamunjizya mukati akumulazika kunembo lyaJesu; <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />pesi teebakajana mweenya pe wakumunjizya, nkaambo kakuvula kwabantu, bakatanta atala akaluli mpawo beenyuna mweenya akaluli, bamuselusya abuyalangwe bamweeta aawo akali Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Alimwi Jesu naakabona lusyomo lwabo, wakati, “Yomwaluumi zibi zyako zyalekelelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />Mpawo bayiisyi bamulawu abaFarisi bakatalika kulibuzya, kabati, “Ngwani ooyu mwaaluumi waambuula masampu aliboobu? Ngwani ukonzya kulekelela zibi pesi Leza aliikke?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />Awo Jesu nakaziba nzibakalikuyeeya, wakabavwiila wati, “Nkaamboonzi nimulipenzya mumyoyo yanu? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Nchichili chuuba, kwamba kuti, ‘Zibi zyako zyalekelelwa,’ nikuba kuti, ‘Buka weende?’ <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Pesi kuti mukazibe kuti Mwana amuntu ulaanguzu anyika zyakulekelela zibi.” Aboobo wakati kumwaalumi ooyo wakali lebukide wati, “Ndakwaambila, buka, bweza buyalangwe bwako uye kuŋanda yako.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />Mpawawo wakabuka kunembo lyabo alimwi wabweza buyalangwe bwakwe, mpawo wakaya kuŋanda yakwe, kalokulumbayizya Leza. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Mpawo boonse bakaankamana, akalumbayizya Leza, bakazula kuyoowa, bati “Twabona zilengano sunu.”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaakayiita Levi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mateyu 9:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:13-17">Makko 2:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Nikwakamana eechi wakeenda, mpawo wakabona simutelo, izina lyakwe utegwa Levi, kakkede aawo aŋanda bwakutelela; mpawo wakati kulinguwe “Nditobele.” <verse eid="LUK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Alimwi Levi wakasiya zyoonse, wanyampuka mpawo wamutobela.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Eelyo Levi wakachitila Jesu pobwe pati muŋanda yakwe; alimwi kwakali nkamu mpati yabasimutelo abamwi alabo bakali kkede aamwi atebuli kuchilalilo. <verse eid="LUK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />BaFarisi abayiisyi bamulawu bakanyontooka kuli basikwiiya bakwe, kabati, “Nkaamboonzi nulya akunywa abasimutelo abasizibi?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />Mpawo Jesu wakabavwiila wati, “Aabo bawumbulu tabayandi musilisi pe, pesi aabo bachiswa; <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:32. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1TI 1:15">1 Tim 1:15</ref>.</char></note> Teendakaza kukwiita baluleme pe, pesi basizibi kuti basanduke.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubuzya Atala Akuliimya Chakulya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mateyu 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Makko 2:18-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:33. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mat 9:14-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:18-22">Mkk 2:18-22</ref>.</char>
    </note> Alimwi bakati kulinguwe, “Basikwiiya baJoni balalyiimya kulya akukomba, alimwi mbumbuboobo abasikwiiya babaFarisi mbubachita abalo, pesi bako balalya akunywa.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />Mpawo Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Ngamulachita beenzina abasikukwata kuti balyiimye kaali sikukwata uli ambabo? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:22">Luk 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:22">17:22</ref>.</char></note> Mazuba ayoosika, sikukwata nayootolwa akati kabo, eelyo alimwi nibayoolyiimya kulya mumazuba aayo.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />Wakabaambila muchikozyanisyo lubo wati: “Taakwe udelula chigamba achisamo chipya mpawo achibikke achisamo chikulukulu; kuti wachita oobo, uladelula chipya, alimwi chigamba chizwa kuchipya tachikwe kweelela pe achikulukulu. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />Alimwi taakwe utila wayini mupya mumunkuli mukulukulu; kuti wachita oobo, wayini mupya ulajeya munkuli mpawo utikile aansi, alimwi munkuli uladeluka. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Pesi wayini mupya weelede kubambwa mumunkuli mupya. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />Alimwi taakwe unywa wayini mukulukulu utaayande mupya; nkaambo ulaamba kuti, ‘Mukulukulu ngumubotu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s">Mubuzyo Atala Abuzuba Bwasabata</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mateyu 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Makko 2:23-28</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mat 12:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 2:23-28">Mkk 2:23-28</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 23:25">Det 23:25</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mubuzuba bwasabata, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:1. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi ansiku akazumizigwa alembedwe kuti</char><char style="fq" closed="false">musabata lyabili litobela taanzi</char></note>Jesu naakali kuyabweenda kabayabwiinda mumyuunda yazilyo, mpawo basikwiiya bakwe bakatalika kupulula mayila, kabaliikupuka amaboko mpawo kabolookulya. <verse eid="LUK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:2. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:10">Kul 20:10</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 23:12">23:12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:14">Det 5:14</ref>.</char></note> Pesi bamwi babaFarisi bakababuzya bati, “Nkaamboonzi nimuchita ziteelede mumulawu mubuzuba bwasabata?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:3. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1SA 21:1-6">1 Sam 21:1-6</ref>.</char>
    </note>Mpawo Jesu wakavwiila wati, “Tamunabala na kuti Devidi wakachitayi naakaba anzala, lwakwe antoomwe abaabo mbakali aabo: <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:4. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24:9</ref>.</char></note> Ambwaaka kunjila muŋanda yaLeza, mpawo wakubweza chinkwa mpawo walya chipayililidwe, eecho chitakukwe kuzumininwa amumulawu wakachita ziteelede mumulawu kunze kwabapayizi abalikke kukulya, alimwi wakapa bakali kweenda aawe?”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />Alimwi wakabaambila wati, “Mwana amuntu nguMwami wasabata.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaalumi Wakali Aluboko Lulebukide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mateyu 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Makko 3:1-6</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:6. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mat 12:9-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:1-6">Mkk 3:1-6</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mulimwi sabata, Jesu wakanjila muchikombelo chabaJuda mpawo wayiisya, alimwi kwakali mwaalumi wakali aluboko lwakululyo lulebukide. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Mpawo bayiisyi bamulawu abaFarisi bakali kuyanda kulanga kuti ulamuponiya na mubuzuba bwasabata, kuchitila kuti bamujanine mulandu wakumutamikizya. <verse eid="LUK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Pesi Jesu wakalizi zyakali mumizeezo yabo, mpawo wakaambila mwaalumi wakali lebukide luboko wati, “Nyampuka uze wimikile awa akati.” Alimwi mwaalumi ooyo wakabuka wimikila mpawawo. <verse eid="LUK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Alimwi Jesu wakabaambila wati, “Ndikumbila kubuzya, zileelede mumulawu na mubuzuba bwasabata kuchita chintu chibotu naakuti nchibi, kuvuna buumi naa kubunyonyona?” <verse eid="LUK 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />Mpawo naakamana kubalanga boonse, wakaaambila mwaalumi ooyu wati, “Tandabika luboko lwako.” Alimwi wakachita oobo: luboko lwakwe lwakapona.<verse eid="LUK 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />Alimwi kabafundikide mukunyema abukali, mpawo bakabamba kuti ngabalamuchita biyeni Jesu.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Usala Basikwiiya Balikkumi Ababili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mateyu 10:1-4</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Makko 3:13-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:12. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 3:13-19">Mkk 3:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:2-4">Mat 10:2-4</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:13">Inch 1:13</ref>.</char>
    </note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:12. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:16">5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18">9:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:1">11:1</ref>.</char></note> Lino mumazuba aayo, wakaya kuchilundu kukukomba, oko nkwakakukomba kuli Leza busiku boonse. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />Nibwakacha, wakayiita basikwiiya bakwe, mpawo wasala balikkumi ababili akati kabo, aabo mbakawulika kuti mbatumwa; <verse eid="LUK 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Wakasala Sayimoni, ooyo ngwakawuzika kuti Pita aEnduru mukulana aSayimoni aJakkobbu aJoni aFilipu aBbatolomewu, <verse eid="LUK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />mpawo Mateyu aTomasi aJakkobbu mwana aAlifasi aSayimoni muZiloti, <verse eid="LUK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />alimwi Judasi mwana aJakkobbu aJudasi Isikkariyoti, ooyu wakamuzya.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ulaponiya Akuyiisya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mateyu 4:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:1-2">Mat 5:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:24-25">4:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:7-12">Mkk 3:7-12</ref>.</char>
    </note>Wakaseluka aabo, mpawo bakayimikila anyika itendebede, kali ankamu mpati yabasikwiiya bakwe, amakamumakamu abantu bakaza kabazwa mumyuunzi yoonse yaJudiya akuJerusalemu, alimwi akunkomwe zyalwizi lwakuTaya akuSidoni, bakaza kuzomuswiilizya, akuti abaponiye kumalwazi aabo; <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />alabo bakali kupenzegwa amuuya mubi bakaponesegwa. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:19. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:10">Mkk 3:10</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:21">Mat 9:21</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:36">14:36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17">Luk 5:17</ref>.</char></note> Alimwi makamumakamu woonse akali kuyanda kumuguma, nkaambo nguzu zyakalikuzwa kulinguwe mpawo wakabaponiya boonse.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukondo Amapenzi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:1-12">Mateyu 5:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:20. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:3-12">Mat 5:3-12</ref>.</char>
    </note> Mpawo wakatambya meso akwe kuli basikwiiya bakwe, wati:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Mulaachoolwe nubachete,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">nkaambo bwami bwaLeza mbubwanu!”<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />“Mulaachoolwe inywe nimulaanzala lino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">nkaambo muyookkuta!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">“Mulaachoolwe inywe nimulila lino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">nkaambo muyoosekelela!”<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:22.</char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="1PE 4:14">1 Pit 4:14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 9:22">Jn 9:22</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 16:2">16:2</ref>.</char>
    </note>“Mulaachoolwe na bantu bamusula akumwaanda akumwaamba bubi, nkaambo kazina lyaMwana aMuntu!” <verse eid="LUK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Ngamukabotelwe mubuzuba oobo, alimwi mukakondwe, nkaambo impindu mpati ili kujulu, nkaambo mbumbubo mbubakachita bamawisi kubasinsimi.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzi Mbwaakambwa</para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:24. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 10:13-15">Luk 10:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:38-52">11:38-52</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1">17:1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:23">21:23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:22">22:22</ref>.</char>
    </note> <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:24. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 16:25">Luk 16:25</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:1-5">Jakk 5:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:2">Mat 6:2</ref>.</char></note> “Pesi maawe kuli ndinywe bavubi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">nkaambo mwabujana kale bulumbu bwanu!”<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />“Maawe kulindinywe nimukkutide lino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">nkaambo muyooba anzala!”</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">“Maawe kulindinywe nimulo kusekelela lino,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">nkaambo bayoolila akuuma mubila!”<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />“Maawe kuli ndinywe, naa bantu boonse nibazomulumbayizya, nkaambo mbubakachita bamawisi kubasinsimi babeji!”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yanda Basinkondonyokwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:38-48">Mateyu 5:38-48</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:12">7:12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:27. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:39-44">Mat 5:39-44</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:17">Rom 12:17</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 6:7">1 Kkor 6:7</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Pesi ndamwaambila eezi inywe nimuswilizizye kuti, Muyande basinkondonyokwe, mubachitile bubotu aabo bamusula, <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />amubalongezye aabo bamusyulikizya bubi, mubakombele bamudyaamizya. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Kuli ooyo umumata kuseya, mumupe alubo lumbi; alimwi kuli ooyo umutolela chisamo chanu mutamukasyi kuti abweze achigogo lubo. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />Mupe kuli woonse umukumbila; alimwi bamutolela mbono zyanu mutakazilondi lubo pe. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Alimwi mbuli mbumuyanda kuti bamuchitile, amubachitile abalabo.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:32. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:44-48">Mat 5:44-48</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Nkaambo kuti mwayanda bantu bamuyanda, niinzi nchimulumbwa aacho? Nkaambo basizibi alabo bayanda babayanda. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Alimwi kuti mwachita bubotu kuli baabo bamuchitila bubotu, niinzi mpindu njujana? Nkaambo nikuba basizibi mbubachita mbuboobo. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Na kuti wapa muntu ngulangilila kukupa, ninzi nchimulumbwa aacho? Nkaambo basizibi balapa kuli basizibinyina kuti bajane zyiindilide lubo. <verse eid="LUK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:35. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:9">Mat 5:9</ref>.</char></note> Pesi yanda basinkondonyokwe, alimwi uchite obotu, amupe, kamutalangilili kujana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:35 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kujana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Amwi malembe ansiku akazumizigwa aamba kuti </char></note>; nkaambo mpindu yanu iyooba mpati, alimwi muyooba bana baSijulu lyaMajulu; nkaambo ulaluse kuli batalumbi abasindya. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Amube aluse, mbuli Taata wanu mbalaaluse.<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mutabeteki Bamwi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:1-5">Mateyu 7:1-5</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:37. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:1-2">Mat 7:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 2:1">Rom 2:1</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Mutabeteki, kuti anywebo mutabetekwi; mutatamikizyi, kuti mutatamikizigwi alanu; amulekelele, kuti anywebo mukalekelelwe; <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:38. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:24">Mkk 4:24</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 20:35">Inch 20:35</ref>.</char></note> ngamupe, anywebo muyoopegwa, mumweelwe weelede, chisindiidwe, alimwi chumidwewumidwe, chifusukide kulindinywe. Ooyo mweelo ngumubelesya kulibamwi nguyoobelesegwa akulindinywe.” <verse eid="LUK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:39. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 15:14">Mat 15:14</ref>.</char></note> Wakabaambila chikozyanisyo wati: “Sa moofu ulakonzya na kuzulwida moofu nyina? Tabakonzyi kuwida mukomba boonse na? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:40. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:24-25">Mat 10:24-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:16">Jn 13:16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:20">15:20</ref>.</char></note> Sikwiiya tayindi sikumuyiisya pe, pesi nawayiiya chizulide ulaba mbuli sikuuyiisya.” <verse eid="LUK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:41. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:3-5">Mat 7:3-5</ref>.</char></note> “Nkaamboonzi nimubona kafwapu aako kali muliso lyamukulana wako, pesi kutaboni tanda lili muliso lyako? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Naakuti nkaamboonzi nuwaamba mukulana wako kuti, ‘Mukwesu, ima ndikugwisye kafwapu kali muliso lyako,’ awo iwe nkujisi tanda muliso lyako? Nusikuupawupa, lutaanzi talika ugwisye tyanda lili muliso lyako, alimwi eelyo ulabona antangalala kugwisya kafwapu ako kali muliso lya mukulana wako.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Musamu aMichelo Wayo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:16-20">Mateyu 7:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:43. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:18-19">Mat 7:18-19</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:33-35">12:33-35</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 3:11-12">Jakk 3:11-12</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Nkaambo taakwe musamu mubotu ukonzya kuzyala michelo mibi, nikuba kuti musamu mubi ukonzya kuzyala michelo mibotu; <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />nkaambo awumwi musamu tulakuuziba amichelo yawo. Nkaambo kumukuyu tukoyochela maamvwa pe, nikuba kumasaansa kuzwa kumasanzu achooba pe. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:45. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 7:20">Mkk 7:20</ref>.</char></note> Muntu ululeme mulizezyo nzyabambide zimwetela bubotu, pesi muntu ulamoyo mubi mububi moyo wakwe weeta bubi; nkaambo zilimumoyo nziizwa amulomo wakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muyaki Musongo aMufubafuba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mateyu 7:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">6:46. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 7:21">Mat 7:21</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Nkaamboonzi nimundita kuti, ‘Mwami, Mwami,’ kamutachiti nzindimwaambila? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6:47. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:24-27">Mat 7:24-27</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:22-25">Jakk 1:22-25</ref>.</char></note> Woonse uza kulindime alimwi kaswiliizya majwi angu akwaachita, ndiyoomutondezya kuti ukozyezye aani: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />ulimbuli muntu uli kuyaka ŋanda, wasya yabbila, mpawo wabika ntalisyo amwaala; alimwi nikwaba zambangulwe, iguwo nilyasika atala aŋanda, alimwi tikooyokonzya kuzyukuka pe, nkaambo iyakidwe obotu.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:48. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Aamwi ansiku akazumizigwa kwaamba kuti</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Pesi oyu umvwa akutalichita ijwi lyangu ulimbuli muntu uyaka ŋanda anyika itakwe ntalisyo; awo nilyaza zambangulwe, alimwi mpawaawo yawa, mpawo kuwa kwayo ŋanda nkupati.”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mulanda waSilutwe waRoma</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:5-13">Mateyu 8:5-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">7:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MAT 8:5-10">Mat 8:5-10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 8:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:46-53">Jn 4:46-53</ref>.</char>
    </note>Naakamana kwaambuula zyoonse kubantu bakali kuswiilila wakanjila mudolopo lyaKkapenawumi. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />Kwakali silutwe mupati wankamu yabasilumamba yabaRoma wakajisi mulanda wakali muyandisyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Naakuti </char></note> kulinguwe, lino ooyo mulanda wakwe wakali kuchiswa kuchiimo chakufwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />Naakamvwa atala aJesu, wakatuma bapati baba Juda, kuti bayiinke kukumukumbila kuti aze mpawo amuponiye mulanda wakwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Mpawo nibakasika kuli Jesu, bakamukumbila muchoonzyo, bati, “Kuti nkazichita ooyu twakumbila kuti twiinke aamwi ukaakuponiye mulanda ooyu, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />nkaambo ulachiyanda chisi chesu, alimwi ngunguwe wakatuyakila busena bwakukombela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />Alimwi Jesu wakeenda aabo. Lino naakasika afwiifwi aŋanda yasilutwe wabasilumamba, mpawo silutwe ooyo wakatuma mweenzunyina kuti ati kuli Jesu, “Mwami utali penzyi numwini, nkaambo tandeelede pe kuti unjile mukaluli kaŋanda yangu; <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />nkikaako nchinditakwe nindayeeya kuza kulinduwe. Pesi waamba biyo ijwi lyako, mpawo mulanda wangu ulapona. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Nkaambo ambebo ndijisi nguzu ndimwaalumi ubeleka ansi amulawu, alubo ndijisi nkamu yabasilumamba babeleka munsi lyangu; naa ndabalayila ndati ‘Kuya!’ ulayinka alimwi kuli umwi, ndati, ‘Kuza!’ alimwi ulasika; alimwi kumuzike wangu, ‘Chita oobu!’ mpawo ulachichita.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Jesu naakamvwa eechi, wakagamba, mpawo wakalanga nkamu yakali kuyobumutobela, mpawo wakabaambila wati, “Ndiliikumwaambila nikuba mu Izirayeli takukwe nindalinajana lusyomo lulibobu, pe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Lino aabo bakatumwa nibakabweeda kuŋanda, bakaakujana mulanda ooyu wapona.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ubusya Kuzwa Kulufu Mwana Mulombe Wamukamufu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Jesu naakamana aawo, wakaya kuchiisi chaNayini; abasikwiiya bakwe ankamu mpati bakayinka aamwi anguwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />Lino Jesu nakaamba kusika kumulyango wamuunzi, alimwi wakaswana bantu bakanyampwide mutunta, kali mwana mulombe uumwi wamukamufu, bantu bayiingi bamumuunzi bakali kuyobweenda aawe. <verse eid="LUK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Alimwi Mwami naakamulanga, wakamufwida luzyalo, mpawo wakamwaambila wati, “Utalili pe.” <verse eid="LUK 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Mpawo wakayinka waguma buyalangwe, bakali nyampwide buyalangwe bakayimikila mpawo wakati “Mulombe, ndati kulinduwe, buka.” <verse eid="LUK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />Alimwi oyu mwaalumi wakali fwide wakabuka wakkala, wakatalika kwaambuula. Mpawo wakamupeda kuli bayina.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Boonse bakasikilwa kuyoowa kupati, mpawo bakalumbayizya Leza, bakati, “Musinsimi mupati wabuka akati kesu!” Alimwi, “Leza watuswaya bantu bakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />Lino mpuwo yakwe yakeendelela mumasena woonse aJudiya, amasena abambene achisi eecho.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Basikutumwa Bakazwa Kuli Joni Mubbapatizi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:2-19">Mateyu 11:2-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />Alimwi basikwiiya baJoni bakamwaambila zintu zyoonse. <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />Lino Joni, wakayita basikwiiya bakwe babili, wabatuma kuMwami, kukuyobuzya kuti, “Ndunduwe na wakaambwa kuti uleelede kuzosika? Naakuti tuchilaawumbi uchiza?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Aaba baalumi nibakasika kulinguwe bakati, “Joni Mubbapatizi watutuma kulinduwe, wati, ‘Nduwe na weelede kuza, naakuti kuli umbi ngutweelede kulangilizya’?” <verse eid="LUK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />Mpawo muchindi eecho wakaponiya bakala malwazi asiyene amyuuya mibi abayiingi boofu bakabona.<verse eid="LUK 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Lino wakabavwiila, basikwiiya wati, “Kamuya mukamwaambile Joni zyoonse nzimwabona akumvwa: Boofu balabona, bateendi baleenda, balachipele ulabasalazya, batamnvwi balamnvwa, bafwide balabuka, kubachete ijwi lyamakani mabotu lila kambawukwa. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Alimwi ulaachoolwe ooyu muntu utalebwi nkaambo kangu.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />Lino nibakeenda basikwiiya baJoni, wakatalika kwaambuula kunkamu atala aJoni wati, “Nimwakaya munkanda kuyoobona Joni, mwakali kuyeeya kuti wakalimbuli iinzi? Muyeyanga wakali kunooba mbuli tete na eelyo lyakawungwa aguwo? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Niinzi eelyo nchimwakaya kuyoboona? Mwaalumi uzweete malembo anjenjema na? Amulange, aabo basamide zisamo zyamidabba meebesi, bakkede kabotu alimwi balajanika mumaanda abulemu abami. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Niinzi eelyo zimwakaya kukuyolanga? Musinsimi na? Iiyi, ndamwaambila kuti, Joni ujisi mulimu mupati kwiinda musinsimi. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ooyu ngunguwe, ooyo wakalembwa atala anguwe kuti: ‘Amulange, ndiyotuma simweenda nembo kubusyu bwanu, utakamubambile nzila njimutakutobele.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />“Ndamwaambila, akati kabo bazyedwe kumwanakazi taakwe mupati kwiinda Joni, pesi ooyu muniini kubwami bwa Leza ngumupati.” <verse eid="LUK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:29. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:32">Mat 21:32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:12">Luk 3:12</ref>.</char></note>Nibakamvwa eechi bantu boonse abasimutelo bakatambula Leza, nkaambo bakali babbapatizigwa lubbapatizyo lwaJoni; <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />pesi baFarisi abayiisi bamulawu bakakaka lulayo lwaLeza, nkaambo tebakabbapatizigwa pe aJoni.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />“Ndiyobakozyanisya anzi bantu bazyalani elino? Alimwi bali mbuliinzi? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Bali mbuli bana bakkede kulubuwa bwakusambalila, mpawo balokuyita umwi awumwi kabali kuti, ‘Twakamusibila nyeele, pesi teemwakazyana pe; alimwi twakamulizya, temwakalila pe.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Nkaambo Joni muBbapatizi wakaza katalyi chinkwa nikuba kunywa wayini; mwakamwamba kuti, ‘Ujisi muuya mubi.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Mwana aMuntu wakaza kali kulya akunywa; pesi mwakati, ‘Amulange ngusindya amukolwi, alimwi mweenzunyina wabasimutelo abasizibi!’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Anukuti busongo bulasalazya mubana bakwe boonse.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Kuŋanda yaSayimoni Mufarisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Lino umwi wabaFarisi wakamukumbila kuti akalye awe, mpawo wakayinka wakunjila muŋanda yamuFarisi, mpawo bakkala atebuli balya. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />Mpawo laanga, umwi mwanakazi wamuchisi eecho wakali sizibi, nakamvwa kuti Jesu mpali muŋanda yamuFarisi, ulikkede kaliikulya, wakaza akankuli kadula kamafuta anunkilila, <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />alimwi wakaliimvwi kusule kumawulu aakwe, kalokulila, wakali kutetya mawulu akwe amisozi yakwe, akwiisinda amasusu aakwe amumutwe wakwe, mpawo wamyoonta mawulu aakwe, mpawo wakaananika amafuta anunkilila. <verse eid="LUK 7:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Lino muFarisi wakali mutambide naakazibona, wakaamba chamumoyo wakwe wati, “Ooyu mwaalumi naali musinsimi, naaziba kuti ooyu mwanakazi wamujata kuti ngwani, nkaambo ngusizibi.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />Alimwi Jesu wakavwiila wati, “Sayimoni ndilazyakukwaambila”, mpawo wakamuvwiila wati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">“Muyiisi, kundaambila?”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />“Kwakali uumwi sikukweletisya wakajisi bantu babili bakali azikwelete; uumwi wakalijisi iimyaanda ilimusanu yamakkobili, alimwi umwi wakajisi makumi alimusanu. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Alimwi takukwe nibakalijisi chakubbadala mulandu ooyu, mpawo ooyu mulandu ngubakalawo bakalekelelwa. Lino ngamundaambile, ngwani akati kabo uyoomuyandisya?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />Sayimoni wakavwiila wati, “Ndiyeeya kuti ooyu wakalekelelwa kapati ooyo wakalijisi mulandu mupati.” Wakamwaambila wati, “Waamba kasimpe mbubo wabeteka obotu.” <verse eid="LUK 7:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Mpawo wakacheba walanga kumwanakazi ooyu, alimwi wati, kuli Sayimoni, “Laanga ooyu mwanakazi? Ndanjila muŋanda yako, takukwe nuwandipa maanzi kuti ndisambe mawulu angu, pesi mwanakazi ooyu wasanzya mawulu angu amisozi yakwe, wandibukusa amasusu akwe. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />‘Takukwe nuwamyoonta mawulu angu pe, pesi ooyu mwanakazi kuzwa muchiindi naasika muŋanda, takukwe naaleka kumyoonta mawulu angu pe.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Takukwe nuwananika mutwe wangu pe amafuta, pesi ooyu mwanakazi wananika mawulu angu amafuta anunkilila. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Alimwi ndamwaambila kuti, zibi zyakwe zyaliziyiingi, zyalekelelwa nkaambo wayanda chakwindilila, pesi kuli ooyu ulekelelwa buniini, alakwe uyanda buniini.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Mpawo wakamwaambila wati, “Zibi zyako zyalekelelwa.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />Alimwi aabo bakakkede aamwi anguwe kabaliikulya aamwi atebuli, mpawo bakatalika kungunguna akati kabo kabati, “Ngwani ooyu, ukonzya kulekelela zibi?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Mpawo Jesu wakati kumwanakazi ooyu, “Lusyomo lwako lwakufutula; yinka muluumuno.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s">Mwanakazi Utobela Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Kuzwa aawo Jesu wakayinda muzisi amumyuunzi, kakambawuka akweeta makani mabotu atala abwami bwaLeza. Alimwi balikkumi ababili bakali anguwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />alimwi bamwi banakazi, mbaakaponiya kumuuya mubi amachise: Meri (Utegwa Magadalini), ooyu wakalijisi myuuya mibi yasikazwa ilimusanu ayibili wakayitanda kuzwa mulinguwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />Alimwi Jowana mwanakazi waChuuza, mweendelezi waŋanda yaHerodi aSusana abayingi bamwi, bakali kumukutawukila mumilimu yabo kababelesya zyabo.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikozyano Chasikumiza Mbuto</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mateyu 13:1-9</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:1-9">Makko 4:1-9</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Alimwi nkamu mpati yakabungana abantu kabazwa kudolopo adolopo bakaza kulinguwe, wakaambuula muchikozyanisyo wati:<verse eid="LUK 8:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Sikumiza wakaya kukumiza mbuto yakwe, alimwi aawo naakali kumiza, imwi yakawida munzila mpawo yakalyatwa amawulu, mpawo bayuni bamujulu bakiilya. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Alimwi imwi yakawida amwaala; niyakali kuyabukomena, yakapusama, nkaambo takukwe niyakajana butete. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />Mpawo imwi yakawida anyika yakali amisamu yamaamvwa; alimwi maamvwa akakomena aamwi akayisyanikizya. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />Alimwi imwi yakawida muvu bbotu mpawo yakamena, yazyala zilyo zilimwaanda yindulidwe.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">Naakachili kwaamba eechi, wakayiita, “Aabo balaamatwi akumvwa, ngabamvwe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Bupanduluzi Bwachikozyano</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mateyu 13:10-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:10-12">Makko 4:10-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Lino basikwiiya bakwe nibakabuzya, atala acheechi chikozyanisyo kuti chambaanzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />Wakaamba wati, “Kulindinywe zilipedwe kuti muyizibe nsiiswa yabwami bwaLeza, pesi kuli bamwi ndaambuula amikozyanisyo, kuchitila kuti kababona pesi kabatabonesesyi pe, alimwi kabamnvwa pesi kabatamvwisisisyi pe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwapandulula Mukozyano Wasikumiza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mateyu 13:18-23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:13-20">Makko 4:13-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />“Lino nzuwaamba mukozyanisyo ooyu nzeezi: Imbuto ndijwi lyaLeza. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Eeyo yakawida munzila ilimbuli aabo bantu bamvwa ijwi lyaLeza, mpawo Satani wasika wabanyanzya ijwi kuzwa mumyoyo yabo, kuti baleke kusyoma akufutulwa. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />Eeyo yakawida amwaala ilimbuli aabo bantu, nibamvwa jwi lyaLeza, balitambula alukondo; pesi takukwe nibaba amiyanda, balasyoma kwachiindi chiniini, alimwi muchiindi misunko niyasika balawa. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />Alimwi atala ayeeyo yakawida mumaamvwa, ilimbuli aabo bantu bamvwa ijwi lyaLeza, pesi nibayabweenda balayaswa aziyandisyo abuvubi amisalo yabuumi, alimwi michelo yabo tayikwe niibizwa pe. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />Mpawo eeyo yakawida muvu bbotu, ilimbuli aabo bantu, bamvwa ijwi lyaLeza, balijatisisya munzila isyomekede amoyo mubotu, akuzyala michelo chakutaleka.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilampi aChibikilo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 4:21-25">Makko 4:21-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Taakwe uyasya chimwinikisyo, mpawo watibbika achisuwo, naakuti wabikka munsi abulo, pesi ulabikka achibikilo chimwinikisyo kuchitila kuti aabo banjila bamunikilwe.”<verse eid="LUK 8:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />“Nkaambo takukwe chisisidwe pe chitakwe kuyoozwa antangalala, nikuba kufumbwa nsiiswa iyooleka kufunkununwa kuza kumumuni.”<verse eid="LUK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />“Ngamuchenjele aboobo nzila njimumvwa aayo, nkaambo ooyo ujisi uyooyungizigwa, alimwi ooyo utajisi, azeezyo nzyayeeya kuti ulijisi uyoonyanzigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Banyina aBakulana baJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mateyu 12:46-50</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:31-35">Makko 3:31-35</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />Lino bayina aJesu abanike bakwe bakaza kabayanda kwaambula awe, pesi taakwe nibakakonzya kusika mpakalibede nkaambo kamakamu. <verse eid="LUK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Mpawo umwi wakamwaambila kuti, “Banyoko abanike bako baliimvwi aanze, bayanda kukubona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />Pesi wakavwiila wati, “Baama abanike bangu mbaaba bamvwa ijwi lya Leza akulichita.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wumuzya Muuwo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mateyu 8:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:35-41">Makko 4:35-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Buzuba bumwi wakayinka waakunjila mubwaato abasikwiiya bakwe, mpawo wati, “Ngatuzubukile mutaleeliya yalwizi.” Mpawo bakazubuka baya mutala. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Mpawo nibakali kuyabuyamba wakoona. Alimwi kwakawunga iguwo pati lyamulwizi, bakazula ameenda, alimwi bakali mupenzi. <verse eid="LUK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />Mpawo bakayinka bamubusya bati, “Mwami, Mwami, tuliikufwa!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">Alimwi wakabuka wakulayilila iguwo amayuwe mumeenda; mpawo meenda akabatama. <verse eid="LUK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Mpawo wakababuzya wati, “Lulaali lusyomo lwanu?” Alimwi bakayoowa bakaankamana, bakaambilana bati, “Ngwani ooyu ulayilila niliba guuwo ameenda, mpawo zimuswiilile?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mwaalumi Ula Basikazwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mateyu 8:28-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:1-20">Makko 5:1-20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />Mpawo bakayamba baakusika kubusena bwaba Gerasene, bulangene aGalili. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />Mpawo Jesu naakazwa wakalyata kunkomwe, wakaswaniya mwaalumi uzwa muchisi wakala muuya mubi; kwachiindi chilamfu taakali kuzwaata zisamo pe, taakali kukkala muŋanda pesi mumagolo azibunda. <verse eid="LUK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />Naakabona Jesu, wakagawula, wawida kumawulu aakwe, mpawo wompolola ajwi pati wati, “Ujisi nzi andime, Jesu, Mwana waLeza Sijulu lyaMajulu? Ndakukumbila, kuti utandipenzyi.” <verse eid="LUK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />Nkaambo Jesu wakalayilila muuya mubi kuti uzwe mumwaalumi ooyu. (Nkaambo chiindi chiingi wakali kunoonga wamusikila; wakali kulindwa, akwaangwa anketani kumaboko akumawulu, pesi wakali kuzidunsula alimwi wakali kutolwa asikazwa kubusena butakwe bantu.)<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />Eelyo Jesu wakamubuzya kuti, “Nduweni zina lyako?” Mpawo wakamuvwiila wati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">“Ndime Ligiyoni”; nkaambo wakalinjidwe abasikazwa bayiingi. <verse eid="LUK 8:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />Mpawo yakamukumbila kuti atayitandili mumulindi utagoli.<verse eid="LUK 8:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />Lino kwakali butanga bupati bwangulube bwakali kuchela kumbali achilundu; eelyo myuuya yakamukumbila kuti ikanjile mungulube. Mpawo wakiizumizya kuti iyeende. <verse eid="LUK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Mpawo basikazwa bakazwa kuli ooyu mwaalumi mpawo bakunjila mungulube, mpawo butanga bwakachijana bwakukunukila mulwizi mpawo bwanikila.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Lino aabo beembeli nibakabona zyakachitika, bakachija, mpawo bakubaambila eezi muchisi amunyika. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Mpawo bantu bakazwa kukuyoolanga zyakachitika, alimwi bakaza kuli Jesu, mpawo bakamujana mwaalumi wakali abasikazwa bakali baandwa, kakkede kumawulu aJesu, kazweete alimwi kalomene; mpawo bakayoowa. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />Lino aabo bakali bazibona bakabaambila kuti ooyo wakali abasikazwa wakapona. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />Mpawo bantu bamasena abambene anyika yaGerasene bakamukumbila kuti ayende, nkaambo bakali bazula kuyoowa, alimwi wakanjila mubwaato mpawo wabweeda. <verse eid="LUK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />Lino ooyo mwaalumi wakagwisigwa muuya mubi wabasikazwa, wakakumbila kuti akkale aawe;</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:38">pesi wakamulayilila, wati, <verse eid="LUK 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Bweeda kuli bakuŋanda yanu, ukabaambile akubatondeezya eezyo Leza nzyakuchitila.” Alimwi mwaalumi ooyu wakeenda, kalokwaambila chisi choonse eezyo zyoonse zipati nzyakachitilwa aJesu.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwana Musimbi waJayirasi aMwanakazi Wakajata Chikobela ChaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mateyu 9:18-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 5:21-43">Makko 5:21-43</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Lino Jesu naakaboola, nkamu yakamutambula, nkaambo boonse bakali kulinda nguwe. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Alimwi kwakaza mwaalumi izina lyakwe utegwa Jayirasi, wakali mweendelezi wachikombelo chabaJuda; mpawo wakafugama kumawulu aJesu wamukumbila kuti beende aamwi kuŋanda yakwe, <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Nkaambo wakali amwana musimbi uumwi biyo, ulaminyaka ilikkumi ayibili, alimwi wakali waamba kufwa. Alimwi nakeenda,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">inkamu yabantu yakali kumusyanikizya. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Mpawo kwakali mwanakazi wakalaabulwazi bwakalobola kwaminyaka ilikkumi ayibili; alimwi taakwe wakamuponiya pe. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Wakaza kusule lyakwe mpawo wajata mupimbili wachisamo chakwe, alimwi mpawaawo bulwazi bwakalobola bwakamana. <verse eid="LUK 8:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />Eelyo Jesu wakabuzya wati, “Ngwani wandijata?” Eelyo boonse nibakakazya,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Pita wakati, “Mwami, inkamu ilikuzyungulukide akukusyanikizya.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />Pesi Jesu wakati, “Kuli umwi wandijata; nkaambo ndamvwa nguzu kazizwa kulindime.” <verse eid="LUK 8:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Mwanakazi naakabona kuti tachikonzyi pe kulisisa, wakaza bukankama; mpawo wakafugama kumawulu aakwe, wakaamba kunembo lyabantu boonse kuti nkaamboonzi chapa kuti amujate, alimwi ambwaakabuka akupona mpawaawo. <verse eid="LUK 8:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />Jesu wakati kulinguwe, “Yomusimbi, lusyomo lwako lwakuponiya; koya muluumuno.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Naakachili kwaambuula, kwakaza umwi mwaalumi mweendelezi wachikombelo chabaJuda, wakamwaambila wati, “Simalelo wangu utalikatazyi mwana musimbi wako wafwa.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Jesu naakamvwa oobo wakavwiila wati, “Utayoowi, syoma biyo, alimwi mwana musimbi wako ulapona.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />Mpawo naakasika kuŋanda yaJayirasi, taakwe mbakazumizya kunjila awe, kunze kwa Pita aJoni aJakkobbu awisi abayina baMwana. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />Bantu boonse muchiindi nchicheecho bakali kulila akuumamubila nkaambo kamwana, pesi Jesu wakati, “Mutalili, nkaambo tafwide pe, mwana muumi pesi ulede biyo.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />Mpawo bakamuseka, kabazi kuti mwana wakalifwide. <verse eid="LUK 8:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />Pesi wakamujata aluboko mpawo wati, “Yomwana buka!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />Mpawo muuya wakwe musimbi wakaboola, eelyo mpawawo wakabuka, alimwi Jesu wakabalayilila kuti bape mwana chakulya. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Mpawo bazyali bakwe bakagamba, alimwi Jesu wakabalayilila kuti bataambili naba uumwi zyakachitika.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Utuma Basikwiiya Bakwe Balikkumi Ababili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mateyu 10:5-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:7-13">Makko 6:7-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Mpawo Jesu wakayita basikwiiya bakwe balikkumi ababili atoomwe mpawo wakabaabila nguzu abweendelezi atala abasikazwa boonse, akusilika malwazi, <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />mpawo wakabatuma kuti bayiinke bakakukambawuke bwami bwaLeza, akuponiya bachiswa. <verse eid="LUK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />Alimwi Jesu wakabalayilila wati, “Mulweendo lwanu mutabwezi musako nikuba chikwama nikuba chakulya nikuba mali alimwi mutakabi azisamo zibili. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Lino kufumbwa ŋanda njimutakakunjile, ngamukakkale mumo, mane mukakuzwe mudolopo eelyo. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Kufumbwa nkubatakaleke kumutambula, nimwaakuzwa mugunzi eelyo, mukakunkumune lusuko lyabo kumawulu aanu eezi ziyooba bukamboni biyo atala ambabo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />Bakazwa mpawo bakayinda mumyuunzi, kabalikukambawuka makani mabotu akuponiya bantu mumasena woonse.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzumina Kwa Herodi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mateyu 14:1-12</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:14-29">Makko 6:14-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />Lino Herodi mweendelezi naakamvwa mpuwo yazezyo zintu zyoonse zyakachitwa, takukwe nakakkalinkana pe, nkaambo zyakali zyaambwa kuti Joni wabuka kuzwa kubafu, <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />Lino bamwi bantu bakati ngu Elayija waliyubununa, alimwi bamwi bakati musinsimi wachiindi wabuka lubo. <verse eid="LUK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Herodi wakati, “Joni ndakamugonka mutwe; pesi ngwani ooyu ngundiliikumvwa atala azintu zili boobu?” Alimwi wakalombozya kumubona.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Usanina Bali Myaanda Ine</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mateyu 14:13-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:30-44">Makko 6:30-44</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Joni 6:1-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Nibakabweeda batumwa bakamwaambila zyoonse nzibakachita. Mpawo wakababweza weenda aabo kuchisi chitegwa Bbetisayida. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Inkamu niyakamvwa, yakatobela; mpawo wakiitambula alimwi wakaambuula aabo atala abwami bwaLeza, akuponiya aabo bakali kuyanda kuponesegwa.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />Lino izuba nilyakaya kukubbila; balikkumi ababili bakaza mpawo bati kulinguwe, “Leka bantu aaba beende, baye mumyuunzi amunyika zilaafwiifwi, bakajane busena bwakoona achakulya; nkaambo swebo omuno tuli mubusena buli abulikke.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />Pesi Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Amubape chakulya.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Mpawo bakati, “Taakwe nchitulaacho kunze zinkwa zilimusanu abaswi babili kunze kwakuti tweende tukawule chakulya chabantu boonse aaba.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />Nkaambo kwakali baalumi bakali mbuli zyuulu zilimusanu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Mpawo wakati kuli basikwiiya bakwe, “Amubalayilile bakkale aansi mutubunga, twamakumi alimusanu.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />Alimwi bakachita oobo, mpawo bakabalayilila kuti bakkale aansi boonse. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />Mpawo wakabweza zinkwa zilimusanu abaswi babili walanga kujulu, mpawo wakazilongezya akuzikwamuna, mpawo wakapa basikwiiya bakwe kuti baabile nkamu. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />Alimwi boonse bakalya mpawo bakkuta. Alimwi bakabwezelela bufwefwelenga bwakachaala, bazuzya zisuwo zilikkumi azibili.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Mbwakamwamba Kuti Jesu Ngwani</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:13-19">Mateyu 16:13-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:27-29">Makko 8:27-29</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Alimwi kwakaba kuti mulichimwi chiindi nakalikukomba basikwiiya bakwe bakalaanguwe; mpawo wakababuzya wati, “Ani bantu bandaamba kuti ndimeni?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Bakavwiila bati, “Joni muBbapatizi; pesi bamwi bakati, nguElayija; alimwi bamwi bakati, ngumwi wabasinsimi wachiindi wabuka.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Mpawo wakabuzya wati, “Pesi nywebo mundaamba kuti ndimeni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">Pita wakavwiila wati, “Nduwe Kkirisitu waLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waambuula Atala Amapenzi Aakwe aKufwa Kwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:20-28">Mateyu 16:20-28</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 8:30-9:1">Makko 8:30—9:1</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />Pesi wakabaambila akubalayilila kuti bataambili nikuba uumwi, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />kati, “Mwana aMuntu uyoopenzegwa munzila zyiingi, akuyootamwa abapati babantu abapayizi bapati abayiisyi bamulawu akujayigwa, mpawo mubuzuba bwachitatu kuzwa mubuzuba mbwaakafwa uyoobusigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Alimwi wakati kuli boonse, “Naakuti muntu wayanda kunditobela, uleelede kulitakata akubweza chiingano chakwe mazuba woonse akunditobela. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Nkaambo kufumbwa ukwaabilila buumi bwakwe uyobusweekelwa; alimwi kufumbwa usweekelwa buumi bwakwe nkaambo kangu, uyoobujana. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />Nkaambo nimpindunzi muntu njajana kuti wajana nyika yoonse mpawo wasweekelwa muuya wakwe? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Nkaambo kufumbwa ufwa bweeme nkaambo kangu alimwi nkaambo kamajwi angu, alakwe Mwana aMuntu uyoomufwida bweeme aakuza mubulemu bwakwe abulemu bwaWisi abwa baangelo basalala. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Pesi ndamwaambila kasimpe, kuli bamwi bayimvwi aawa tabakwe kuyoolabila lufu pe kabatana bona bwami bwaLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaakasanduka</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:1-8">Mateyu 17:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:2-8">Makko 9:2-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Lino nikwayinda mazuba alimusanu aatatu awo Jesu nakaamba aaya majwi, wakeenda aPita aJoni aJakkobbu, mpawo wakatanta aabo chilundu kukuyookomba. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />Mpawo naakalichili kukomba, busyu bwakwe bwakasanduka, alimwi zisamo zyakwe zyakatuba bu akubayima mbuli kalabi. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />Alimwi laanga, baalumi babili bakali kwaambuula awe, aabo bakali Mozesi aElayija, <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />bakayubunuka mubulemu bwakwe alimwi wakaambuula aabo atala alufu lwakwe mbwaakaleelede kuyozuzikizigwa kuJerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />Lino Pita abaabo mbakali aabo, bakafuntwa ngonzi; nibakabuka, bakabona bulemu bwaJesu abaalumi babili bakaliimvwi aawe. <verse eid="LUK 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Alimwi aaba baalumi nibakali kwanzana, Pita wakati kuli Jesu, “Mwami, tee chibotu na kulindiswe kuti tukkale aano tuyake zidyumba izitatu, chimwi chako, chimwi chaMozesi, alimwi chimwi chaElayija.” (Katazi nzyakali kwamba.)<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Naakachili kwaambuula oobo, kwakaza joba lyabavumba; mpawo bakayoowa nibakali kuvumbwa ajoba. <verse eid="LUK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />Mpawo kwakazwa jwi lyaLeza kuzwa mujoba, lyakati, “Ooyu Mwana wangu, nguNdakasala; amumuswilile!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Mpawo jwi nilyakamana kwaambuula, Jesu wakachaala kalaalikke. Alimwi basikwiiya bakazibaamba nkilinsiiswa teebaakambila muntu pe naba uumwi muchiindi eecho atala nzibakabona.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mulombe Ula Muuya Muubi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateyu 17:14-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Lino buzuba butobela, nibakaseluka kuzwa kuchilundu, nkamu mpati yakamutambula. <verse eid="LUK 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />Mpawawo uumwi mwaalumi wakali munkamu eeyi wakompolola wati, “Muyiisyi, ndakukumbila kuti ufwide luse mwanaangu, nkaambo ngunguwe alikke. <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />Alimwi laanga muuya mubi ngawamunjila, mpawo ulakwiila; alimwi ngawamuchisa mpawo wamugwisya kkovu, ngawamuzapawula mpawo uzwa chabuyumuyumu. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />Ndakakumbila basikwiiya bako kuti bawutande pesi wakabakachila.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />Mpawo Jesu wakavwiila wati, “Nywebo izyalani litakwe lusyomo liswekede, kuyooba liili kandichikkede andinywe akumulampisizya moyo? Amumweete okuno mwana.”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Mulombe nakali kuyobuza kuli Jesu, sikazwa wakamusuntula wawida ansi, wakagwayala. Pesi Jesu wakalayilila muuya mubi, alimwi mulombe wakapona mpawo wakamutola kuli wisi.<verse eid="LUK 9:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waambuula Atala Alufu Lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:14-18">Mateyu 17:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Makko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Alimwi boonse bakagambwa kubona nguzu zyaLeza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Pesi nibakachiligambide umwi awumwi kuzintu zyakachitwa aJesu, wakaambila basikwiiya bakwe wati,<verse eid="LUK 9:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waamba Lubo Atala Alufu Lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 17:22">Mateyu 17:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 17:23">23</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:30-32">Makko 9:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Aya majwi nganjile mumatwi anu; nkaambo Mwana aMuntu uyoowabwa mumaanza abantu.” <verse eid="LUK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Pesi tebakaamvwisisisya pe nchaakali kwaambuula kuti chaambaanzi, nkaambo chakilisisidwe kulimbabo, kuchitila kuti batachimvwi, alimwi bakayoowa kukumbila kubuzya, kuti zyaambanzi.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguwani Mupati?</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mateyu 18:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:33-37">Makko 9:33-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />Mpawo kwakaba kukazyaniya kuti utakabe mupati akati kabo ngwani. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />Pesi Jesu naakaziba nzibakali kuyeeya, wakabweeza mwana muniini, mpawo wamwiimikizya kumbali lyakwe, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />alimwi Jesu wati, “Kufumbwa utambula mwana muniini muzina lyangu wanditambula ndimwini, mpawo ooyo utambula ndime watambula ooyo wakandituma; nkaambo ooyo wamamanino akati kanu moonse uyooba mupati.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ooyo Utalwani Andinywe Ulamwi Andinywe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 9:38-40">Makko 9:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />Joni wakavwiila wati, “Mwami, twamubona umwi kalikutanda muuya mubi muzina lyako, mpawo swe tweezya kumukalalila, nkaambo tali uumwi wesu pe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />Pesi Jesu wakati, “Mutamukasyi pe; nkaambo ooyu utalwani anyweebo talisinkondonyokwe pe.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisi Cha Samariya Chikaka Kutambula Jesu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />Awo mazuba naakaba afwiifwi akuti atolwe kujulu, wakapanga lweendo lyakuuya kuJerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:52. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:5">Mat 10:5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:4">Jn 4:4</ref>.</char></note>Alimwi wakatuma batuumwa kuti batunge kunembo lyakwe, kuti bakamubambile; mpawo bakakunjila mumuunzi yabaSamariya, kuti bakakumubambile, <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />pesi bantu bankuko teebakamutambula pe, nkaambo busyu bwakwe bwakali kutondezya kuti uyobuya kuJerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 9:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:54. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 3:17">Mkk 3:17</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 1:9-16">2 Bam 1:9-16</ref>.</char></note> Awo basikwiiya baJesu Jakkobbu aJoni nibakabona eezi, bakamubuzya bati “Mwami, ulayanda na kuti tulayilile mulilo useluke kuzwa kujulu, ubanyonyone?” <verse eid="LUK 9:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Pesi Jesu wakabacheba mpawo wabakalalila. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Mpawo bakaya kuluumbi muunzi.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kutobela Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 8:19-22">Mateyu 8:19-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Nibakali kuyabweenda munzila, uumwi mwaalumi wakati kuli Jesu, “Mwami ndilakutobela kufumbwa nkutaye.” <verse eid="LUK 9:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />Mpawo Jesu wakamwaambila wati, “Bamwaaba bala mpako, alimwi bayuni bawuluka kujulu balaazisaba, pesi Mwana aMuntu takwe mpalaabusena bwakulyokeezya.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />Mpawo wakati kuli uumbi mwaalumi “Nditobele.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Pesi wakamuvwiila wati, “Mwami, ndileke saansi ndiinke ndikazikke ndeende.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />Jesu wakamwaambila wati, “Amuleke bafwide bavwike bafwide; pesi iwe, kuuya ukakambawuke ibwami bwaLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Alimwi umwi alakwe wakati, “Mwami, ndilakutobela; pesi ndileke saansi ndiinke ndikalaye aabo bampuli.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Mpawo Jesu wakamwaambila wati, “Takwe muntu ujata jamba kalanga musule, ulaacheelelo mubwami bwaLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Utuma Bali Makkumi Alimusanu Abili Ababili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Nikwakayinda eezyo, Mwami wakasala baambi basikwiiya balimakumi alimusanu abili ababili, mpawo wabatuma kuti bayiinke nembo lyakwe kabali babilibabili mumasena asiyene, ooko Mwami nkwakalikuyanda kuuya. <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />Mpawo wakabaambila wati, “Butebuzi mbuyiingi, pesi basikutebula mbache; kamukomba kuti Mwami wabutebuzi, atume babeleki mumuunda. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Kamuya! Amulange, ndamutuma mbuli tubelele akati kabawumpe. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Mutanyampuli nikuba kakwama, nikuba chikwama nikuba insangu; alimwi mutakajuzyi kufumbwa ngumutakuswaniye munzila. <verse eid="LUK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Kufumbwa ŋanda njimuya kunjila, lutaanzi mukakwaambe kuti, ‘Luumuno lube muŋanda eeyo!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Alimwi kuti muna aŋanda wabilana andinywe muluumuno, luumuno lwanu luyokkala alinguwe; pesi kuti kwataba boobo, luyobweeda kulindinywe. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Alimwi mukakkale muŋanda njiyeeyo, mukaakulye akunywa ezyo nzibayoomupa, nkaambo simulimu ulaachelelo kumpindu zyakwe; mutakayinki kuŋanda aŋanda. <verse eid="LUK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Kufumbwa muunzi ngumuyonjila alimwi baakumutambula ngamukalye eezyo nzibatakayengezye. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Mukaponiye bachiswa bali nkukoko, alimwi mukabaambile, ‘Bwami bwaLeza bwaba afwiifwi andinywe.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Pesi mwaakunjila mumuunzi mpawo teebamutambula, kamuya mutuzila, mpawo mwaambe, <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘Nikuba lusuko lwagunzi lyanu luli kumawulu eesu, tulamukunkumwida; nikuba boobo amuzizibe ezi, kuti bwami bwaLeza bwaba afwiifwi andinywe.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Ndamwaambila, kuyooba chisubulo chipati mubuzuba byaSodomu kwiinda elyo guunzi.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chisi Chitazumini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:20-24">Mateyu 11:20-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Maawe kulindinywe, baKkorazini! Maawe kulindinwe, Bbetisayida! Nkaambo nikuunga milimu mipati yakachitwa kulinduwe yakali yachitilwa kuTaya aku Sidoni, bakali kunosanduka chiindi chakale, balakkala muzisamo zyamasaka amudyota! <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Pesi chiyooba chuuba kapati kuTaya aSidoni mubuzuba bwalubeta kwiinda ndinywe. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:15. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 14:13-15">Ay 14:13-15</ref>.</char></note>Alimwi anduwe, Kkapenawumi, iwe tukwe kuyoosumpulwa pe kujulu? Pesi uyoowalilwa muchikkalilo chabafu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />“Ooyo umvwa ndinywe umvwa ndime, alimwi ooyo umutama utama ndime, alimwi ooyo utama ndime unoli utama ooyo wakandituma.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuboola Kwabali Kkumi Alimusanu Abili Ababili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Balimakumi alimusanu abili ababili bakaboola mulukondo, kabati, “Mwami, nibaba basikazwa bakazwa muzina lyako!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />Mpawo wakabaambila wati, “Ndabona Satani kali kuwa mbuli kalabi kuzwa kujulu. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Amulange, ndamupa nguzu zyakulyata atala abazoka atubanze, alimwi atala anguzu zyoonse zyasinkondoma; alimwi takukwe kumuchisa pe. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Nikuba oobo mutabotelwi muli zeezi, kuti mwatanda myuuya mibi; pesi amubotelwe kuti mazina aanu alembwa kujulu.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ulakondwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:25-27">Mateyu 11:25-27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 13:16">13:16</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:17">17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Muchiindi eecho Jesu wakakondwa muMuuya Usalala mpawo wati, “Ndalumba, Taata, Mwami wakujulu anyika, nkaambo wakasisa zintu eezi kubasongo abayiide, pesi mwakaziyubununa kubana baniini nikuba boobo chakabota kubusyu bwanu Taata. <verse eid="LUK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:22. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 28:18">Mat 28:18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 3:35">Jn 3:35</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:3">13:3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 10:15">10:15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 17:25">17:25</ref>.</char></note> Zyoonse zintu zyakapegwa kulindime kuzwa kuli Taata; alimwi takukwe muntu uuzi Mwana kuunze kwaTaata, nikuba kuti Wisi kuti ngwani kuunze kwaMwana alimwi kufumbwa kuliyooyo Mwana ngwasala kuti amuyubunune Taata.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Alimwi wakacheba kuli basikwiiya bakwe mpawo wakabaambila mukavwindi wati, “Alaachoolwe meso abona eezyo nzimubwene! <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Nkaambo ndamwaambila kuti, basinsimi abami bayiingi bakali achiyandisyo chakubona eezi zimubwene, alimwi tebachibona pe, akuti bamvwe eechi nchimumvwide, pesi tebakazimvwa pe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wamu Samariya Mubotu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Alimwi laanga, umwi muyiisi wamulawu wakabuka, wakali kuyanda kusunka Jesu, wakati, “Mwami, ndichite biyeni kuti ndikajane buumi butamani?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />Jesu wakamuvwiila wati, “Niinzi chilembedwe mumulawu? Ubala biyeni iwe?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />Alimwi wakamuvwiila wati, “Yanda Mwami Leza wako amoyo wako woonse, amuuya wako woonse, anguzu zyako zyoonse, amuyeeyo wako woonse; mpawo uyande baabo mbumuyakilene aabo mbuli lyaako.”<verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />Mpawo Jesu wakati, “Waamba kasimpe; zichite ezi kuti, alimwi uyoopona.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Pesi wakayanda, kulisalazya wati kuli Jesu, “Ani ngwani ngundiyakilene awe?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />Jesu wakamuvwiila wati, “Kwakali mwaalumi wakakunuka kazwa muJerusalemu kaya kuJerikko, wakaswanana ababbi, aabo bakamuuma bamuzuununa zisamo, bakamusiya kalisuntukide. <verse eid="LUK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Mpawo kwakaza muPayizi munzila njiyeeyo; naakamulanga mwaalumi ooyu wakabembeleka. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Alimwi kwakaza muLevi, naakasika afwiifwi wakamulanga mwaalumi ooyu alakwe mpawo wakabembeleka. <verse eid="LUK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Pesi muSamariya, naakali kuyoobuya mulweendo lwakwe, wakasika mpakalilede mwaalumi naakamubona mpawo wakamufwida luzyalo, <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />alimwi wakasika mpakalilede, mpawo wamutila mafuta mpawo awayini; wakamulambila midabba azilonda zyakwe, wamubweza ambongolo yakwe wamweeta kuŋanda yabeenzu ooko nkwaka kumoonga. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Alimwi mubuzuba butobela, awo naakali kubambila kunjila nzila mulweendo lwakwe wakabweza makkobili abili, wakapa ooyu siŋanda yabanakweenda, wakamwaambila wati, ‘Ndikumbila umoonge mwaalumi ooyu; kufumbwa nchutabelesye kwiinda mali njindasiya, nzokupa ndaboola.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />“Lino ngwani alibaba bantu batatu, nguyeeya kuti, wakatondezya kuba muyakizyani wayooyu mwaalumi wakawumwa abasikubba?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Mpawo wakati, “Ngooyu wakamufwida luse mwaalumi ooyo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Alimwi Jesu wakamwaambila wati, “Kuya ukachite mbuboobo anduwe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uswaya Maata aMeri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Lino nibakali kuyabweenda abasikwiiya bakwe, Jesu wakanjila mugunzi; eelyo kwakali umwi mwanakazi wakali kutegwa zina lyakwe nguMaata wakamutambula muŋanda yakwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />Alimwi wakala mwanike wakwe wakalikutegwa Meri, ooyo wakakkala afwiifwi aMwami, kalokuswilizya injiisyo yakwe. <verse eid="LUK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Pesi Maata wakali kubakutawukila; mpawo wakaya kulinguwe wati, “Mwami, tulipenzyi na kuti mwanike wangu wandilekelezya kandilokukutawuka andilikke? Mwaambile kuti aze azondigwasye.”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />Pesi Mwami wakamuvwiila wati, “Maata, Maata, nkaamboonzi nulikatazya atala azintu zyiingi; <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />chintu chimwi chibotu chiyandikana. Alimwi Meri wasala chibela chibotu, nchatakwe kuyoonyanzigwa pe.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Uyiisya Atala Akukomba</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:9-13">Mateyu 6:9-13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 7:7-11">7:7-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:1. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="MRK 1:35">Mkk 1:35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3:21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:16">5:16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18">9:18</ref>,<ref loc="LUK 9:28">28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33">5:33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:18">7:18</ref>.</char>
    </note>Muli bumwi buzuba Jesu kali kukomba mubusena bumwi, lino naakamana kukomba, umwi wabasikwiiya bakwe wakamwaambila wati, “Mwami, tuyiisye kukomba, mbuli Joni mbwakayiisya basikwiiya bakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Mpawo wakabaambila wati, “Nimukomba, kamwaamba kuti:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Taata wesu ulikujulu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Alilemekwe zina lyako.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:2">Bwami bwako abusike.<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />Utupe buzuba abuzuba chakulya eecho nchituyanda.<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />Alimwi utulekelele zibi zyesu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 11:4">mbuli mbutu balekelela aabo batubisizya.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Mutatuzulwidi mumisunko.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Eelyo Jesu wakabaambila wati, “Ngwani akati kanu ulamweenzunyina uza akati kamansiku wati kulinguwe, ‘Mweenzuma, ndicheneke zinkwa zitatu; <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Nkaambo ndaswayigwa mweenzuma wazwa mulweendo lulamfu pesi mebo nsikwe chakulya pe kuti ndimupe.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />Alimwi uyovwiila kalimukati kuti, ‘Utandikatazyi; mulyango wajalwa kale, alimwi bana bangu balamwi andime kubulo; tandikonzyi pe kuti ndibuke ndikupe nikuba chili.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Ndamwaambila, nikuba kuti takonzyi kubuka kuti amupe, pesi nkaambo kakuti mweenzunyina, nkaambo kwakukakatila ulabuka akuyinka kuyoomupa kufumbwa nzyayanda. <verse eid="LUK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Alimwi ndamwaambila kuti, kamukumbila, alimwi mulapegwa; kamuyanduula mulajana, kamukonkomona mulajulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Nkaambo kufumbwa woonse ukumbila ulapegwa, alimwi uyanduula ulajana, alakwe ukonkomona ulajulilwa. <verse eid="LUK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />Ngwani wisi akati kanu na mwana wako wakumbila muswi, kwiinda muswi inga ulamupa muzoka na? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Alubo akumbila iji, ulamupa kabanze na? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Kuti nywebo, nibasizibi, kamukonzya kupa bana banu zipo zibotu, ani kulaba biyeni kuli Taata wanu ulikujulu, upa Muuya Usalala kulibaabo bamukumbila!”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu aBbelizebbabbelu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:22-30">Mateyu 12:22-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 3:20-27">Makko 3:20-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Lino Jesu wakali kutanda sikazwa wasyatambi; lino sikazwa nuwakazwa, muntu ooyo syatambi wakaambula, alimwi bantu bakagamba. <verse eid="LUK 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Pesi bamwi bakati, “Waanda myuuya mibi kabelesya Bbelizabbabbu mweendelezi wabasikazwa.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />Alimwi bamwi, bakamusunka Jesu, kabakumbila kulinguwe chitondezyo chizwa kujulu kuli Leza. <verse eid="LUK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Pesi Jesu kazi miyeeyo yabo wakati, “Boonse bwami bwanzeene bulatakanika, alimwi iŋanda itanambene ilawida aansi. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Alimwi kuti Satani kaanzene mubwami bwakwe, bulayimimikila biyeni bwami bwakwe? Nkaambo mwaamba kuti nditanda basikazwa munguzu zyaBbelizabbabbu. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Alimwi kuti kanditanda basikazwa munguzu zya Bbelizabbabbu, lino bana banu ninguzu zyani nzibabelesya kukutanda? Lino bayooba babeteki banu. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Pesi kuti kakuli anguzu zyaLeza nkinditandya basikazwa, takuchikwe kudoneeka pe, zyabaantangalala kuti bwami bwaLeza bwaza alindinywe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />“Naa mwaalumi mukozu, kalaazilwanisyo zyeleede, wakwabilila lubuwa lwakwe, lubono lwakwe bunolondokede muluumuno. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Pesi kuti ulaanguzu zyiindilide waakumulwaniya akumuzunda, ulabweza zilwanisyo zyakwe zyoonse nzyabikilidide moyo, mpawo ulazyabanisya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />“Ooyu utali andime, ngusinkondoma, ulwana andime, mpawo ooyu utabunganiyi amwi andime ulamweya.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuboola Kwa Myuuya Mibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:43-45">Mateyu 12:43-45</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Naa muuya mubi wazwa mumuntu, ulayinda mumasena atakwe meenda pe kuyanduula kulyokezezya; alimwi kuti waabula, ulaamba kuti, ‘Ina ndibweede muŋanda mundakazwa,’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />Alimwi naaboola, ulajana busena buliyilidwe kabubambidwe kabotu bwasalala. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Lino ulayinka akatambe iimbi myuuya ilimusanu ayibili eeyo yindiide bubi kwinda nguwo, ulanjila ooyu muntu unoli wabija chakwindilila chiimo chasunu kwiinda jilo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lukondo Lwinilwini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Naakachili kwaambuula zintu eezi, umwi mwanakazi munkamu wakoompolola ajwi pati wati, “Bulaachoolwe bula bwakakutumbuka, ankolo nzuwakanyonka!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:28. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LUK 8:21">Luk 8:21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 15:14">Jn 15:14</ref>.</char>
    </note> Pesi wakati, “Alimwi balaachoolwe aabo bamvwa ijwi lyaLeza akulibamba!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuyanduula Chigambyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 12:38-42">Mateyu 12:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Awo nkamu niyakali kuvula, wakatalika kwaambuula wati, “Aaya mazyalani akompeme! Bayanduula chitondezyo; pesi takukwe chitondezyo chiyoobawo pe, pesi aayo akaba muchiindi chamusinsimi Jona. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Nkaambo mbuli Jona wakaba chitondezyo kubantu baNiniva, mbumbubo mbukubede akumazyalani asunu, lino Mwana aMuntu mbayooba kuzyalani eli. <verse eid="LUK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Nabulelo wakuNyika uyoobuka mulubeta abaalumi amazyalani alino akubapa mulandu, nkaambo wakazwa kumagolelo anyika azomvwe busongo bwamwaami Solomoni, alimwi amulange, umwi mupati kwiinda Solomoni ulaano. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Bantu bamu Niniva, bayoobukila mukubetekwa alubeta lwamazyalani aaya, akuyonyontooka, nkaambo bakasanduka kukukambawuka kwaJona; alimwi amulange chimwi mupati kwiinda Jona ulaano!”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mumuni Wamubili</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mateyu 5:15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 6:22">6:22</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 6:23">23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Takukwe uyasya chimwinikisyo mpawo alibike muchinkuma, nikubamunsi lyatebuli, pesi ulabika achibikilo chimwinikisyo ataangalala kuchitila kuti aabo banjila babone mumuuni. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Igisyo lyako ndilampi lyamubili wako, nchinchicho naakuti igisyo lyako kalizwide mumuuni, alimwi mubili woonse ulajana mumuuni, pesi kuti igisyo lyako lyaba bbi, mubili woonse ulazula mudima. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Nkikaako amuchenjele kuti mumuuni uli mulindinywe utabi mudima pe. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Eelyo kuti mubili wako woonse wazula mumuuni, kakutakwe naba amwi alimudima, woonse mubili uyooba amumuuni mbuli chimwinikisyo mbuli bekema kukumwinika kwalyo.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Upa Mulandu baFarisi aBayiisi baMulawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateyu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Makko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Nakachili kwaambuula, uumwi muFarisi wakamukumbila wamutamba kuti balye aamwi; eelyo Jesu wakanjila wakkala atebuli. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />MuFarisi wakagamba kuti nkaamboonzi natasambide pe katanaalya. <verse eid="LUK 11:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Mpawo Mwami wakati kulinguwe, “Lino inywe nibaFarisi musalazya anze lyankomechi andido, pesi mukati kanu kuzwide kulisumpula abusofwazi. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Inywe nubafubafuba! Tee ooyo wakalenga zili anze ngunguwe wakalenga zilimukati azilazyo? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Pesi mupe zipo kuzintu ezyo zimujisi; alimwi muzibe kuti, zyoonse zintu zilasalala kulindinywe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">11:42. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="LEV 27:30">Lev 27:30</ref>.</char>
    </note> “Pesi maawe kulindinywe nibaFarisi! Nkaambo mupa chakumi chamini, chisyungwa, azisyu zyamumuunda azimwi zisiyene, alimwi mutaaluka kubeteka mukasimpe amuluyando lwaLeza; ezyo nzimweelede kuchita, kamutasiyi zimwi pe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />“Maawe kulindinywe nibaFarisi! Muyanda zyuuno zili ajulu muzikombelo zyabaJuda, alimwi muyandisya kujuzigwa chabulemu kuzisambalilo. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Maawe kulindinywe! Nkaambo muli mbuli zibunda zitaliboniyi pe, alimwi bantu beenda atala azyo kabatazizi pe.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Lino umwi wabayiisi bamulawu wakamumvwila wati, “Muyiisyi, aswebo watukalalila.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />Mpawo wakabaambila wati, “Maawe kulindinywe nibayiisi bamulawu! Nkaambo mulemya bantu mukuli milemu, anywebo njimutakonzyi kunyampula pe akanwe kanu kamwi. <verse eid="LUK 11:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Maawe kulindinywe! Nkaambo muyaka zibunda zyabasinsimi, aabo basinsimi bamawuso mbibakajeya. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Kasimpe mujisi bukamboni oobu buzuminina kusunda kwabamawuso; nichonzyo bakabajeya, mpawo mwayaka zibunda zyabo. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Nkikaako alabo busongo bwaLeza bwamba kuti, ‘Ndiyoobatumina basinsimi abatumwa, mpawo bamwi babo bayoobajeya akubapenziya,’ <verse eid="LUK 11:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />kuti oobo bulowa bwabasinsimi boonse, obo mbumwakatila kuzwa kumalengelo anyika, buyoyitwa kuzyalani eeli, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />kuzwa kubulowa bwa Abbelo kuyosika kubulowa bwaZakkariya, ooyo wakafwa akati kaŋanda yaLeza achipayililo abusena busalala. Iyi ndambwaambila buyoyitwa kumazyalani aaya!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />“Maawe nubayiisi bamulawu! Nkaambo mwakasowa chijuzyo chaluzibo; takukwe nimwakanjila nibeni, alimwi mwakabinda aabo bakalikuyanda kunjila kuti batanjili!”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />Alimwi nakalikweenda, bayiisyi bamulawu abaFarisi bakatalika kumubilizya chakwiindilila akumudyokola kuti aambuule zintu zyiingi, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />Kabali kuyubilila kuti bayanduule kaambo nkibatamutame aako kuti bamwaange.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s">Kuchenjezya Atala Akuupawupa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:26">Mateyu 10:26</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:27">27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />Muchiindi eecho, awo zyuulu zyankamu zyabantu nizyakabungene kazili kulyatana, wakatalika kwaambila basikwiiya bakwe wati, “Amuchenjelele bumena bwabaFarisi, kachaamba kuupawupa kwabo. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Nkaambo takukwe chivumbidwe chitakaleke kuyubununwa; nikuba chisisidwe chitakaleke kuzibikana. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Nkikaako kufumbwa nzuwakaamba mumudima ziyomvwigwa mumumuuni; alimwi kufumbwa nzuwakavwiiya kukutwi muchimpetu ziyoowambwa antangalala ansonge yaŋanda.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nguwani Weelede Kuti Tumuyowe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:28-31">Mateyu 10:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ndamwaambila, nibeenzuma, kuti mutayoowi aabo bajeya mubili, nikwaayinda awo takwe chimbi nibamana awo takukwe nchibakonzya kuchita pe. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Pesi ndamuchenjezya ngumweleede kuyoyoowa: mumuyoowe ooyo, naamana kujeya, ujisi nguzu zyakuwalila mubbila lyamulilo; iiyi ndamwaambila, mumuyoowe!”<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />“Ani tee tutiiti tulimusanu tulasambaalwa amuulo amakobili abili? Alimwi takukwe nikuba kamwi kalubidwe kubusyu bwaLeza. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />Nkaamboonzi, nikuba susu lilimumutwe wako lyoonse lilibalidwe. Mutayoowi; mulayandika kapati kwiinda tutiiti twiingi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuzumina aKumutama Kkirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:32">Mateyu 10:32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:33">33</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:32">12:32</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 10:19">10:19</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:20">20</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Alimwi ndamwaambila kuti, kufumbwa uyoondizumina kunembo lyabantu, alakwe Mwana aMuntu uyoomuzumina kunembo lyabaangelo baLeza; <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />pesi ooyo undikaka kunembo lyabantu alakwe ndiyomukaka kunembo lyabaangelo baLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 12:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />“Alimwi kufumbwa woonse waambuula bubi atala aMwana aMuntu uyolekelelwa; pesi ooyo utukila Muuya USalala takoyoolekelelwa pe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />“Alimwi kuti baakumweeta muzikombelo zyabaJuda abeendelezi abasinguzu, mutakayanduuli naakuti kuyeeya nzimuyovwiila, nikuba nzimuyoowaamba; <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />nkaambo Muuya Usalala uyomuyiisya muchiindi nchicheecho nzimweelede kwaambuula.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wamuvubi Mufubafuba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Umwi wankamu wakati kulinguwe, “Muyiisyi, layilila mukulana wangu kuti, twaabane lukono andime.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />Pesi Jesu wakati kulinguwe, “Yomuntu, ngwani wakandibika kuba mubetesi nikuba sikumwabaniya?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Alimwi wakati kulimbabo, “Amuswiilile, alimwi muchenjele, nkaambo buumi bwamuntu tabuli mubuvubi bwakwe bwiingi pe mbwalijanina.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />Mpawo wakabaambila mukozyanisyo kati, “Inyika yamuntu muvubi yakamupa butebuzi bwiingi loko. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />Mpawo wakaliyeeya mwini wati, ‘Ndichite biyeni, nkaambo tandikwe butala bwakubamba zilyo zyangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />Lino wakati, ‘Ndilachita oobu: ndiyomwayula matala angu, ndiyake mapati; mumo mundiyobamba zilyo zyangu zyoonse azintu zyangu zyoonse. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Alimwi ndiyoti kumuuya wangu, Muuya, wabambilwa zyeelede kwaminyaka miingi; lyookezye, lya, unywe, alimwi ubotelwe.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Pesi Leza wakati kulinguwe, ‘Iwe numufubafuba! Mansiku asunu ndilatola muuya wako; alimwi zintu nzuwakabambilila, ziyooba zyani?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Eelyo Jesu wakagozya akuti, “Mbombubo mbuziyooba kumuntu ulibambila buvubi bwakwe mwini, pesi katavubide pe kuli Leza.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubika Moyo Kuli Leza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:25-34">Mateyu 6:25-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Alimwi wakati kuli basikwiiya bakwe, “Nkiinkako ndamwaambila kuti, mutalikatazyi atala abuumi bwanu, kuti mulalyaayi, nikuba kuti mulasamayi amibili yanu. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Nkaambo buumi mbupati kwiinda chakulya, amubili mupati kwiinda zisamo. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Amulange makubi: taalimi nikuba kutebula, taakwe chiyoobweedo nibuba butala; nikuba oobo Leza ulaasanina. Kulibulemu biyeni kulindinywe numuyandwa kapati kwiinda bayuni! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />Alimwi nguni akati kanu ukonzya kuyungizya chisela chabuumi bwakwe nikuba aniini? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Kuti nywebo kamutakonzyi kuchita chintu chiniini chilimbuli eecho, nkaamboonzi nimulipenzya atala azintu zyoonse zyiingi? <verse eid="LUK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Amulange malubaluba, mbaamena; tabeleki akuluka pe; alimwi ndamwaambila eezi kuti Solomoni mubulemu bwakwe boonse takukwe naakali samide mbuli limwi lya aaya. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Kuti Leza kasamika bwiizu oobo bulimumuunda sunu, alimwi junza bwawalilwa mumulilo, uyokachilwa biyeni kumusamika nywebo, inywe balusyomo luniini!”<verse eid="LUK 12:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />“Alimwi mutayanduuli kuti mulalyayi, naakuti mulanywayi, nikuba kulipenziya mumiyeeyo yanu. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Nkaambo bantu batamuzi pe Leza bamunyika yoonse bayanduula eezi zintu; alimwi Taata wanu ulizizi kale nzimuyanda. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Anukuti, amuyanduule bwami bakwe, alimwi zyoonse zintu zimwi muyozipegwa alimwi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buvubi Buli Kujulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 6:19-21">Mateyu 6:19-21</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />“Mutayoowi, nukatanga kaniini, nkaambo nduyando lwaTaata wanu kuti amupe bwami. <verse eid="LUK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Amusambale nzimujisi, alimwi mupe lubono lwanu kubachete; mulijanine zikwama zitakulumpali, amwanzike buvubi kujulu oko kutakwe kukachilwa pe, ababba nkubatakonzyi kusika, nikuba bamusunse banyonyona. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Nkaambo oko kuli lubono lwako, alimwi nkuuli moyo wako.<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulanda Mulangilizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />“Amukkale kamulibambilidide kuchita mulimu, azilazyo zimwinikisyo zyanu kaliikuyaka, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />Alimwi amube mbuli bantu aabo balinda mwami wabo kuti asike, kazwa kupobwe lyakusimuna, kuchitila kuti aboola, akonkomona, bamujulide chakufwaambana. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Balaachoolwe aabo balanda bayojanika kabalindide aawo mwami akuboola; kasimpe, ndamwaambila kuti, uyoosama chisamo chamulimu, mpawo akabalayilile kuti bakkale atebuli balye, mpawo uyooza kukubakutawukila. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Balaachoolwe aabo balanda awo simalelo wabo akuboola mubulangilizyi nasika akatikaabo nikuba kubuchedo mpawo simalelo akubajana kabalokulanga! <verse eid="LUK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Pesi amuzibe eechi, kuti muna ŋanda naa walizi kuti sikubba ulasika chiindi nzi, taalikuno siya ŋanda yakwe kuti injilwe. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Anywebo ngamulibambile; nkaambo Mwana aMuntu ulaza muchiindi nchimutayeyeli pe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulanda Usyomekede Awuta Syomekede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:45-51">Mateyu 24:45-51</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Eelyo Pita wakati, “Mwami, ulokwaamba chikozyanisyo eechi kulindiswe na, naakuti kuliboonse bantu?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />Mpawo Mwami wakati, “Ngwani mulanda usyomeka amubanzi musongo, ooyo simalelo wakwe ngwayobikka bwendeelezi bwaŋanda yakwe, kuti abaabile chipanzi chakulya kuchiindi cheelede? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Ulaachoolwe mulanda ooyo simalelo wakwe nayooboola akajane ulokuchita oobo. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Ndamwaambila kasimpe, uyoomupa bweendelezi atala azyoonse nzyajisi. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Pesi naa mulanda ooyo waamba kuti mumoyo wakwe, ‘Simalelo wangu wachedwa kusika,’ alimwi watalika kuuma balanda baalumi abanakazi, mpawo watalika kulya kunywa, akukolwa, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />simalelo wayooyu mulanda uyoboola mubuzuba mbwatakukwe bulangilizi pe, alimwi muchiindi nchatazi pe, alimwi uyoomupa chisubulo chipati, akumubika aamwi abatasyomeki pe.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />“Alimwi ooyo mulanda wakazi luyando lwasimalelo wakwe, pesi katakwe nakalibambila nikuba kuchita mbuli mbwakalayililwa, uyoowumwa kapati. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />Pesi ooyo utakwe wakalizi pe, alimwi na watachita iziyanda kuti awumwe, uyowumwa buniini. Woonse kuliyooyo upegwa zyiingi, kuli nguwe kuloyandwa zyiingi; akuliyooyo muntu nkwalipeda kapati, kuyooyandwa zyiingi.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Weeta Kupambukaniya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:34-36">Mateyu 10:34-36</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />“Ndakaza kuti ndikutule mulilo anyika; alimwi ndalachiyandisyo chakuti niinga ukodede kale! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Pesi ndilalubbapatizyo ndundeelede kubbapatizigwa aalo; anzila njindeelede kuba amoyo mulamfu kusikila zikazuzikizigwe! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mwezyanga ndaza kuzopa luumuno anyika? Peepe, ndamwaambila, pesi ndazida kupambukaniya; <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />kuzwa lino balimusanu muŋanda iimwi bayoopambukana, batatu bayoolwanisya babili, alabo babili bayoolwanisya batatu; <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />bayoopambukana, wisi uyoolwanisya mwana wakwe alimwi mwana uyoolwanisya wisi, bayina bayoolwanisya mwana musimbi mpawo mwana musimbi uyolwanisya bayina, bayinazyala bayolwanisya mukamwana alakwe mukamwana uyolwanisya bayinazyala.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kumvwisisya Chiindi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 16:2">Mateyu 16:2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 16:3">3</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Lino wakaambila inkamu wati, “Mwakubona ijoba kalilokunyampuka kuzwa kumboo, mpawo mukaambe kuti, ‘Imvula yambakuwa’; alimwi kuyooba mbuboobo.” <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />Mpawo mwakubona iguwo lyawunga kuzwa kumusansa, mukambe kuti, “Kwaamba kupya, mpawo kuyooba mbuboobo. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Inywe nubasikuupawupa! Mulizi kupanduluula busyu bwajulu anyika; nkaamboonzi nimutakwizi kupanduluula chiindi echino?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubamba Makani Amweenzunyokwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:25">Mateyu 5:25</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:26">26</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />“Alimwi nkaamboonzi nimutakonzyi kubeteka ziluleme? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Nimwiinka ambimwasundila kunkuta, amusungwalile kwaamana makani kamuchilimunzila, nkaambo uyootolwa kumubetesi, alimwi sikubeteka uyokwaaba kuli bakapokola, mpawo bakapokola bayookuwalila muntolongo. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Ndamwaambila, kuti takukwe niyoozwa pe, mane ukaliye kkobili lyamamanino.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s">Kuleka Chibi Naakuti Ufwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Lino kwakali bamwi bakaliwo kuchiindi eecho bakaambila Jesu atala abaGalili aabo Payileti mbwaakajaya alimwi mbwaakaswanizya azipayizyo zyabo. <verse eid="LUK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />Mpawo wakabavwiila wati, “Muyeeya kuti aba baGalili bakali basizibi kwiinda boonse baGalili na, nkaambo bakapenzegwa munzila eeyo? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Ndamwaambila, Peepe; pesi kunze musanduke anywebo muyonyonyoka. <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Nibaba abaya balikkumi amusanu abatatu aabo bakawidwa anganzi yakuSilomi mpawo yakabalimba mpawo yabajeya, muyeeya kuti nywebo bakali basizibi kwiindilila na kwiinda boonse bakkala muJerusalemu? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Ndamwaambila, Peepe; pesi kunze kwakuti musanduka anywebo muyonyoonyonwa mbuli mbabo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wamukuyu Utazyali Michelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Eelyo Jesu wakabaambila mukozyanisyo ooyu wati: “Mwaalumi wakala mukuyu wakazikidwe mumuunda wakwe; alimwi wakaya kukulanga muchelo alinguwo alimwi tewakuujana pe. <verse eid="LUK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Mpawo wakaambila basikulima kuti, ‘Amulange, eeyi minyaka itaatu kandiliikusika kandiyanda muchelo kumukuyu ooyu, alimwi takwe chindijana pe. Amuugonkele aansi; nkaamboonzi nuweleede kubelesya ivu?’ <verse eid="LUK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />Alimwi sikulima wakamuvwiila wati, ‘Mwami, tuwulindile munyaka uumwi, mane ndilawusyida mumbali akuwubikkila mbole. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Mpawo kuti wazyala michelo munyaka utobela, nchinoli cheelela akubota; pesi kuti pe, muugonkele aansi.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mwanakazi Utyokede Musabata</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Lino wakali kuyiisya mulichimwi chikombelo chabaJuda musabata. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />Mpawo kwakali mwanakazi wakali amuuya wakumulebula kwaminyaka ilikkumi amusanu ayitatu; wakali wotomene takukwe naakali kukonzya pe kwimikila kabotu. <verse eid="LUK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Mpawo Jesu naakamubona, wakamwiita alimwi wakamwaambila wati, “Yomwanakazi wangununwa kubulwazi bwako.” <verse eid="LUK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />Mpawo wakamubika maanza, alimwi mpawawo wapona wawololoka, mpawo walumbayizya Leza.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Pesi mweendelezi wachikombelo chabaJuda, wakanyema, nkaambo Jesu wakaponiya mubuzuba bwasabata, wakati kubantu, “Taali musanu alimwi na mazuba ngeelede kubeleka mulingawo; kamuza mumazuba aayo kuzosilikwa, alimwi peepe mubuzuba bwasabata.”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />Mpawo Mwami wakamuvwiila wati, “Inywe nibasikuupawupa! Takwe na akati kanu unga mubuzuba bwasabata wangununa ŋombe yakwe niba mboŋolo yakwe mubbondo, wayitola kuti ikakunywe meenda? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />Alimwi takweelede na ooyu mwanakazi, mwana musimbi wa Abburahamu ooyo Satani ngwakaanga kwaminyaka ilikkumi amusanu ayitatu, aangununwe kubwaange oobu mubuzuba bwasabata?” <verse eid="LUK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Naakachili kwaamba eechi, boonse basinkondonyina bakawusa; alimwi bantu boonse bakakondwa kuli zyoonse zintu zilabulemu zyakachitwa anguwe.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wambuto Itegwa Masitadi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:31">Mateyu 13:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 4:30-32">Makko 4:30-32</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Nkikaako Jesu wakabuzya wati, “Bwami bwaLeza buli biyeni? Mpawo ndiyobukozyanisya anzi? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />Buli mbuli nseke niini kulizyoonse eeyo muntu njabweza akuyimiinza muchilili chakwe; mpawo yamena mpawo wabamusamu, alimwi bayuni bamujulu balachita zisaba muntabi zyawo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wabumena</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 13:33">Mateyu 13:33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />Alimwi Jesu wakabuzya wati, “Mbuli nzii mbundiyookozyanisya bwami bwaLeza? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Buli mbuli bumena oobo mwanakazi mbwaakabweza mpawo wakunika muchisuwo chabusu bunante bwachinkwa, mane kusika zyoonse zyababumena.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulyango Umanikide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 7:13">Mateyu 7:13</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:14">14</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 7:21-23">21-23</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Jesu wakeenda kayabwiinda mumadolopo amumyuunzi, kalokuyiisya, alimwi kali mulweendo lwakuya kuJerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />Mpawo umwi wakati kulinguwe, “Mwami, ani mbache buyo na bayoofutulwa?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">Mpawo wakati kulimbabo, <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Amukakatile kunjila mumulyango umanikide; nkaambo bayiingi, ndamwaambila, bayooyandisya kunjila, pesi tabakoyokonzya pe. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Awo muna aŋanda aakunyampuka, akujala mulyango, muyoyiimikila kuunze akukonkomona kumulyango akwaamba kuti, ‘Muuni aŋanda, tujulide.’ Uyoomuvwiila kuti, ‘Tandimwizi pe kuti muzwa kuli.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Mpawo muyootalika kwaamba kuti, ‘Twakalya akunywa kubusyu bwako, wakayiisya munzila zyesu!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />Mpawo uyooti, ‘Ndamwaambila, tandimwizi pe kuti muzwaayi; amuzwe kulindime, moonse inywe nibasimuchita zitaluleme!’ <verse eid="LUK 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Awo muyoolila akuluma ntwiino, mwaakubona Abburahamu aAyizekki aJakkobbu abasinsimi boonse mubwami bwaLeza, anywebo nobeni muyowalilwa aanze. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Alimwi bantu bayooza kabazwa kujwe akumbo, kumusansa akunyika, mpawo bayookkala aansi atebuli apobwe mubwami bwaLeza. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Alimwi laanga, aabo bamwi bakumagolelo lino bayooba bataanzi, alimwi bamwi bataanzi lino bayooba bamagolelo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ulila Atala aJerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:37-39">Mateyu 23:37-39</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Muchindi nchicheecho bamwi baFarisi bakaza, alimwi bati kulinguwe, “Zwa aano, nkaambo Herodi uyanda kukujeya.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />Alimwi wakabavwiila wati, “Kamuya mpawo mukabaambile ooyo simwaaba Herodi kuti, ‘Amulange, nditanda basikazwa mpawo akuponiya sunu ajunza amubuzuba bwatatu ndiyomanisya mulimu wangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Nikuba oobo ndeleede kweenda sunu ajunza alimwi amubuzuba butobela; nkaambo musinsimi takweelede afwide kunze amunzi waJerusalemu.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />“Jerusalemu, Jerusalemu, nuwakajeya basinsimi akubadonkola mabwe aabo bakatumwa kulinduwe! Ndiyobabunganiya tungana bana bako, mbuli nkuku mbibukata bana bayo, alimwi tazikoyooba pe! <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Laanga, ŋanda yako iyooba tyongo. Mpawo ndamwaambila kuti, tamukoyoondibona limbi mane mukati, ‘Ulaachoolwe ooyo uza muzina lyaMwami!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Mwaalumi Uchiswa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Mubuzuba bumwi bwasabata Jesu naakanjila muŋanda yamweendelezi wabaFarisi kuti akalye, bakali mulangide changuzu. <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />Alimwi laanga, kwaakali umwi mwaalumi kunembo lyakwe wakali kuzimba mawulu amaboko. <verse eid="LUK 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />Mpawo Jesu wakati kubayiisi bamulawu abaFarisi, “Zili mumulawu na kuponiya mubuzuba bwasabata, naakuti takweelede?”<verse eid="LUK 14:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Alimwi bakawumuna. Eelyo wakamujata, mpawo wamusiilika, alimwi wakamuleka weenda. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />Alimwi wakati kulimbabo, “Ngwani akati kanu, ulamwana nikuba ŋombe yawida muchikkala, alimwi takonzyi na mpawawo kumugwiisya mubuzuba bwasabata?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Alubo teebakakonzya kumuvwiila atala acheechi.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulifwiinsya Akusamawusya Beenzu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Mpawo wakaambuula mukozyanisyo kuli baabo bakatambidwe, naakalanga atala mbubakasala kukkala kuzyuuno zyamubusena bula ajulu, kati kulimbabo, <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Kuti wamutamba awumwi kupobwe lyabwiinga, mutakakkali muzyuuno zyabulemu, ateni kulasika umwi ulaabulemu bwindiilide kwiinda bwanu utambidwe anguwe; <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />mpawo ooyo wakamutamba moonse ulaza kulindinywe amwaambile, ‘Amupe busena kumwaalumi ooyu,’ eelyo muyootalika kuba abweeme kuyookkala azyuuno zilaansi. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Pesi kuti watambwa, kuya ukaakukkale kuzyuuno zilaansi, kuchitila kuti asika wakumutamba, ulati kulinduwe, ‘Mweenzuma, buka ukaakukkale kuzyuuno zyabulemu’; mpawo uyoobuka abulemu akati kabo mbukkede aabo atebuli. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" /><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14:11. </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:12">Mat 23:12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:14">Luk 18:14</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:4">Mat 18:4</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 5:6">1 Pit 5:6</ref>.</char></note> Nkaambo kufumbwa ulisumpula uyoofwiinsigwa, alakwe ulifwiinsya uyoosumpulwa.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Wakaamba alimwi kuli sikumutamba, “Naa watamba bantu kuchisusulo nilibapobwe, utatambi beenzunyokwe nibaba bakulana bako, nibaba banyoko nibaba bavubi mbimuyakilene aabo, nkaambo ayebo bazokutamba kuti bakuboozye nzuwakachita. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Pesi naawachita pobwe, kotamba bacheete, zilema, batyokede aboofu, <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />alimwi uyoolongezegwa, nkaambo tabakwe nchibanga balakulumbula pe. Mpawo uyoolumbulwa mubuzuba bwabubuke bwabaluleme.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wapobwe Pati</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:1-10">Mateyu 22:1-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Umwi wabaabo mbakali kulya aabo naakamvwa eechi, wakati kulinguwe, “Ulaachoolwe ooyo uyoolya chinkwa mupobwe mubwami bwaLeza!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />Pesi Jesu wakati kulinguwe, “Umwi mwaalumi wakachita pobwe pati, watamba bantu bayiingi. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />Muchiindi chachisusulo wakatuma mulanda wakwe kuti akaambile aabo bakatambidwe kuti, ‘Ngabasike; nkaambo zyoonse zintu zyabakabotu lino.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Pesi boonse bakatalika kulilalila. Mutaanzi wakati kulinguwe, ‘Ndakawula muunda, alimwi ndeleede kuyowulanga; ndakumbila, undilekelele.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />Alimwi umwi wakati, ‘ndawula zipani zilimusanu zyabasune baŋombe, lino ndiyanda kuyoozyeezya; ndakumbila, undilekelela.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />Mpawo ooyu uumbi wakati, ‘Ndakwata mwanakazi, alimwi tandikonzyi kuza.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />Mpawo mulanda wakaza waamba kuli simalelo wakwe. Eelyo simalelo wakwe wakaamba mubukali wati kumulanda wakwe, ‘Kuuya chakufwambana mutuzila amutuzila twachisi, mpawo ukatambe bachete azilema abatyokede aboofu.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Mpawo mulanda wakwe wakati, ‘Mwami, twachita mbuli mbuwatulayila, alimwi kuchili busena bucheede.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />Alimwi simalelo wakwe wakati kumulanda, ‘Kuuya munzila kulubaya, ukakombelezye bantu kuti bazonjile mupobwe, kuchitila kuti ŋanda yangu izulile.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Nkaambo ndamwaambila, takukwe pe naba umwi wabaabo bakalitambidwe bayo labila pobwe lyangu!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nzuwelede Kuchita Kuti Wayanda Kuba Sikwiiya</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 10:37">Mateyu 10:37</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 10:38">38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />Lino Jesu wakeenda ankamu mpati yabantu; mpawo wakabacheba wakati kulimbabo, <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Naakuti muntu waza kulindime alimwi taasula wisi abayina naba banakwe abana bakwe abakulana abachizi bakwe, iiyi, nikuba buumi bwakwe, takonzyi kuba sikwiiya wangu pe. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Kufumbwa ooyu utakonzyi kunyampula chiingano chakwe mpawo anditobele, takonzyi kuba sikwiiya wangu. <verse eid="LUK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Nkaambo ngwani akati kanu, uyanda kuyaka sanza, utasanguni kukkala aansi kuti abale muulo walyo, kuti ulijisi izulide na kuti alimane? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Ambweni, nabikka ntalisyo, mpawo walela, boonse baboona balatalika kumuwela, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />kabaamba kuti, ‘Ooyu mwaalumi watalika kuyaka, alimwi wakalela kulimanisya.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Alimwi nguMwami wamusyoboonzi, wiinka kunkondo kuyoolwana awumwi mwami, utakkali aansi lutaanzi, akulingulula naakuti ulakonzya na abasilumamba balizyuulu zilikkumi kuti alwaniye zyuulu zilimakumi abili? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Alimwi kwataba oobo, eelyo, umwi kachilikule, ulatuma mwiiminini akukuyokumbila nzila zyaluumuno. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Nkikaako, kufumbwa wanu utayandi kupeda zyoonse nzyalaazyo, teelede kuba sikwiiya wangu.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Munyo Utakwe Mulimu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mateyu 5:13</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:50">Makko 9:50</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Jesu winkilila anembo kati, “Munyo mubotu; pesi kuti munyo wasaluka, uyoobwedezegwa biyeni kuba kulweela. <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Tuchikwe mulimu pe nikuba munyika nikuba kuchitwa mbole; pesi bantu balusowa. Ooyo ujisi matwi akumvwa, ngamvwe.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wambelele Iswekede</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:12-14">Mateyu 18:12-14</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />Lino basimutelo abasizibi bakalikusweena afwiifwi aJesu kuti bazomuswiilile. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />Mpawo baFarisi abayiisyi bamulawu bakanyontooka, kabati, “Ooyu mwaalumi utambula basizibi alimwi ulya aabo!” <verse eid="LUK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />Alimwi wakabaambila chikozyanisyo eechi: wati,<verse eid="LUK 15:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ngwaani muntu akati kanu, ujisi mbeleele zilimwaanda, kuti wasweekelwa iimwi, tazisiyi na mbelele zilimakumi alimusanu aane amusanu azine abbuwa, mpawo ayinke kukuyanduula imwi iswekede, mane akayijane? <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Mpawo akuyijana, uyoyipikula amakwiko akwe, kalokukondwa. <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />Mpawo kuti aasika kumuunzi, alimwi uyootamba beenzunyina ambayakilene aabo, uyoobaambila kuti, ‘Atusekeleele aamwi andime, nkaambo ndajana mbelele yangu yakalisweekede.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Mbumbuboobo, ndamwaambila kuti, kuli lukondo lupati kujulu naakuti sizibi umwi wasanduka, kwiinda balimakkumi alimusanu ane amusanu abane bantu baluleme, batayandi kusanduka.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wakkobili Iswekede</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />Naakuti ngwaani mwanakazi, ulamakkobili alikkumi, kuti wasweekelwa kkobili ilimwi, takomunika achimwinikisyo ayiile muŋanda mpawo ayanduule changuzu mane alijane? <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />Alimwi alijana, ulatamba beenzunyina ambayakilene aabo, ambe kuti kulimbabo, ‘Atusekelele aamwi andime, nkaambo ikkobili lyangu lyalisweekede ndalijana.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Jesu wakati, “Mbumbuboobo, ndamwaambila, kuli lukondo lupati kubaangelo baLeza kukusanduka kwasizibi uumwi.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wamwana Mutaka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />Mpawo Jesu wakati, “Kwakali umwi mwaalumi wakali abana babili. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />Alimwi muniini wakati kuliwisi, ‘Taata, mundaabile chipanzi chalukono chilangene andime.’ Mpawo wisi wakabaabili umwi awumwi lubono ndwakalaalo. <verse eid="LUK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Mumazuba mache biyo, muniini wakabunganiya lubono lwakwe loonse ndwakaalalo, mpawo wakapanga lweendo waya kuli chimwi chisi chilikule, alimwi ooko wakutakanisya lubono lwakwe nkukooko mukupona buumi bwabutakana. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Alimwi naakamana kutakanisya zyoonse, kwakaba bbalangwe ipati munyika eeyo, mpawo wakatalika kutama. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />Mpawo wakayiinka alimwi wakukkala kuluumwi mukkali wamunyika eeyo, wakamutuma mumuunda wakwe kuti akasanine ngulube. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />Alimwi wakaba achiyandisyo chakuti alipede kuti alye kulya kwangulube; mpawo takukwe muntu wakamupa chakulya pe. <verse eid="LUK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Pesi mizeezo yakwe niyakakkalinkana wakati, ‘Mbangee babeleki bataata, balalya chinkwa, balakkuta, akuchisiya, pesi ime ndanyonyoka anzala okuno! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ndilabuka ndiye kuli taata, mpawo ndaakusika ndiyomwaambila kuti, ‘Taata, ndakabisizya ijulu anduwe; <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />nsicheelede kutegwa mwana wako pe; kuli mbubo kuti undibweze mbuli umwi wabalanda bako.’ ” <verse eid="LUK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />Alimwi wakanyampuka waya kuliwisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 15:20">Pesi naakachilikulekule, wisi wakamubona, mpawo wakamufwida luzyalo, wakachijana wakamukumbata mpawo wamumyonta. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Mpawo mwana wakamwaambila wati, ‘Taata, ndakabisizya julu akunembo lyako; tandicheelede kwiitwa kutegwa ndilimwana wako.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Pesi wisi wakati kubalanda bakwe, ‘Amweete mudabba mubotu chakufwambana, alimwi mumusamike, mpawo mumusamike nweenwe kuluboko lwakwe, ansangu kumawulu akwe; <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />alimwi mujate mwana ŋombe unenede mumujaye, mpawo tulye tusekele; <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />nkaambo ooyu mwana wangu wakalifwide, alimwi wabuka lubo, wakaliswekede, mpawo wajanika.’ Alimwi bakatalika kusekelela.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />Lino mwana akwe mupati wakali mumuunda; mpawo nakali kuyoobuza nakasweena afwiifwi akuŋanda, wakamvwa kabali kwiimba akuzyana. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Mpawo wakayiita umwi wabalanda mpawo wabuzya kuti, ‘chambaanzi eechi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />Mpawo wakati kulinguwe, ‘Mwanike wako wasika mpawo wuso wamujeela kanamani kanenede, nkaambo kakuti wamutambula kali muumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />Pesi wakanyema alimwi wakakaka kunjila. Wisi wakazwa anze wamukombelezya, <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />pesi wakavwiila wisi wati, ‘Laanga minyaka myiingi ndalikukukutawukila mbuli muzike, mpawo takukwe nindakaleka kukuswiilila malayilile aako; anukuti takwe nuwandipa pe nikaba kana kampongo, kuti tusekelele abeenzuma. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Pesi ooyu mwana wako naasika, ooyo wakatakanisya lubono abasibwamu, wamujeela kanamani kaneneede!’ <verse eid="LUK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />Mpawo wakati kulinguwe, ‘Mwanaangu, iwe ukkede andime lyoonse, alimwi zyoonse nzindilaazyo nzizyako. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Zyaliyeleede kuti tusekelele, alimwi ubotelwe, nkaambo ooyu mwanikaako walifwiide, lino muumi, wakalisweekede, lino twamujana.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wasikubamba Buvubi Utaluleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />Eelyo Jesu wakati kuli basikwiiya bakwe, “Kwakali mwaalumi muvubi wakali amubanzi, alimwi milandu yakeetwa kulinguwe kuti ooyu mwaalumi wakatakanisya zintu zyakwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />Aboobo wakamwiita mpawo wati kulinguwe, ‘Niinzi eechi nchindiliikumvwa atala anduwe? Kondipandulwida abubanzi bwako, nkaambo tuchiyoobi mubanzi pe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />Mpawo mubanzi wakati mumoyo wakwe, ‘Ndichite biyeni, mbukunga simalelo wangu uyanda kubweza bubanzi bwakwe kuzwa kulindime? Tandikwe nguzu pe zyakusya, alimwi ndili abweeme bwakukumbila. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Ndayeeya nzindiyanda kuchita, kuchitila kuti bantu bakanditambule mumaanda aabo eelyo nindiyoogwisigwa mulimu wangu wakubamba.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />Aboobo, wakayita umwi awumwi woonse wakali achikwelete kuli simalelo wakwe, wakati kumutanzi, ‘Ulaamalinzi njujisi yasimalelo wangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Wakamuvwiila wati, ‘Ndilaamwaanda wamweelo wamagaloni alimusanu ayitaatu wamafuta.’ Mpawo wakati kulinguwe, ‘Bweza lugwalo lwachikwelete chako mpawo ukkale aansi chakufwaambana mpawo ulembe magaloni alimwaanda iine.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Eelyo wakati kuli umbi, ‘Ujisi maliinzi yasimalelo wangu?’ Wakati, ‘Ndilaamwaanda ilikkumi wamweelo wazilyo.’ Wakati kuli nguwe, ‘Bweza lugwalo lwako lwachikwelete ulembe kuti mwaanda ilimusanu aatatu yamasaka yazilyo.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />Simalelo wakalumbayizya ooyo sikubamba buvubi utaluleme mukuchita chamaanu; nkaambo bana banyika eyiino bali amaanu mukuchita azyazyalani lyabo kwinda bana bamumuni.<verse eid="LUK 16:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Alimwi ndamwaambila, amulichitile beenzunyokwe amali italuleme, kuchitila kuti dozyakachila bakamutambule mubukkale butamani. <verse eid="LUK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Ooyo usyomeka muziniini ulasyomeka alubo muzyiingi; alimwi ooyo utasyomeki muziniini alubo tasyomeki pe muzyiingi <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Kuti eelyo kamutasyomeki mumali italuleme, ngwani uyoomusyoma mubuvubi bwinibwini? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Alimwi kuti kamutakwe mwakasyomeka muli eecho chawumwi, ngwani utakamupe izyanu?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Taakwe mulanda ukonzya kukutawukila basimalelo babili; nkaambo ulakonzya kusula umwi akuyanda umwi, nikuba uyoolipeda kuli umwi mpawo akasule umwi. Tukonzyi kubelekela Leza amali.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Zimwi Zyaakambwa Atala aKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 11:12">Mateyu 11:12</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 11:13">13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">5:31</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 5:32">32</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:11">Makko 10:11</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 10:12">12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />BaFarisi, bakali basimuyanda mali, bakamvwa zyoonse eezi, mpawo bakamuweela. <verse eid="LUK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />Eelyo wakati kuli mbabo, “Muli aabo balisalazya kunembo lyabantu, pesi Leza ulizi myoyo yanu; nkaambo chisumpulwa akati kabantu nchisesemyo kubusyu bwaLeza.<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />“Mulawu waMozesi amalembe abasinsimi akaliwo mane chiindi chaJoni; aboobo kuzwa eecho nchiindi makani mabotu abwami bwaLeza alii kukambawukwa, alimwi woonse unjila kulimbubo achabukali. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Pesi nchuuba kuti julu anyika zimane, kwiinda kafwapu kamwi kamulawu kuti kalubigwe.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Kufumbwa mwaalumi uleka mwanakazi wakwe mpawo wakwata uumbi wachita bwaamu, alimwi alakwe mwaalumi ukwata mwanakazi wakalekwa amulumi wakwe wachita bwaamu.<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaalumi Muvubi aLazarasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />Eelyo Jesu wakati, “Kwakali umwi mwaalumi muvubi, wakali kusama mudabba wakamweenvwe alimwi muteteete uŋayima alimwi wakali kulya kabotu mazuba woonse. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Alimwi kumulyango walubuwa lwamuvubi kwakali kubikwa umwi mwaalumi muchete utegwa Lazarasi, kazwide zilonda, <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />wakali kulombozya kulya zyakali kuwa kuzwa kutebuli lyamuvubi; alimwi bankala bakali kuza kabali kumunyankuta zilonda zyakwe. <verse eid="LUK 16:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Mwaalumi muchete wakafwa mpawo wakabwezegwa abaangelo kuchaamba chaAbburahamu. Mwaalumi muvubi alakwe wakafwa mpawo wakavwikwa; <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />mpawo muuya wakwe wakaya muchikkalilo chabafu, kalokupenzegwa, wakabusya busyu bwakwe, alimwi wakabona Abburahamu kulaale aLazarasi nkali kuchaamba chaAbburahamu. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Alimwi muvubi wakayita wati, ‘Taata Abburahamu, kondifwida luse, mpawo utume Lazarasi kuti adompe kanwe kakwe mumeenda mpawo azotontozye lulimi lwangu; nkaambo ndatama mumulilo ooyu.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Pesi Abburahamu wakamuvwiila wati, ‘Mulombe, yeeya kuti iwe muchiindi chabuumi bwako wakajana zintu zibotu, alimwi Lazarasi wakali kujana zintu zibi; pesi lino ulimukuumbulizigwa okuno, mpawo iwe uliikutama. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Alimwi kakutali boobo, akati kesu anduwe kubikkidwe mugaano mupati, kuchitila kuti aabo bayanda kuza oko kulinduwe batakonzyi pe, alimwi taakwe uyootimbula kuzwa ooko kaza kulindiswe.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />Alimwi wakati, ‘Eelyo ndakumbila, taata, kuti umutume kuŋanda yataata, <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />nkaambo ndilaabakulana balimusanu, kuchitila kuti akabachenjezye, nkaambo ngabalasika kubusena oobu bwakutama.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />Pesi Abburahamu wakati, ‘Nkwali malembe aMozesi abasinsimi; ngakabakabaswilile.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />Mpawo wakati, “Peepe, taata Abburahamu; pesi kuti umwi wayinka kulimbabo uzwa kubafu, bayoosanduka.’ <verse eid="LUK 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />Wakati kulinguwe, ‘Kuti kabatakonzyi kuswiilila malembe aMozesi abasinsimi, taakwe nibayoozumina pe nikuba kukabuke uzwa kubafu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s">Chibi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 18:6">Mateyu 18:6</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:7">7</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:21">21</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 18:22">22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 9:42">Makko 9:42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />Alimwi Jesu wakati kuli basikwiiya bakwe, “Masukusyo akuti mubisye alaza; pesi maawe kuli yooyo uzaawo! <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Alimwi kwalimbubo kuti uliboobo aangwe iziyo munsingo, mpawo awaalilwe mulwizi, kwiinda kuti alebe uumwi wabaaba baluleme kuti babisye.” <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Amulilingule nibeni!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:3">“Naakuti munyoko wakubisizya, mululamike; alimwi naakuti wasanduka, kumulekelela. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Alimwi kuti wakubisizya tulimusanu atubili mubuzuba bumwi, mpawo waboola kulinduwe tuli musanu atubili, akwaamba kuti, ‘Ndasanduka,’ weelede kumulekelela.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lusyomo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />Mpawo batumwa bakati kuMwami, “Komezya lusyomo lwesu!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />Alimwi Mwami wakati, “Kuti kamuli alusyomo luniini mbuli mbuto ilimbuuli nseke niini kulizyoonse, mwalikunooti kumusamu wamabbulosi, ‘Nyukuka, mpawo ukaakuzikwe mulwizi,’ alimwi uyomuswiilila.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mulimu Wamulanda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />“Ngwani akati kanu, ujisi mulanda ulima naakuti sikweembela mbelele, naasika kuzwa mumuunda, wati kumulanda, ‘Kuza lyokezye ulye?’ <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Takoyooti na, ‘kondijikila chilalilo changu, mpawo uzwate zisamo zyakundikutawukila undipe ndilye akunywa, nuwamana ayebo mputakalye akunywa? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Ulamulumba na mulanda ooyu nkaambo wachita mbuli mbwakalayililwa? <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Alimwi mbumbubo anywebo, naakuti mwachita zyoonse zintu zimwakalayiililwa, mwambe kuti, ‘Tuli balanda biyo; twachita biyo eezyo nzitweelede.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Baalumi BaliKkumi Balachipele</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Jesu naakali kuyabweenda kayabuya kuJerusalemu, wakayinda akati kamyuunzi yaSamariya aGalili. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Mpawo naakali kunjila muli umwi muunzi, wakaswanana abasizipele balikkumi, bakaliimvwi kulekule. <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />Alimwi bakoompolola bati, “Jesu! Mwami, kutufwida luse.”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Naakababona, wakati kulimbabo, “Ngamwiinke mukalitondezye kubapayizi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">Mpawo nibakachili kuyobweenda, bakasalazigwa. <verse eid="LUK 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />Eelyo umwi wabo, naakabona kuti wapona, wakabweeda, kalokulumbayizya leza ajwi pati. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Mpawo wakavuntama kumawulu aJesu mpawo wamulumba. Alimwi ooyo wakali muSamariya. <verse eid="LUK 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Eelyo Jesu wakababuzya wati, “Teebalikkumi na bakasalazigwa? Pesi balimusanu abane balikuli? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Tee bakajanika kuti baboole kukulumba Leza kunze kwamuzwakule?” <verse eid="LUK 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />Eelyo wakamwaambila wati, “Buka kuuya; lusyomo lwako lwakuponiya.”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusika Kwa Bwami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:23-28">Mateyu 24:23-28</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:37-41">37-41</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Mulichimwi chiindi Jesu wakabuzigwa abaFarisi kuti, “Ani bwami bwaLeza buza lili?” Wakabavwiila wati, “Bwami bwaLeza tabuzi munzila njimulangilila pe; <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />nikuba kuti bantu bayooti, ‘Laanga mbobuno okuno!’ naakuti ‘Mbobuya!’ Nkaambo, amulange, bwami bwaLeza buli akati kanu.”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Mpawo wakati kuli basikwiiya bakwe, “Mazuba ayoosika aayo mpumutazoyande kubona limwi lyamabuzuba aMwana aMuntu alimwi tamukwe kuyoobubona pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />Bantu bayoowamba kuti kulindinywe, ‘Amulange, nguulya!’ naakuti ‘Nguuno okuno! Mutakayinki, nikuba kubatobela. <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Mbumbubo oobu mbubutakabe mubuzuba mbwakuza kwaMwana aMuntu mbuli kalabi mbukamweka kulubazu lumwi ilwajulu kuyoosika kulilumbi lubazu. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Pesi lutaanzi weelede apenzengwe munzila zyiingi, mpawo akuyootamwa azyalani eli. <verse eid="LUK 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Mbuli mbukwakalibede mumazuba aNowa, mbukuyooba alimwi mumazuba aMwana aMuntu. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />Bantu bakali kulya akunywa akukwatana bakali kupa bana babo mumakwatano, mane kusikila mubuzuba oobo Nowa mbwaakanjila mubwaato, alimwi zambangulwe nilyakasika lyakabanyonyona boonse. <verse eid="LUK 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Mbumbubo, mbuli mumazuba aLoti: bakali kulya akunywa, bakalikuula akuuzya, bakali kubyala akuyaka, <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />pesi mubuzuba oobo Loti mbwaakazwa mumuunzi waSodomu, kwakawa mulilo wabunde asarufa wakazwa kujulu mpawo wabanyonyona boonse. <verse eid="LUK 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Mbukuyooba mubuzuba aawo Mwana aMuntu aakuyubununwa.<verse eid="LUK 17:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Mubuzuba oobo, kufumbwa ooyo unoli ansonge yaŋanda ujisi zilongo zyakwe kazinoli muŋanda atakaseluki kuti akakuzibweze; mbumbubo kufumbwa ooyo unoli mumuunda alakwe atakayeeyi kubweeda kuŋanda kukuyoobweza chintu. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Amuyeeye zyakachitika kumwanakazi waLoti! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Kufumbwa ooyo muntu weezya kuvuna buumi bwakwe uyoobusweekelwa, pesi aabo basweekelwa buumi bwabo bayoobujana. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Ndamwaambila kuti, mansiku aayo kuyooba bantu babili balede abulo bumwi; umwi uyootolwa umwi uyoochala. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Kunoli banakazi babili banooziya aamwi; umwi uyootolwa mpawo umwi uyoochala. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />Bantu babili banooli mumuunda, umwi uyootolwa mpawo umwi uyoochala.<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />Eelyo bakamubuzya bati, “Okuli, Mwami?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">Alimwi Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Oko kuli mutumba, nkunkuko kuli makubi.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wamukamufu Amubeteki Utaluleme</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Eelyo Jesu wakabaambila basikwiiya bakwe mukozyanisyo kuti nkaamboonzi nitweelede kukomba akutabola moyo. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />Wakati, “Kuli limwi dolopo kwakali umwi mubetesi, watakali kuyoowa Leza, naakuti kulemeka bantu. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />Mudolopo eelyo kwaakali mukamuufu wakali kunoonga waza kulinguwe, alimwi kaamba kuti, ‘Kondibetekela mulandu wangu.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Nkaambo kwachiindi wakakaka kubeteka; pesi kuzwa awo wakalyaambila mwini wati, ‘Nikuba kuti mebo kanditamuyoowi Leza nibaba kulemeka bantu; <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />nikubaboobo nkaambo kayooyu mukamufu wandikatazya, ndiyoomubetekela mulandu wakwe, nkaambo ulandimana nguzu anoza lubbe.<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Alimwi Mwami wakati, “Amuswiilile mubetesi utaluleme mbwaamba. <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Mpawo Leza takooyobabetekela chabuuya na aabo basale bakwe nibalila mansiku asikati kulinguwe? Ulabatolela chiindi chilamfu na? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Ndamwaambila eechi, uyoobabetekela chakufwambaana. Nikubabobo, aawo Mwana aMuntu nayookusika anyika, uyoojana bantu bajisi lusyomo na anyika?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano WamuFarisi aSimutelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Wakaamba ooyu mukozyanisyo kuli aabo bakali kulisumpula kabati baliluleme akulangila bamwi boonse aansi: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />wakati “Baalumi babili bakaya kuŋanda yaLeza kukukomba, uumwi wakali muFarisi alimwi uumwi kali simutelo. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />Mufarisi wakayimikila wakomba walyambila wati, ‘Leza, ndakulumba kuti ime tandili mbuli bamwi bantu, balisumpula, batasyomeki, basibwaamu, nikuba mbuli ooyu simutelo. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Ndilalyiimya tubili amviiki; ndilapa zyakkumi zyazyoonse nzindijana.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />Pesi simutelo, nkayimvwi kulekule, taakakonzya kunyampula meso akwe kujulu, pesi wakalyuuma akaango kakwe kalikulifwinsya, wati, “Leza wangu kondifwida luse ime ndisizibi!’ <verse eid="LUK 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Ndamwaambila kuti, ooyu mwaalumi simutelo wakabweeda kuŋanda yakwe kaliwalulamikwa kwiinda ooyu muFarisi; nkaambo kufumbwa woonse ulisumpula ulafwiinsigwa, alimwi ooyo ulifwiinsya ulasumpulwa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ulongezya Bana Baniini</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mateyu 19:13-15</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:13-16">Makko 10:13-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />Lino bantu bakali kweeta bana baniini kuli Jesu kuti ababike maanza, alimwi basikwiiya nibakabona eechi, bakabakalalila. <verse eid="LUK 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Pesi Jesu wakabayiita bana kulinguwe, wati, “Amubaleke bana baniini baze kulindime, alimwi mutabakasyi; nkaambo bwami bwaLeza mbubwababo baliboobu. <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Ndamwaambila kasimpe, kufumbwa utatambuli bwami bwaLeza mbuli mwana muniini takukwe nayoobunjila pe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwaalumi Muvubi Abwami Bwa Leza</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mateyu 19:16-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:17-31">Makko 10:17-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Alimwi umwi mweendelezi wakabuzya Jesu wati, “Muyiisi mubotu, ndichite biyeni kuti ndikajane buumi butamani?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />Alimwi Jesu wakamwaambila wati, “Nkaamboonzi nundaamba kuti ndilimubotu? Takukwe mubotu pe pesi Leza alikke. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />Muliizi milawu iiti: ‘Utachiti bwaamu Utajeyi Utabbi Utapi bukaamboni bwakubeja alimwi Lemeka wuso abanyoko.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Mpawo wakamwaambila wati, “Zyoose eezi ndakazibamba kuzwa kandichili muniini.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Alimwi Jesu naakazimvwa, wakati kulinguwe, “Chintu chimwi nchuchede biyo. Uzya zyoonse nzujisi mpawo ukaabile mali kubantu bachete, alimwi uyooba abuvubi kujulu; eelyo uze, unditobele.” <verse eid="LUK 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Pesi naakamvwa ezi, wakawusa, nkaambo wakali abuvubi bwiingi.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />Jesu naakamulanga wakati, “Nkuyumu biyeni kulaabo bantu balaabuvubi kunjila kubwami bwaLeza! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Nkaambo nchuuba kuti inkamela injile mupuli lyanaliti, kwiinda muntu muvubi kuti akanjile mubwami bwaLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />Alimwi aabo bakamumvwa bakamubuzya bati, “Animpo ngwani ukonzya kufutulwa?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />Pesi Jesu wakavwiila wati, “Leza ulakonzya kuchita eezyo zintu eezyo zikachila muntu.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Mbwaataba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />Eelyo Pita wakati kuli Jesu, “Laanga, twakasiya myuunzi yesu alimwi twakutobela.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />Alimwi wakabaambila wati, “Kasimpe ndamwaambila kuti, takukwe muntu wakasiya ŋanda yakwe nikuba mwanakazi nikuba bakulana nikuba bazyali nikuba bana, nkaambo kabwami bwaLeza, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />utakaleke kujana mpindu iyindulidwe muchiindi eechino, alimwi amuchiindi chiyoobuza kubuumi butamani.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waamba Lubo Atala Alufu Lwakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mateyu 20:17-19</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:32-34">Makko 10:32-34</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />Alimwi Jesu wakeenda abalikkumi ababili kumbali mpawo wakati kulimbabo, “Amulange, tuyobwiinka kuJerusalemu, alimwi zyoonse zyakalembwa atala aMwana aMuntu abasinsimi ziyoozuzikizigwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Nkaambo uyoowabwa kuli batali baJuda pe, alimwi uyoowelwa, alimwi uyoosampulwa, mpawo uyooswidwa. <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />Nibakumana kumuyasa bayomujeya, eelyo mubuzuba bwachitatu kuzwa nakafwa mpawo uyoobuka lubo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />Pesi basikwiiya bakwe tee bakamvwisisisya pe atala azyoonse zintu eezi, akuti eezi nzyakali kwaambuula zyakali basitide, alimwi teebakaziziba zintu zyakali kwaambwa.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uponiya Sikukumbila Moofu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mateyu 20:29-34</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 10:46-52">Makko 10:46-52</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Naakasika afwiifwi akuJerikko, umwi mwaalumi moofu wakalikkede kumbali anzila kalikukumbila; <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />alimwi naakamvwa kuyoowela kwamakamu abantu akali kwiinda, wakabuzya kuti, “Sa niinzi zilokuchitika?”<verse eid="LUK 18:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />Bakamwaambila bati, “Jesu wakuNazareti ulookwiinda.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Alimwi wakompolola wati, “Jesu, Mwana waDevidi, kundifwida luse!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />Lino aabo bakali kweenda anembo, bakamukalalila, kuti, ngawumune, pesi wakoompololisya, kalookwamba kuti, “Jesu Mwana waDevidi, kundifwida luse!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />Mpawo Jesu wakayimikila wakabalayilila bantu aaba kuti bamweete kulinguwe; alimwi nibakamweeta afwiifwi anguwe, wakamubuzya wati, <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“Uyanda kuti ndikuchitilenzi?” Mpawo wakavwiila wati,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">“Mwami ndiyanda kuti ndibone.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />Jesu wakati kulinguwe, “Bona, lusyomo lwako lwakuponiya.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />Mpawawo wakabona mpawo wakatobela Jesu, kalumbayizya Leza, alimwi bantu boonse, nibakabona eezi abalabo bakalumbayizya Leza.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s">Jesu aSimutelo Zakkiyasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />Eelyo Jesu wakayinda mumuunzi waJerikko. <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />Kwakali mwaalumi izina lyakwe wakali kutegwa Zekkiyasi, wakali sikutelesya mupati, alimwi kalimuvubi. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Mpawo wakayanda kubona Jesu mbabede, wakakachilwa nkaambo kankamu, alimwi wakali mufwiifwi muchiimo. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Ambubo wakachijaana kunembo wakutanta musamu wamukuyu wakali mumbali anzila kuti amubone, nkaambo Jesu walikunoyinda kunzila eeyo. <verse eid="LUK 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />Alimwi awo Jesu naakasika abusena mpakabede, wakalanga mujulu mumusamu wamubona wamwaambila wati, “Zekkiyasi, kufwambaana kuseluka; nkaambo sunu ndiyokkala muŋanda yako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />Ambubo wakafwambaana kuseluka, mpawo wakamutambula mulukondo. <verse eid="LUK 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Alimwi bantu boonse nibakabona eechi bakanyontooka bati, “Uyanda kuyooba mweenzu wasizibi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Pesi Zekkiyasi wakanyampuka alimwi waambila Mwami wati, “Laanga, Mwami, chipanzi chabuvubi bwangu ndilapa kubachete; alimwi naakuti ndakabwezela umwi nichiba chimwi, ndiyobabwedezya zyinduulwidwe tune.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />Alimwi Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Sunu lufutuko lwasika muŋanda eeyi, nkaambo alakwe mwaalumi ooyu mwana waAbburahamu. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />‘Nkaambo Mwana aMuntu wakaza kukuyandula akufutula aabo basweekede.”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mukozyano Wakkobili aNgolide</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 25:14-30">Mateyu 25:14-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Nibakachili kumvwa eezi zintu, wakayungizya akwaambuula chikozyanisyo, nkaambo wakali afwiifwi akuJerusalemu, mpawo bakali kuyeeya kuti bwami bwaLeza buleelede kuyubunwa mpawowawo. <verse eid="LUK 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />Wakati, “Mwaalumi wachuuno chaajulujulu wakaya kunyika ilikule kuti akatambule chuuno chabwami, eelyo abole. <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />Aboobo wakayiita balanda bakwe balikkumi, mpawo wakabapa kkumi lyampondo, mpawo wabaambila wati, “Mubbindawuke amali eeyi mane ndikaboole.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />Pesi bamuchisi eecho teebakali kumuyanda pe, mpawo bakatuma biminini kulinguwe kabalokwaamba kuti, ‘Tatuyandi mwaalumi ooyu kuti atweendelezye.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Nakabutambuula bwami wakabola kumuunzi, eelyo wakalayilia balanda aabo, mbakalipede mali kuti bayitwe kulinguwe, kuchitila kuti azibe kuti bakajanaanzi mukubbindawuka kwabo. <verse eid="LUK 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />Mutaanzi wakaza, wati, “Mwami, mpondo yako yakandipa kkumi lyampondo ajulu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Mpawo wakamwaambila wati, “Wachita chibotu, yomulanda ululeme! Nkaambo wakasyomeka muzintu ziniini, uyooba mweendelezi wazisi zilikkumi.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />Alimwi wabili wakaza, wati, “Mwami, impondo njwakandipa yakandipa kujana mpindu yampondo zilimusanu ajulu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Alimwi wakaamba mbuli kumutanzi wati, “Uyooba mweendelezi wazisi zilimusanu.” <verse eid="LUK 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />Mpawo umwi wakaza lubo wati, “Mwami, laanga, njeyi mpondo yako, eeyo njindakabamba mumpiza; <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Nkaambo ndakakuyoowa, nkaambo kakuti ulimwaalumi mukali; ubweza nchutakwe wakabika alimwi utebula mpuwatakabyala pe.” <verse eid="LUK 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Wakati kulinguwe, “Ndiyookupa mulandu amajwi azwa kumulomo wako, yomulanda utaluleme! Wakalizi kuti ndili mwaalumi mukkali, utabwezi mputakwe mpundakabikka, alimwi utebula nzyatakalima? <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />Nkaamboonzi nuwatakabika mali yangu muŋanda yachiyobwedo, kukuboola kwangu nkandiyoojana mpindu kandijana yazyala?’ <verse eid="LUK 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Wakaambila aabo bakalimvwi aawo, kuti, ‘Amumunyanziye mali, mpawo mupe ooyo uli akkumi lyampondo.’ <verse eid="LUK 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />Alimwi bakavwiila bati, ‘Mwami, ujisi ikkumi lyampondo kale!’ <verse eid="LUK 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />Wakavwiila wati, “Ooyo ujisi, uyooyungizigwa; pesi kulooyo utajisi, nikuba eezyo nzyajisi uyoonyanzigwa. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />‘Pesi kulibasinkondoma, aabo batakayandide pe kuti ndibeendelezye, mubeete okuno, mpawo mubajaye kunembo lyangu.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Wasika Afwiifwi aJerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mateyu 21:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:1-11">Makko 11:1-11</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Joni 12:12-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Mpawo naakamana kwaamba eechi, wakatunga kunembo, wakatansya kabaya kuJerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Naakasika afwiifwi aBbetifeji akuBbetani, kuchilundu chitegwa Olivu, wakatuma basikwiiya bakwe babili, <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />Wakabaambila wati, “Kamuya kumuunzi oolya ngumulangide, mwakunjila muyoojana mwana mboŋolo ulaangidwe, utana belesegwa pe, mukamwangunune, mumweete okuno. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />Alimwi naa muntu wabuzya kuti, ‘Mumwangununwidayi?’ Muyomwaambila kuti, ‘Mwami wamuyanda.”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Mpawo aabo bakatumwa bakayinka, alimwi bakamujana mbuli mbwaakabalayilila. <verse eid="LUK 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />Lino nibakali kwangununa mwana amboŋolo; bamunaayo bakabuzya bati, “Nkaamboonzi nimwangununa mwana amboŋolo?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />Bakamwaambila bati, “Mwami wayiyanda.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Mpawo bakamweeta kuli Jesu, alimwi bakayala midabba atala amwana amboŋolo, mpawo bamutansika Jesu ajulu. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Alimwi naakali kuyabweenda, bakali kuyabuyala midabba yabo munzila. <verse eid="LUK 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />Mpawo naakasika afwiifwi amukunu waChilundu chama Olivu, inkamu yoonse yabasikwiiya bakatalika kubotelwa akulumbayizya Leza kabalo koompolola kabaamba milimu mipati njibakabona kalokuchita, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />Kabalokuti, “Ulaachoolwe ooyo Mwami uza muzina lyaMwami! Aluumuno lube kujulu, alimwi bulemu kuli Sijulu lyaMajulu!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Mpawo bamwi babaFarisi bakali akati kankamu eeyi bakamwaambila bati, “Muyiisi, kalalila basikwiiya bako.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />Wakavwiila wati, “Ndamwaambila, kuti aba bawumuna, mabwe alatalika koompolala.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Alimwi naakaswena afwiifwi achisi chaJerusalemu nakachibona wakawusa wakachililila, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />Wakati, “Nuwaziba nikuba mubuzuba obuno zintu zilaluumuno! Pesi lino zilisisidwe kumeso ako <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Nkaambo mazuba ayoosika alindunywe awo basinkondonyokwe bayobikka muganu atala andinywe akumuzyungulukila, mpawo bakamusyanikizye kumabazu woonse, <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Alimwi ndiyookulazika aansi anyika, mpawo bana bako aamwi anduwe, takukoyoochala bbwe nikuba limwi atala alimwi; nkaambo takukwe niwakaziba chindi chakuswayigwa.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uya Kuŋanda yaMwami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mateyu 21:12-17</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:15-19">Makko 11:15-19</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Joni 2:13-22</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Lino wakanjila mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza, mpawo wakatalika kutanda aabo bakali kusambala, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />Kalokubaambila kuti, “Kuli lembeedwe kuti, ‘iŋanda yangu iyooba ŋanda yakukomba’; pesi nywebo mwichita gobelo lyababbi.”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />Mazuba woonse wakali kuyiisya mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza. Bapayizi bapati abayiisyi bamulawu abeendelezi babantu bakayanduula kuti bamujaye; <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />pesi bakabula kuti balamuchita biyeni, nkaambo bantu boonse bakali kuyanda kumuswiilizya.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s">Inguzu Zya Jesu Zizwa Kuli</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mateyu 21:23-27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 11:27-33">Makko 11:27-33</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Mulibumwi buzuba, Jesu naakali kuyiisya bantu mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza akukambawuka makani mabotu, bapayizi bapati abayiisyi bamulawu abaalu bakamuzida <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />mpawo bakati kulinguwe, “Twaambile mbweendelezi buli mbuchita aabo zintu eezi, nikuba kuti ngwani wakakupa bweendelezi oobu.”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />Wakabavwiila wati, “Andime lubo ndiyoobuzya mubuzyo; lino mundaambile, <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />lubbapatizyo lwaJoni lwakazwa kujulu na naakuti kubantu?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />Mpawo bakaambuula kuli umwi awumwi, kabati, “Kuti twaamba kuti, ‘Kuzwa kujulu,’ ulaamba kuti, ‘Nkaamboonzi nimutakwe mwakamusyoma?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />“Pesi kuti twaamba kuti, ‘Kuzwa kubantu,’ bantu boonse balatudonkola mabwe; nkaambo balasyoma kuti Joni wakali musinsimi.” <verse eid="LUK 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />Aboobo bakavwiila kuti tabazizi pe.<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />Mpawo Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Andime tandikomwaambile kuti abweendelezi buli mbundichita aabo zintu eezi.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chikozyanisyo Chabasikuyalila Bamuunda Wamasansa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mateyu 21:33-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:1-12">Makko 12:1-12</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Alimwi wakatalika kwaambila bantu chikozyanisyo eechi wati: “Mwaalumi wakabyala muunda wamasansa, mpawo wakawusiya mumaanza abasikuyalila, mpawo wakaya kunyika iimbi kwachiindi chilamfu. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />Chiindi nichakasika, wakatuma umwi mulanda wakwe kuli basikuyalila muunda, kuti beelede bakamuchelele michelo yamasansa; pesi basikuyalila bakamuuma, alimwi bamwanda katakwe nchalaacho pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Alimwi wakatuma uumbi mulanda; alakwe bakamuuma lubo mpawo bakamusyonsya kapati chakumufwisya bweeme, akumwaanda katakwe nchalaacho pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Mpawo wakatuma wataatu; ooyu bakamuchisa mpawo bakamuwaalila anze amuunda. <verse eid="LUK 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Eelyo muni wamuunda wamasansa wakati, ‘Ndichite biyeni? Ndiyootuma mwanaangu ngundiyandisya; ambweni bayomulemeka.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Pesi basikuyalila nibakamubona, bakambuula chabochabo bati, “Ooyu ngusikukona; atumujeye, kuchitila kuti lukono lube lwesu.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />Mpawo bakamutandila kunze amuunda wamasansa mpawo bamujeya.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">Niinzi muni wamuunda nzyayoobachita? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Uyooza mpawo akabanyonyoone aabo basikuyalila mpawo uyoobweza muunda wamasansa akawupe bamwi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Nibakamvwa eechi, bakati, “Leza ulazikaka!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">20:17. </char>
      <char style="xt" closed="false">
        <ref loc="PSA 118:22-23">Int 118:22-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 4:11">Inch 4:11</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 2:6-7">1 Pit 2:6-7</ref>.</char>
    </note>Pesi Jesu wakabazilikila wati, “Niinzi eelyo eecho chilembedwe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘Chiyako eecho bayaki nchibakakaka</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">nchichakaba musemo waŋanda.’<verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Kufumbwa ooyo utakawide achiyako eecho uyootyoka muzidyunku; pesi kuti lyawida ali umwi liyoomupwaya.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani Akutelela Mutelo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mateyu 22:15-22</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:13-17">Makko 12:13-17</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />Bayiisyi bamulawu abapayizi bapati bakeezya kumujata muchiindi nchicheecho, pesi bakayoowa bantu; nkaambo bakayeeya kuti walikwamba chikozyanisyo eechi atala ambabo. <verse eid="LUK 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />Aboobo bakamubelelela, mpawo bakatuma basikutweela, bakalikubaanga mbasikumuswiilizya baluleme, kuti batole majwi aakwe woonse atala anzyakali kwaamba, kuchitila kuti bamutole kubeendelezi akuli beendelezya mulawu. <verse eid="LUK 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />Bakabuzya kuti, “Muyiisi, tulizi kuti ulaambuula akuyiisya mukasimpe, alimwi tutondeezyi kusalula, pesi kasimpe uyiisya nzila yaLeza. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Zilimumulawu na kuti tupe mutelo kumweendelezyi waRoma, naakuti peepe?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />Pesi wakabona bumpenengu bwabo, alimwi wakati kulimbabo, <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Ngamunditondeezye kkobili, ani mukozyano abulembo oobu mbubwani?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">Bakati, “Mbubwa Siza.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Wakati kulimbabo, “Eelyo ngamupe Siza zintu zyaSiza, alimwi mupe Leza ezyo zyaLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Alimwi taakwe nibakakonzya pe kumujata kunembo lyabantu azeezyo nzyakaamba; pesi bakagamba kunsandulo yakwe mpawo bakawumuna.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani Abubuke Kwabafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mateyu 22:23-33</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:18-27">Makko 12:18-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />Mpawo kwakasika bwami babaSejusi, aabo baamba kuti taakwe bubuke, <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />Mpawo bakamubuzya mubuzyo, kabati, “Muyiisi, Mozesi wakatulembela kuti naa mukulana wafwa, kalaamwanakazi pesi katakwe bana, mwanikaakwe weelede akwate mwanakazi mpawo azyalile mukulana wakwe bana. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Lino kwakali bakulana bakwe bali musanu ababili; mutaanzi nguwakakwata mwanakazi, mpawo wakafwa katakwe bana pe; <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />eelyo wabili <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />awatatu wakakwata, mbuli boonse balimusanu ababili takukwe nibakasiya bana pe mpawo wakafwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Kumamanino alakwe mwanakazi wakazofwa. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Kububuke bwabafu, nkikaako, uyooba mwanakazi wani? Nkaambo bali musanu ababili wali mwanakazi wabo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />Alimwi Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Bana bachiindi eechino balakwata akukwatwa; <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />pesi aabo bayoobalwa kuti balacheelelo kuti bakanjile muchiindi eechino akububuke kuzwa kubafu nikuba kukwata nikuba kukwatwa, <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />nkaambo tabakwe nibayoofwa limbi pe, nkaambo baleelene abaangelo tabakwati alimwi mbana baLeza, kabali bana babubuke. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />Pesi bafwide balabusigwa, nikuba Mozesi wakatondezya, mumalembe atala achiteyo, aawo mpakayiita kuti Mwami nguLeza waAbburahamu aLeza waAyizekki aLeza waJakkobbu. <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Lino tee Leza wabafu pe, pesi wabawumi; nkaambo boonse mbawuumi mulinguwe.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Alimwi bamwi babalembi bakamuvwiila bati, “Muyiisi, waambuula kabotu.” <verse eid="LUK 20:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Nkaambo teebakachili kuyanda kumubuzya uumbi mubuzyo pe.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makani Atala AKkirisitu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mateyu 22:41-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:35-37">Makko 12:35-37</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Pesi Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Ngabalaamba biyeni kuti Kkirisitu Mwana waDevidi? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Nkaambo Devidi mwini waamba kuti muBbuku lyaNtembawuzyo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘Mwami wakati kuMwami wangu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Kkala kuluboko lwangu lwakululyo,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />Mane ndikabikke basinkondonyokwe kundyato zyamawulu aako.’<verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Devidi umwiita kuti nguMwami; aboobo mwana wakwe biyeni?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uchenjezya Atala Abayiisi Bamulawu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mateyu 23:1-36</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 12:38-40">Makko 12:38-40</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Alimwi Jesu bantu kabamvwide wakati kuli basikwiiya bakwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />Amuchenjelele bayiisyi bamulawu, bayanda kuzwaata midabba milamfu, alimwi bayanda kujuzigwa mumasena akusambalila bayandisya zyuuno zili ajulu muzikombelo zyabaJuda amubusena bwabulemu kumapobwe, <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />baleena mumaanda abamukabafu amukulipunayizya kabachita nkombyo zilamfu. Bayoopegwa chisubulo chipati.<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s">Chipo Chamukamufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 12:41-44">Makko 12:41-44</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Jesu naakalanga mpawo wakabona bavubide kababikka zipo zyabo muchiyobwedo; <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />Mpawo wakabona mukamufu muchete kaliikubikka tukkobili tubili. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Mpawo wakati, “Kasimpe ndamwaambila, ooyu mukamufu muchete wapa kwiinda boonse; <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Nkaambo boonse bakapa zipo zyabo mbuli mubwiingi bwabuvubi bwabo, pesi we mubuchete bwakwe wapa zyoonse nzyaalazyo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Waambuula Atala Akunyonyoonwa Kwaŋanda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:1">Mateyu 24:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 24:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:1">Makko 13:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 13:2">2</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />Mpawo bamwi basikwiiya bakali kwaambuula atala aŋanda yaLeza, ambuyakali kweebeka amabwe mabotu azipo, wakati, <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Kulizezi zintu nzimubwene, mazuba ayoosika aawo nikutakakubulike ibbwe litakaakuchale atala alilimwi litakabule kuwalilwa aansi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mapenzi aMasukusyo</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mateyu 24:3-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:3-13">Makko 13:3-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Alimwi bakamubuzya kuti, “Muyiisi, ndilili niziyoobawo, mpawo niinzi chiyooba chitondezyo niziyoowamba kuchitika?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />Mpawo wakati, “Ngamuchenjele kuti mutayungwi; nkaambo bayingi bayooza kulindinywe muzina lyangu, kabaamba kuti, ‘Ndiindime Mesiya!’ alimwi, ‘Chiindi chaba afwiifwi!’ Mutakabatobeli pe. <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Mpawo mwaakumvwa nkondo akunyongana, mutakagambwi; nkaambo eezi zintu ziyelede kuyoochitika saansi, pesi mamanino taanoli asika pe.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Eelyo wakati kulimbabo, “Chisi chiyoolwana achisinyina, alimwi bwami buyoolwana abwaminyina; <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />kuyooba muzuzumo mupati munyika, alimwi mumasena asiyenesiyene kuyooba bbalangwe amalwazi; alimwi kuyooba zintu ziyoosya azitondezyo zipati kuzwa kujulu. <verse eid="LUK 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Pesi kakutana kuboobu bayoomuuma akumusonsya, bakamwaabe muzikombelo zyabaJuda amuntolongo, boyoomweeta kunembo lyabami abendeelezi nkaambo kazina lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Eechi chiyooba chiindi chanu mukape bukamboni. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Amuzibambe eezi mumiyeeyo yanu, mutayeeyi mumizeezo yanu kuti muyoovwila kamutyeni; <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Nkaambo ndiyoomupa majwi aayo abusongo, nzibatakwe kuyookonzya basinkondonyokwe kumulwanisya nikuba kukazya. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />Muyoowabwa nikuba abazyali banu abanyoko abamukowa wanu abakulana bako; alimwi bamwi bantu batali baJuda pe bayoojeyegwa; <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />Mpawo muyoosulwa aboonse nkaambo kazina lyangu. <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />Pesi takukwe nuuba muntenga wasusu lilimumitwe yanu liyoonyonyonwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Akukakatila muyoovuna myuuya yanu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaambula Atala Akunyonyoonwa KwaJerusalemu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:15-21">Mateyu 24:15-21</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:14-19">Makko 13:14-19</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Pesi mwaakubona Jerusalemu kazyungulukidwe abasilumamba, ngamukazibe kuti lunyonyoono lwaba afwiifwi. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Eelyo muleke aabo bali muJudiya bakachijile mutulundu amumalundu; alimwi amuleke balimukati lyagunzi bakazwe; mutabazumizyi bali kunze anyika kuti banjile; <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />nkaambo aaya anooli ‘Mazuba akubweedezya,’ kuti zyoonse zyakalembwa zikazuzikizigwe. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Maawe kuli aabo balaamala, alimwi abaabo banyonsya mumazuba aayo! Nkaambo kuyooba mapenzi mapati munyika eeyo, abukali atala abantu aabo; <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />bayoojezegwa apanga, mpawo bayootolwa mubuzike kumanyika woonse; alimwi Jerusalemu uyoolyatulwa abatali baJuda, mane chiindi chabatali baJuda chikazulile.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuboola Kwa Mwana aMuntu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mateyu 24:29-31</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:24-27">Makko 13:24-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />Jesu wakati, “Mpawo kuyooba zitondezyo kuzuba akumweezi akunyeenyezi aanyika manyika ayoowuusa akukatazigwa kukuvuuma kwalwizi amayuwe, <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />bantu bayoosuntuka nkaambo kakuyoowa, abulangizi kuzintu ziyoosya zichiza kunyika; nkaambo inguzu zyamajulu ziyoozunganisigwa. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Mpawo bayoobona Mwana aMuntu kaza mujoba anguzu abulemu bupati. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />Lino mwaakubona eezi zyakutalika kuchitika, mukalange kujulu akubusya mitwe yanu, nkaambo lufutuko lwanu lunoli lwaba afwiifwi.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chiiyo Atala Amukuyu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mateyu 24:32-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 13:28-31">Makko 13:28-31</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Lino Jesu wakaamba chikozyanisyo wati, “Amulange kumusamu wamukuyu, amisamu yoonse; <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />niyasyuuka ndelema, muyoolibonena lwanu kuti mayinza asika. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Alimwi mwaakubona eezi zintu zyachitika, mukazibe kuti bwami bwaLeza bwaba afwiifwi.<verse eid="LUK 21:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Ndamwaambila kasimpe, izyalani eeli talikwe kuyooyiinda pe mane zyoonse zikazulile. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />Ijulu anyika zilayinda, pesi majwi angu takoyooyinda pe.<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuba Abulangilizi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />Ngamuchenjele lwanu kuti myoyo yanu itazundwi mukulyiiba, akukolwa amisalo yabuumi oobu alimwi buzuba oobo bulaza; mbuli kakole. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Nkaambo mbuli kakole buyoosika atala abaabo bakkala atala anyika yoonse. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Pesi ngamuchenjele zyiindi zyoonse, kamukomba kuti mukabe anguzu kuti mukakozye kuleya zintu zyoonse ezi niziyoochitika, akwimikila kunembo lyaMwana aMuntu.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uya Kuchilundu ChamaOlivu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Alimwi mazuba woonse wakalikuyiisya kalimulubuwa bwaŋanda yaLeza; mpawo mansiku wakalikuzwa wakuuwona kuchilundu chitegwa chama Olivu. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />Mpawo bantu boonse bakaza chifumofumo kulubuwa bwaŋanda yaLeza kuti bazomuswiilizye.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbubakamu Belelela</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mateyu 26:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:1">Makko 14:1</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:2">2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Joni 11:45-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Lino ipobwe lyachinkwa chitakwe bumena lyakali lyaba afwiifwi, litegwa ipobwe lyaKwiindilila lyabaJuda. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />Alimwi bapati babapayizi abayiisyi bamulawu bakali kuyanduula nzila yakuti bamujaye biyeni Jesu; nkaambo bakali kuyoowa bantu.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judasi Mbwakazuminina Kwaaba Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mateyu 26:14-16</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:10">Makko 14:10</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:11">11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Eelyo Satani wakanjila muli Judasi Isikkariyoti, wakali umwi wabalikkumi ababili; <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />wakayinka mpawo wakubamba abapati babaPayizi abakapokola baŋanda yaLeza, kuti bamwaabe biyeni kulimbabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Alimwi bakabotelwa kapati, bakazuminana kuti bamupe mali. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Judasi wakazumina, mpawo wakayanduula nzila yakwaaba Jesu, muchiindi nkamu yabantu bayiingi kabatawo pe.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaabaambila Kulya Pobwe lyaKwiindilila</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:17-25">Mateyu 26:17-25</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:12-21">Makko 14:12-21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-30">Joni 13:21-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Eelyo nilyakasika zuba lyapobwe lyaChinkwa Chitakwebumena, awo imbelele lyaKwiindilila niyeelede kupayilwa. <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />Aboobo Jesu wakatuma Pita aJoni, wati, “Kamuya mukatubambile chisusulo chaKwiindilila kuti tukakulye.”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Mpawo bakabuzya bati, “Uyanda kuti tukabambile kuli?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />Wakavwiila wati, “Mwakunjila muchiisi, muyooswana mwaalumi, unotukkide nongo yameenda, mukamutobele muŋanda njatakaakunjile, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />mpawo muyoomwaambila muni aŋanda kuti, ‘Muyiisi wati ilaali ŋanda yabeenzu, oko kundikakulide Pobwe lyaKwiindilila abasikwiiya bangu?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Alimwi uyoomutondezya ŋanda mpati yamujulu, ibambidwe kabotu. Mukatubambile mumo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />Aboobo bakayinka, bakakujana mbuli mbwaakabaambila mpawo bakakujana zyoonse mbuli Jesu mbwaakabaambilila; mpawo bakabaambila kulya Pobwe lyaKwiindilila.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chilyo Cha Mwami</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:26-30">Mateyu 26:26-30</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:22-26">Makko 14:22-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1 BaKkorinte 11:23-25</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Mpawo chiindi nichakasika, Jesu wakakkala abatumwa bakwe aansi atebuli kuti balye. <verse eid="LUK 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />Alimwi wakati kulimbabo, “Ndali achiyandisyo kapati kuti ndilye Pobwe lyaKwiindilila andinywe kanditanaa kupenzegwa pe; <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />nkaambo ndamwaambila, tandikozoolya lubo mane do zikazuzikizigwe mubwami bwaLeza.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Mpawo wakabweza chinywido, mpawo naakamana kulumba Leza, mpawo wakati kulibasikwiiya bakwe, “Amutole eechi chinywido, alimwi mwabane akati kanu; <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />nkaambo ndamwaambila kuti kuzwa lino tandichikwe kuyoonywa lubo pe kumucheelo wamasansa, mane bwami bwaLeza bwakuboola.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />Alimwi wakabweza chinkwa, naakamana kulumba Leza, wachikwamuna, mpawo wakabapa kubasikwiya bakwe, mpawo wakati, “Ooyu mubili wangu wapedwa ndinywe. Kamuchita eechi kamukundiyeeya.” <verse eid="LUK 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Mpawo nibakamana chilalilo, wakati, “Eechi chinywido nchisinizyo chimwakatililwa chizuminano chipya mubulowa bwangu. <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Pesi amulange muntu uyanda kundaaba ulaandime aawa atebuli. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Nkaambo Mwana aMuntu uyoofwa mbuli mbukwakaambwa; pesi maawe kuliyooyo mwaalumi uyoomwaba!”<verse eid="LUK 22:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />Mpawo bakatalika kubuzyaniya umwi awumwi, kuti ngwani akati kabo uyoochichita eechi.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngwani Mupati Akati Kabo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />Kwakaba kukazyaniya lubo akati kabo, kuti ngwani akati kabo uyooba mupati. <verse eid="LUK 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />Mpawo wakati kulimbabo, “Bami babatali baJuda babelesya bwami atala abantu; alimwi abaabo balimubweendelezi kulimbabo balyamba kuti mbaagwasyi. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Pesi teeboobo kulindinywe pe; pesi ooyo mupati loko akati kanu ngabe mbuli muniini loko, alimwi muzulwiidi mbuli umwi ukutawukila. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Nkaambo ngwani mupati, ngooyo na ukkede atebuli, naakuti ooyo ukutawukila? Tali nguwe na ukkede atebuli? Pesi ndili akati kanu mbuli ukutawukila.<verse eid="LUK 22:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />‘Muli baabo balokwinkilila anembo andime mumisunko yangu; <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />alimwi ndamupa nguzu zyakuti mweendelezye, mbuli Taata mbwaakandipa, nguzu zyakweendelezya, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />kuti mukalye akunywa atebuli lyangu mubwami bwangu, mpawo mukakkale azyuuno zyabwami kukuzobeteka mikowa ilikkumi ayibili yaIzirayeli.<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaambila Pita Atala Akumutama</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mateyu 26:31-35</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:27-31">Makko 14:27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Joni 13:36-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />Eelyo Jesu wakati, “Sayimoni, Sayimoni, laanga, Satani wayanda kukusunka, kuti akubbeete mbuli zilyo, <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />pesi ndakukombela kuti lusyomo lwako lutakachilwi; alimwi naa wazunda lubo, usimye banyoko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Alimwi wakati kulinguwe, “Mwami, ndililibambilide kweenda anduwe kuntolongo nikuba kulufu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />Mpawo wakati, “Ndakwaambila, Pita, mukuku tukoyokolika buzuba obuno, mane ukanditame tutatu kuti tundizi pe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kakwama, Chikwama, Apanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />Eelyo Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Nindakamutuma kamutakwe kakwama nikuba chikwama nikuba nsangu, kuli nchimwakabula na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Bakavwiila bati, “Takwe pe,”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Wakati kulimbabo, “Pesi lino, ooyo ujisi kakwama ngabweze, alakwe ulachikwama ngabweze, alimwi ooyo utakwe panga ngawuzye chisamo chakwe awule panga. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Nkaambo ndamwaambila kuti aaya malembe aleelede kuzuzikizigwa mulindime, ‘Mpawo wakabalilizigwa aamwi abasizibi’; nkaambo eecho chakalembwa atala andime chilijisi kuzuzikizigwa kwacho.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />Mpawo bakati, “Laanga, Mwami, ngaya mapanga aabili.” Alimwi wakati kulimbabo, “Kwazulila.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ulakomba Kuchilundu Chama Olivu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mateyu 26:36-46</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:32-42">Makko 14:32-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />Mpawo wakazwa muJerusalemu weenda, mbuli chiyanza chakwe, kuchilundu chama Olivu; alimwi basikwiiya bakwe bakamutobela. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Alimwi naakasika kubusena oobo mbwakaamba kulimbabo wakati, “Kamukomba kuti mutanjili mumisunko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />Alimwi wakazwa akati kabo waya kunembo intamo fwiifwi, mpawo wakafugama wakomba, <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />“Taata, kuti kuyanda, gwisya chinywido eechi kuzwa kulindime; nikubaboobo kutabi kuyanda kwangu, pesi akube kuyanda kwanu.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Mpawo kwakaliboniya mungelo kazwa kujulu, kamusungwazya. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />Alimwi kali mumachise wakakomba changuzu; alimwi matukuta aakwe akaba mbuli madonsi abulowa kaawida aansi anyika.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Alimwi naakabuka kuzwa kukukomba, wakabweeda kulibasikwiiya bakwe waakujana baloona chakuusa, <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />Mpawo wakati kulimbabo, “Monenaanzii? Amubuke mpawo mukombe kuti mutanjili mumisunko.”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwaangwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mateyu 26:47-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:43-50">Makko 14:43-50</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-11">Joni 18:3-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Jesu naakachili kwaambuula, aawo kwakasika inkamu yabantu, amwaalumi utegwa Judasi, umwi wabali kkumi ababili, wakali kubazulida. Wakaswena afwiifwi kuli Jesu kuti amumyonte; <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />pesi Jesu wakati kulinguwe, “Judasi, nga ulawuzya Mwana aMuntu na alumyoonto?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Mpawo bamwi basikwiiya baJesu nibakabona zyakalikunochitika, bakati, “Mwami, tubagonke apanga na?” <verse eid="LUK 22:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />Umwi wabasikwiiya wakabweza panga mpawo wakwazula kutwi lwakululyo lwamulanda wamupayizi mupati.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />Pesi Jesu wakati, “Mutachiti oobu pe!” Mpawo wakajata kutwi kwamwaalumi mpawo wamuponiya.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Eelyo Jesu wakati kumupati wabapayizi abakapokola baŋanda yaLeza abaalu, bakaza kuzoomulwaniya “Mwaza kulindime mbuli baza kumubbi na, amapanga ankoli? <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Nindakali andinywe buzuba abuzuba mulubuwa lwaŋanda yaLeza, taakwe nimwakandijata pe. Pesi eechi nchiindi chanu, anguzu zyamumudima.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Pita Mbwaatama Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:57">Mateyu 26:57</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:58">58</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">69-75</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:53">Makko 14:53</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:54">54</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 14:66-72">66-72</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:12-18">Joni 18:12-18</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">25-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />Eelyo bakamubweza, mpawo bamweeta kuŋanda yamupayizi mupati. Pita wakali kuyabutobela chakulekule; <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />alimwi nibakakutula mulilo akati kalubuwa mpawo kabakkede aansi aamwi, Pita wakkala akati kabo. <verse eid="LUK 22:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />Eelyo mulanda mwanakazi wakabona Pita naakaya kukukkala kumulilo, wakamulangisisya wati, “Ooyu mwaalumi alakwe walaamwi aJesu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Pesi Pita wakakaka, wati, “Yomwanakazi tandimwizi pe me.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Alimwi mukayindi kaniini kwakayinda umwi muntu lubo wakabona wati, “Tuli uumwi wabo na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">Mpawo Pita wakavwiila wati, “Yomwaalumi, tee ndime pe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Mpawo muchiindi chahola limwi umwi wakaza chakukakatila wati, “Kasimpe ooyu mwaalumi alakwe wali aJesu; nkaambo muna Galili alakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />Pesi Pita wakamuvwiila wati, “Yomwaalumi, tandizizi pe ime nzulokwaamba,”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">Mpawowawo nakachili kwaambuula mukuku wakalila. <verse eid="LUK 22:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Mwami wakacheba walanga Pita. Eelyo Pita wakayeeya ijwi lyaMwami, mbuli mbwaakamwaambila kuti, “Uyoonditama tutatu sunu, mukuku kutana kulila pe.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />Mpawo Pita wakazwa anze, alimwi waakulila chamoyo uchisa.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwawelwa Akuumwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:67">Mateyu 26:67</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 26:68">68</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:65">Makko 14:65</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />Lino baalumi bakali kubamba Jesu bakatalika kumuwela alimwi kabalokumuuma; <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />bakamuvumba kumeso kwakwe, bakamuuma kubusyu, mpawo kabali kubuzya kabati, “Sinsima! Kuti ngwani wakuuma?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />Alimwi bakaambuula matusi miingi atala anguwe, kabamutukila.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Kunembo Lyankuta</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 26:59-66">Mateyu 26:59-66</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 14:55-64">Makko 14:55-64</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">Joni 18:19-24</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Nibwakacha, inkuta yabeendelezi babantu abapati babapayizi abayiisyi bamulawu bakabungana aamwi, bakamutola munkuta, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />kabati “Ndunduwe Kkirisitu na? Twaambile.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">Mpawo Jesu wakavwiila wati, “Kuti ndamwaambila tamukwe kuyoondisyoma pe; <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />alimwi kuti ndamubuzya tamukwe kundivwiila pe. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Pesi kuzwa lino, Mwana aMuntu uyookkala kuluboko lwakululyo lwaLeza Singuzu.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />Mpawo boonse bakabuzya bati, “Uli Mwana waLeza na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">Wakavwiila wati, “Mwaamba kabotu kuti ndime.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Alimwi bakati, “Mbukamboni nzi mbutuchiyanduula? Twalimvwiida kuzwa kumulomo wakwe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s">Jesu Kunembo LyaPayileti</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:1">Mateyu 27:1</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:2">2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:1-5">Makko 15:1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Joni 18:28-38</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Eelyo nkamu yoonse yakabuka aamwi, mpawo yakatola Jesu kuli Payileti. <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />Mpawo bakatalika kumutamikizya, kabali kuti, “Twajana mwaalumi ooyu kalokunyonganiya chisi chesu, alimwi kalikutukasya kutela kuliSiza, kalokuti we mwini nguMesiya mwami.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Alimwi Payileti wakamubuzya wati, “Nduwe Mwami wabaJuda na?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">Mpawo wakamuvwiila wati, “Waamba mbubo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Mpawo Payileti wakati kubapayizi bapati ankamu, “Tandijene mulandu pe kumwaalumi ooyu.”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Pesi bakakakatila kapati, kabati, “Wanyoonganiya bantu, kalokubayiisya muJudiya yoonse, kuzwa kuGalili mane kuzosika kubusena obuno.”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Kunembo LyaHerodi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Eelyo Payileti naakamvwa eechi, wakabuzya kuti naakuti mwaalumi ooyu ngwaku Galili? <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />Mpawo naakamvwa kuti ngwankuta yaHerodi, wakamutola kuliHerodi, ooyu wakali muJerusalemu muchiindi eecho. <verse eid="LUK 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Awo Herodi naakabona Jesu, wakakondwa kapati, nkaambo wakalachiyandisyo chakuti amubone muchiindi chilamfu, nkaambo wakali wamvwa mpuwo mpati atala anguwe, wakali kuyanda kubona chitondezyo mpawawo. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Aboobo wakabuzya mumajwi mayiingi asiyenesiyene; pesi Jesu takwe naakamuvwiila. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />Bapati babapayizi abayiisyi bamulawu bakayimikila mpawo kabalo kumutamikizya milandu chabukali. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Mpawo Herodi abasilumamba bakwe bakamusonsya akumuwela; eelyo bakamusamika mudabba uŋayima udula, mpawo bakamubwedezya kuli Payileti. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Alimwi mubuzuba mbuboobo Payileti aHerodi bakabusilizya bweenzunyina bwabo, nkaambo kakutanaba eechi bakali basinkondonyina.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ubetekelwa Lufu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:15-26">Mateyu 27:15-26</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:6-15">Makko 15:6-15</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39-19:16">Joni 18:39—19:16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />Eelyo Payileti wakayita antoomwe bapayizi bapati abeendelezi abantu, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />mpawo wati kulimbabo, “Mwandeetela mwaalumi ooyu mbuli muntu uyuunga bantu kuti balwaniye fulumende wabaRoma; alimwi ndamufunkulula kunembo lyanu mpawo ndajana katakwe mulandu kuli zyoonse nzimwamutamikizya; <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />nikuba Herodi, wamubwedezya kulindiswe. Amulange, taakwe mulandu ngwakachita weelela lufu pe; <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />aboobo ndilamuuma biyo mpawo ndimwaangunune.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />(Nkaambo wakaleelede kubaangunwida mwaange umwi mwaalumi kuPobwe lyaKwindilila.)<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Eelyo bakoompolola boonse ajwi limwi, “Bweza muntu ooyu, mpawo utwangunwide Bbarabbasi!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />Ooyu mwaalumi wakali wawalilwa muntolongo nkaambo kambukila muchisi, akujeya.<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />Payileti wakabayinkiila lubo, kalaachiyandisyo chakwaangununa Jesu; <verse eid="LUK 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />pesi bakayiinkilila anembo kabakoompolola bati, “Ngabambulwe! Ngabambulwe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />Wakabaambila kachitatu wati, “Nkaamboonzi? Bubinzi mbwaachita? Takukwe nindamujanina amulandu weelede lufu pe; nkikaako ndilamuuma biyo, mpawo ndimwaangunune.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Pesi akufwambana, bakaamba ajwi pati, kuti weleede abambulwe. Mpawo jwi lyabo lyakazwidilila. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />Aboobo Payileti wakapa chisubulo chakuti kuchitwe mbuli mbubakalikuyanda. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Wakabaangunwida ooyu mwaalumi wawaalilwa muntolongo nkaambo kambukila akujeya, pesi Payileti wakabapa Jesu ooyu ngubakali kuyanda.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kugankaminwa KwaJesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mateyu 27:32-44</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:21-32">Makko 15:21-32</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Joni 19:17-27</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Alimwi nibakali kumutola, bakajata changuzu umwi mwaalumi utegwa Sayimoni waku Sayirini, wakalizwa kunze anyika, mpawo bakamunyampuzya chiingano, kuti alemunuzye Jesu kalokumutobela.<verse eid="LUK 23:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />Alimwi wakatobelwa ankamu mpati yabantu, abanakazi, aabo bakali kuya bumuliilila akoomoka. <verse eid="LUK 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Pesi Jesu naakacheba kulimbabo wakati, “Nibanakazi bamu Jerusalemu, mutandilili pe, pesi amulilile lwanu abana banu. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Nkaambo laanga, mazuba ayoosika awo mpubaatambe kuti, ‘Balaachoolwe banakazi ngomwa, amada atanaakuzyala pe, ankolo zitakwe zyakanyonkwa pe!’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Eelyo bayotalika kwaamba kuti kuzilundu, ‘Tuwide’; alimwi bayowamba kuti kutulundu, ‘Mutuvumbe.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Nkaambo kuti bachitoobu kumusamu mutete, niinzi chiyoochitika do wayuma?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />Bamwi babili bakali basimulandu, bakatolwa aamwi aJesu kuti bakajeegwe.<verse eid="LUK 23:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Kubusena Butegwa Choompo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />Alimwi nibakasika kubusena butegwa Choompo, nkuunkuko nkubakamugankamina, abasimulandu, umwi kululyo alimwi umwi kulumwensi <verse eid="LUK 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />Mpawo Jesu wakati, “Taata, balekelele; nkaambo tabachizi pe nchibachita.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Mpawo bakawuma chisolo kuti baabane zisamo zyakwe. <verse eid="LUK 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />Alimwi bantu bakaliimvwi afwiifwi, kabamulangide; beendelezi babaJuda bakamuwela kabati, “Wakali kufutula bamwi; ngalifutule, kuti kali Kkirisitu waLeza, Musale!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Basilumamba alabo bakamuwela, kabaza kulinguwe kuti bamupe mundulwe, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />mpawo kabati, “Kuti kuli mwami wabaJuda, lifutule!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />Kwakali bulembo atala lyakwe bwakali lembedwe kuti, “OOYU MWAMI WABAJUDA.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Achingano Amubbi aSikumuwela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Umwi wabasimulandu wakali lengelede wakamutukila, kati, “Tuli Mesiya na? Lifutule mpawo andiswe!”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />Pesi umwi wakamukalalila, kati, “Tuyoowi Leza na iwe, mbukunga ayebo ulimuchisubulo nchicheechi? <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Alimwi iswe twapegwa chisubulo cheelede; nkaambo twajana impundu yakubisya kwesu; pesi ooyu mwaalumi taakwe nchaakabisya pe.” <verse eid="LUK 23:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Mpawo wakati, “Jesu, ukandiyeeye wakuboola mubwami bwako.” <verse eid="LUK 23:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />Alimwi wakati kulinguwe, “Kasimpe, ndakwaambila, sunu unooli andime muParadayisi.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lufu Lwa Jesu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mateyu 27:45-56</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:33-41">Makko 15:33-41</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Joni 19:28-30</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />Chakali chabachiindi chakalanga bweeseme, kwakaba mudima muchisi choonse kuzwa kukalanga bweeseme kuyoosika goko, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />aawo izuba nilyakaleka kubala; mpawo mudabba waŋanda yaLeza wakadeluka akati. <verse eid="LUK 23:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />Eelyo Jesu, wakalila ajwi pati, wakati, “Taata, muuya wangu nduubika mumaanza ako!” Naakamana kwaamba aaya wakayooya chakwelelezya.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />Lino umwi silutwe wabasilumamba naakabona ezyo zyakachitika, wakalumbayizya Leza, wati, “Kasimpe ooyu mwaalumi waliluleme!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Alimwi makamu woonse akabungene nibakaboona zyakachitika, bakabweeda kumuunzi yabo mukuusa. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />Alimwi boonse basikwiiya bakwe abanakazi bakali kuyabumutobela kuzwa Galili bakayimikila kulekule, alimwi bakazibona zintu eezi<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuvwikwa Kwa Jesu Muchibunda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mateyu 27:57-61</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 15:42-47">Makko 15:42-47</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Joni 19:38-42</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50" />Lino kwakali mwaalumi utegwa Jozefu. Wakali umwi wankuta, wakali mwaalumi mubotu, kaluleme, <verse eid="LUK 23:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:51" />ooyo utakwe naakazuminana azeezyo nzibakabambide akuchita. Uzwa kumaJuda wakuchisi chaArimatiya, alimwi wakaza kaliikuyanduula bwami bwaLeza. <verse eid="LUK 23:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ooyu mwaalumi wakayinka kuli Payileti mpawo waakukumbila mutunta waJesu. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Eelyo wakuwangula, mpawo wawuvunga mumudabba uŋayima, alimwi bakawulazika muchibunda lyakali golo, oomo mutakwe mwakalina lazikwa muntu pe. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Bwakali buzuba bwakubambila, mpawo sabata yakalikutalika.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />Banakazi bakali baza awe kuzwa kuGalili bakatobela, bakabona chibunda amutunta wakwe mbuwakalazikwa; <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />eelyo bakabweeda, kuti bakabambile butopozyo atununkilizyo twamubili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:56">Alimwi musabata bakalyokezya mbuli mumulawu.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s">Kubuka KwaJesu Kubafu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mateyu 28:1-8</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:1-7">Makko 16:1-7</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1">Joni 20:1</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 20:11-13">11-13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Pesi mubuzuba butaanzi bwamviiki, chifumofumo, banakazi bakayiinka kuchibunda, kabalikweeta mafuta anunkilila ntubakabambide. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />Mpawo bakajana bbwe kalili lyasunzulisigwa kuzwa achibunda, <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />pesi bakanjila mukati, takukwe nibakawujana mutunta waMwami Jesu. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />Alimwi nibakachili kuzilikila eechi, mpawawo kwakaliboniya baalumi babili kabayimvwi kabasamide midabba uŋayima mbuli kalabi. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />Kabachiyoowede akuvuntamika anyika, pesi baalumi bakati kulimbabo, “Muyandwidaanzi bawuumi akati kabafu? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Tawope aano; wabuka! Mwibawuluke mbwaakamwaambila naakachili andinywe muGalili, <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />kuti Mwana aMuntu weelede kuti akaabwe mumaanza abasizibi alimwi akabambulwe, mpawo mubuzuba bwatatu kuzwa kulufu lwakwe uyoobuka lubo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Eelyo bakayibuluka majwi akwe, <verse eid="LUK 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Lino nibakabweeda kuzwa kuchibunda, bakabaambila zyoonze ezi kuli balikkumi awumwi abamwi boonse. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Lino bakali kuchibunda nguMeri Magadalini aJowana aMeri bayina aJakkobbu abamwi banakazi mbibakalaabo, bakaamba zyoonse eezyo kubasikwiiya. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Pesi majwi aaya kulimbabo akabaanga ntwaano tutakwe lugwasyo pe, nkaambo bakadoneka. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />Pesi Pita, wakabuka, wachijana waya kuchibunda; mpawo naakasika wakanjila wafugama wajana kwachala midabba njibakalimuvungide aayo kicheede; eelyo wakabweeda kumuunzi, kagambide mulinguwe kuti niinzi zyachitika.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lweendo Lwaku Emawusi</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:12">Makko 16:12</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:13">13</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Mubuzuba oobo baalumi babili bakali kuyoobuya kumuunzi utegwa Emawusi, ooyo wakali misinzo wamakkilomita alikkumi alimwi kuzwa kuJerusalemu, <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />bakali kwaambuula atala azyoonse zintu eezi zyakachitika. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Nibakachili kuyoobwaambuula akwiizya, Jesu lwakwe wakasweenya afwiifwi, mpawo wakeenda aabo, <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />pesi meso aabo akalisitikidwe kuti batamuboni pe. <verse eid="LUK 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />Mpawo wakababuzya wati, “Mulokwiizya atala anzi mulweendo lwanu?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Mpawo bakaankamana nkabawuside kapati. <verse eid="LUK 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Eelyo umwi wabo, utegwa Kkilopasi, wakamuvwiila wati, “Nduwe mweenzu awulikke na kuJerusalemu utazi pe zintu zyakachitika ooko mumazuba aaya?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />Alimwi wakababuzya wati, “Nzintuunzi ezyo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Mpawo bakamuvwiila bati, “Atala aJesu waNazareti, ooyo wakali musinsimi wakalaanguzu mujwi mukuchita kunembo lyaLeza akubantu boonse, <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />alimwi aanzila bapati besu babapayizi abeendelezi mbubakamwaaba kuti apegwe chisubulo chalufu akumubambula. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />Pesi twali abulangilizi kuti ngunguwe uyonununa zyalani lyaIzirayeli. Mbubo alimwi kakutali eechi pe, lino ndizuba lyatatu kuzwa mpuzyakachitika zintu eezi. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Atala azezi, bamwi banakazi baankamu yesu batugambya. Bayinka kuchibunda chifumofumo sunu <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />pesi tee bujana pe mutunta waKkirisitu; eelyo baboola kabaamba kuti, babona chilengano chabaangelo balikwaamba kuti muumi. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Bamwi besu mbitwakali aabo bakaya kuchibunda, mpawo bakujana mbuli mbubakaamba banakazi aaba; pesi Jesu tee bakamubona pe.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Mpawo Jesu wakati kulimbabo, “Nubantu bafubafuba, nimulibalenga myoyo kukusyoma zyoonse zyakaambwa abasinsimi! <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Tee zyakeelede na kuti Kkirisitu asukusigwe muzintu eezi, mpawo akanjile mubulemu bwakwe?” <verse eid="LUK 24:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Eelyo kutalikila kumalembe aMozesi akubasinsimi boonse, wakapandulula kulimbabo mumagwalo woonse atala anguwe mwini.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Nibakaswena afwiifwi amuunzi ooyo nkubakali kuya. Jesu wakabaanga mbuli muntu uchiya anembo. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Pesi bakamukumbila kapati, kabati, “Kkala andiswe, nkaambo lyamba kubagoko alimwi zuba lyamana.” Aboobo wakayinka wakukkala ambabo.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Chakulya Chichilaalilo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Naakalikkede atebuli ambabo, wakabweza chinkwa, wakalumba kuliLeza mpawo wakwamuna, wakabapa. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Alimwi meso aabo akajulika, bakamuziba; mpawo wakabulika kubusyu bwabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />Mpawo bakaambila chabochabo bati, “Myoyo yesu teeyalikupya pe, naakachili kwaambuula andiswe munzila, anali kujula malembe kulindiswe?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Ubweeda KuJerusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />Lino bakanyampuka aawo babweeda kuJerusalemu; baakujana balikkumi awumwi kababungene aamwi, antoomwe abaabo boonse mbibakalaabo. <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />Bakabaambila bati, “Mwami wabuka nichoonzyo, alimwi waliyubununa kuli Sayimoni!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Uliyubununa Kulibasikwiiya Bakwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Mpawo bakabaambila zyakachitika munzila, ambwaakazibikana amukukwamuna chinkwa.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Kuliyubununa Kuli Basikkwiya Bakwe</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 28:16-20">Mateyu 28:16-20</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:14-18">Makko 16:14-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19-23">Joni 20:19-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-8">Inchito 1:6-8</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Nibakachili kwaambuula eechi, Jesu alakwe wakayimikila akati kabo, mpawo wakabaambila wati, “Luumuno alube andinywe.”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Pesi bakaankamana alimwi bakazula buyoofu, bakabaanga babona cheelo.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cheelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(musangu)</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 24:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />Mpawo wakababuzya wati, “Nkaamboonzi nimulikatazya? Alimwi nkaamboonzi nimwaba amizeezo myiingi mumyoyo yanu? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Ngamulange maboko angu amawulu angu, kuti ndiindime choonzyo; ngamundijate, ngamumvwe; nkaambo cheelo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">24:39 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">cheelo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">(musangu)</char></note> takwe nyama amafuwa, mbuli mbumundibwene ndilaawo.”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Mpawo naakamana kwaambuula, wakabatondezya maboko amawulu akwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Alimwi nibakachili kudoneka nkaambo kalukondo amukugambwa wakababuzya wati, “Mulaachakulya na?” <verse eid="LUK 24:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />Alimwi bakamupa chimpanzi chamuswi wakajikidwe. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Mpawo wakabweza, walya kabamubwene.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muli Bakamboni Bangu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Lino wakabaambila wati, “Ngiimajwi ngindakamwaambila, nindakachili andinywe, kuti zyoonse ezi zyeelede kuzuzikizigwa zilembedwe mumulawu waMozesi, akubasinsimi amuntembawuzyo atala andime.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Mpawo wakabajula boongo bwabo kuti bakonzye kumvwiisisisya malembe, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />Lino wakabaambila wati, “Kuli lembedwe, kuti zileelede kuti Kkirisitu akapenzegwe, mpawo uyoobuka kuzwa kubafu mubuzuba bwatatu, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />Mpawo kuti kusanduka akulekelelwa kwazibi kuleelede kukambawukwa muzina lyakwe kubantu bamusyobo yoonse, kutalikila muchisi chaJerusalemu. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Lino andinywe muli bakamboni bazintu eezi. <verse eid="LUK 24:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />Lino ngamulange, ndilamutumina chisyomezyo chaTaata alindinywe; pesi mukkale muchisi, mane mukasamikwe anguzu zizwa kujulu.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jesu Mbwaatolwa Kujulu</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19">Makko 16:19</ref>,<ref loc="MRK 16:20">20</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:9-11">Inchito 1:9-11</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Mpawo wakazwa weenda aabo mane bakuusika kuBbetani, eelyo wakanyampula maboko akwe mpawo wakabalongezya. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Lino muchiindi naakali kubalongezya, wakeenda, wakabwezegwa ajoba waya kujulu. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Mpawo bakamukomba, alimwi bakabweeda kuJerusalemu mulukondo lupati, <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />mpawo bakayinkiilila anembo muŋanda yaLeza, kabalumbayizya akutembawula Leza.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>